<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Nouveau Testament Havu</book>
  <para style="h">LUUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu Kirisitu nk'oku Luuka aguyandikaga</para>
  <para style="mt2">oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu Kirisitu nk'oku</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUUKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">aguyandikaga</para>
  <para style="imt">Entangiriro</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinoola gitaabu buli buhindusi bw'oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu Kirisitu, nk'oku Luuka aguyandikaga. Omu Gihango Gihyaahya muli bindi bitaabu bisharhu biyirikirwe «Mwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu Kirisitu»: Matayo, Mariko na Yohaana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuka arhaliiri Muyaahudi. Arhaliiri mu zila ntumwa ekumi n'ebiri za Yeesu Kirisitu, aliko agendaga aherekeza entumwa Paawulo omu mbalamo zaage n'okumugwasa omu kaasi kaage. Kandi Luuka ye wayandikaga egitaabu ch'eBijiro by'eNtumwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuka arhonderaga echi gitaabu omu gushonda kubala bwinja byooshi biyerekeeze Yeesu. Ayandikiraga eyi myaazi muntu muguma oyirikwa Teofiile, eyi ashondere amenye okuli kuyerekeere akalamo ka Yeesu. Aliko egitaabu chaage kileerhere omwazi gwa Yeesu oku bagisoma booshi, n'okubalaalika bamuyemeere. Aderhere binene biyerekeere obuzigire bwa Yeesu, hanene obuzigire bwage oku bakene, ababonereerwe, abakazi n'abantu bali omu lubungo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Omu chigabi girhanzi ch'omurhondero gw'egitaabu chaage, Luuka ashambeere okuburhwa kwa Yohaana Mubatiiza, okuburhwa kwa Yeesu n'okubiruka kwage. Abalire gurhe Mariya, Zakariya na Simeooni bamogeraga obukuuze bwa Nnamahanga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-2:52">1.1–2.52</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuka ashuba kuyeerekana gurhe Yohaana Mubatiiza ayinjaga gurheganyiza Yeesu enjira, gurhe oyoola Yohaana abatiizaga Yeesu na gurhe Shetaani amugeregezaga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-4:13">3.1–4.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buzinda bw'aho, Luuka ayerekeene ebi Yeesu ajiraga omu gihugo ch'eGalilaaya: ayigiriize eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'ogufumya abalwala (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Enyuma w'aho, Luuka ayerekeene Yeesu arhenga eGalilaaya n'okuja eYerusaleema. Mw'echi chigabi ch'egitaabu chaage, Luuka aderhere bweneene ebintu birhali omu bindi bitaabu bisharhu by'oMwazi Mwinja. Ebyo bintu biri mo binene Yeesu ayigiriize n'emigani eri nka ey'oMusamariya mwinja, omuchire muhwinja n'omusole w'aliherere anashuba kubonekana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:28">9.51–19.28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buzinda, Luuka aderhere elugulu w'ebi Yeesu ajiraga eYerusaleema n'ebi ayigirizaga yo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:29-21:38">19.29–21.38</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ashuba kuderha ebiyerekeere amalibuko n'ogufa kwa Yeesu (Chigabi cha makumyabiri na kabiri guhika echa makumyabiri na gasharhu). Buzinda, aderha elugulu w'obufuuke bwa Yeesu na gurhe achiyeerekanaga oku bigirizwa baage. Amalire egitaabu chaage omu kuderha ebiyerekeere Yeesu kuzamuukira empingu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24.1-53</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Entangiriro y'emyaazi y'egitaabu cha Luuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Waliha Teofiile, bantu banene bachihangaanire kuyandika emyaazi ya byooshi byagerere ahagarhi keerhu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Abayandikaga, babibalire nk'oku rhwabalirwaga n'abalibibwene ko gurhenga oku ntangiriro, banahinduka bakozi b'eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nchimala gushonda n'okubaza kw'eyi myaazi yooshi, byansimiisize naani nkubalire yo gurhenga oku ntangiriro ya yo. Bobunoola waliha Teofiile nkuyandikiire yo bwinjabwinja. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Njirire ntyo y'omenya okuli kw'enyigirizo wayankiriire.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malahika abala omwazi g'okuburhwa kwa Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Amango <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> aliiri mwami w'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char>, haliiri <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">mudaahwa</char> muguma oyirikwa Zakariya, muguma w'omu badaahwa b'echigusho cha Abiya. Mukaage aliiri muguma w'omu banyere ba <char style="w" lemma="Haruuni:">Haruuni</char>, ayirikwaga Luzabeeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Oku bali babiri balikwaneene embere za Nnamahanga. Babaaga bakenga bwinja amarhegeko mooshi ma Nnaweerhu n'okujira nk'oku aderhere. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Aliko, nta mwana baligwerhe, kwenge Luzabeeti aliiri ngumba na kandi eyi booshi babaaga bakola bashaaja.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lusiku luguma, Zakariya aliiri akola akaasi kaage k'obudaahwa embere za Nnamahanga, kwenge chaali gihe ch'echigusho chaage. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Gukulikirana n'emicho y'obudaahwa, alondoolwa kuja omu Nju ya Nnaweerhu gusireeza obubaani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Amango Zakariya aliiri gusireeza obubaani, echigusho ch'abemeezi baliiri embuga omu masaala. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" /><char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">Malahika</char> wa Nnaweerhu amuhulukira, ayimanga emalyo w'entuuliro y'obubaani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya abeere amubona, ashalama n'okuyuubaha bweneene. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Malahika amubwira ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">«Zakariya, orhayuubahaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">kwenge Nnamahanga ayunviirhe esaala lyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">na mukaawe Luzabeeti akuburhira omwana w'obuzaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">Nj'omuhe eziino lya Yohaana.<verse eid="LUK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nji wagwarha obusiime n'omwishingo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:14">N'abantu banene nji bamogera okuburhwa kwage.<verse eid="LUK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Kwenge nj'aba mukulu embere za Nnaweerhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">Arhakanywa divaayi changwa amaavu makalihire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">Gurhengera omu nda ya nyina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">nj'aba ey'ayunjwizwe Muuka-Mutagatiifu.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nj'agalula aBaisraheeli banene emwa Nnaweerhu, Nnamahanga waabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nj'agenda embere za Nnaweerhu haguma n'omurhima n'obuhashe bwa <char style="w" lemma="Eliya:">Eliya</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">y'agalula haguma abaana n'abazeere baabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">Nj'ahindamula abagome yi bagwarha obwenge nk'abakwaneene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">Ntyo, arheganyiziza Nnaweerhu olubaga lurheganyizwe bwinja.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="MAL 3:23-24">Malaaki 3.23-24</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">changwa Malaaki 4.5-6 omu Bibuliya z'ezindi ndimi.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya abaza <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> ntya: «Gichi nji charhuma naamenya oku ebyoola biri by'okuli? Nyoono nkola ndi mushaaja na mukaani akola mugeekulu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Malahika amushubiza ntya: «Nyoono nye Gabriyeeri, nyimanga embere za Nnamahanga, ntumirwe gukubwira n'ogukubalira ogu mwazi mwinja. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Aliko yunva, waaba nyamugama. Orhakaderha kugera olusiku eyi myaazi nji yaaba okwenge orhayemereere eyi myaazi yaani, nji yaaba omu mango maayo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mw'ebyo bishanji olo lubaga lwaliiri kulinga Zakariya lwasoomerwa okubona alegamire omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Abeere ahuluka, arhachigalaga kuganiira nabo. Aliiri kubasimira n'ebishushanyo, ayoorha nyamugama. Baava bamenya oku abonekeerwe omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Esiku za Zakariya z'ogukola zabeere zaahwa, agaluka emwage.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Enyuma w'ezo siku, mukaage Luzabeeti aheeka obukule. Amala myeezi erhaano burhahuluka n'okuderha ntya: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Tala oku Nnaweerhu anjiriire: asimiisizwe kunkuula ko ehyagendaga hyankoza eshoni ahagarhi k'abantu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malahika abala omwazi g'okuburhwa kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Obukule bwa Luzabeeti bwabeere buli bwa myeezi ndarhu, <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> Gabriyeeri arhumwa na Nnamahanga omu gishagala ch'eGalilaaya chiyirikwa Nazareeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Amurhuma oku munyere orhazimenya abalume. Oyo munyere ali ashambaazizwe n'omurhabana oyirikwa Yozefu w'omu mulala gwa mwami <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>. Eziino ly'oyo munyere lyaliiri Mariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Malahika abeere aja omu mwabo oyo munyere, amubwira ntya: «Nkulamwise, obe n'omwishingo, w'eyunjwire n'omugisho, bulaala Nnaweerhu ali haguma naawe.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya abeere ayunva echo chinwa, chamushalamya. Achiibaza bichi okulamuswa ntyo kuderhere. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Malahika amubwira ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:30">«Mariya, orhayuubahaga kwenge wabwene omugisho embere za Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Tala, waaba bukule.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:31">Waburha omuzaana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:31">n'eziino lyaage wamuyirika Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nj'aba mukulu na nj'ahamagalwa Mugala wa Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:32">Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga nj'amuha entebe y'obwami bw'eshekuliza <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>.<verse eid="LUK 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nj'arhegeka enju ya Yakobo esiku n'amango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:33">n'obwime bwage burhagahwa.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya abaza <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> ntya: «Gurhe ebiila nji byagalikana na nta mulume nyinji?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malahika amushubiza ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">«Muuka-Mutagatiifu nj'akuyandagalira ko n'obuhashe bwa Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene nji bwagushukulira n'egichuuchu chaabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">Chi nji charhuma n'omwana waaburhwa nj'aba mutagatiifu; nj'ahamagalwa Mugala wa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tala oku na Luzabeeti w'omu mulala gwawe, naye ali bukule b'omwana w'obuzaana omu bugeekulu bwage. Ola wayirikwaga ngumba, mwezi gwa ndarhu guno ali bukule. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwenge ntaacho girhakagalika emwa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya ava aderha ntya: «Nyoono ndi muja wa Nnaweerhu, byooshi bimbeere nk'oku oderhere.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">Ho n'aho <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> amuleka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariya alambagirira Luzabeeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Omu siku zakulikiraga, Mariya agenda jubaajuba, aja omu gishagala chiguma ch'emisozi omu gihugo ch'eYudeeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aja omu nju ya Zakariya, alamusa Luzabeeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Luzabeeti abeere ayunva endamuso ya Mariya, omwana ashambagarha omu nda yaage. Luzabeeti ayunjuzwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Aliika omulenge munene elugulu n'okuderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:42">«Ogishirwe omu bakazi booshi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:42">n'omwana oli omu nda yawe agishirwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nyoono ndi nde okuderha mpu nyina wa Nnaweerhu andambagirire? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tala okw'amango nayunvaga omulenge g'okulamusa kwawe omu marhwi maani, omwana oli omu nda yaani amashambagarha n'obushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ogishirwe kwenge wayemereere oku Nnaweerhu ajira eby'akulaganyaga.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olwimpo lwa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariya ava aderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Omurhima gwani gukuuze Nnaweerhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Na kandi gwayunjwire n'omwishingo elugulu wa Nnamahanga, Muchunguzi waani.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kwenge alolere n'olukogo obwirhondesi b'omuja waage.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Gurhengera buno abantu ba ngasi gihe bagenda bampamagala mugishwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwenge Nnamahanga Ogala Byooshi anjiriire ebintu binja binene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Eziino lyaage liri litagatiifu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ngasi mango ajira obubabale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">oku bamuyuubaha.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kugerera emisi y'okuboko kwage,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">ashandeeze abantu b'omurhima gw'erumerume.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Akuulire abantu b'emisi oku ntebe zaabo z'obwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">n'okuzamuula abirhondesi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Abaliiri nzara abayunjwize n'ebikulo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">n'abachire abagalwire maboko moomu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Agwasize omukozi waage Israheeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">arhayibiriraga kuyeerekana obubabale bwage<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nk'oku alaganyaga bashookuluza beerhu, <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char> n'omulala gwage esiku n'amango.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya abeera haguma na Luzabeeti emyeezi yakagera kw'esharhu. Buzinda agaluka emwabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuburhwa kwa Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Egihe ch'okuburha cha Luzabeeti chagera ho, aburha omwana w'obuzaana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Abatuuranyi na beene baabo Luzabeeti babeere bamenya oku Nnaweerhu amuyerekere obubabale bwage, basiima n'ogushagaluka haguma naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Hagerere siku munaane aburhire, bayinja <char style="w" lemma="Nkembuulo:">gukembuula</char> omwana n'ogushonda kumuyirika eziino ly'eshe Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Aliko nyina aderha ntya: «Nanga, ayirikwe Yohaana.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamubwira ntya: «Oku ntaaye omu mulala gwenyu ogwerhe eri ziino!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Baabaza eshe bugamagama ntya: «Gurhe oshondere omwana waawe ayirikwage?» <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya ahema bamuleerhere ehipaho, ayandika ko ntya: «Eziino lyaage ye Yohaana.» Booshi basoomerwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ho n'aho obuunu bwage bwabumbuulwa n'olulimi lwage lwashwekuulwa, arhondera kuderha n'ogukuuza Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Abatuuranyi baage booshi bagwarhwa n'obuuba. Eyoola myaazi yooshi yalambagizwa omu misozi yooshi y'egihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Booshi bayunvaga ogo mwazi baalema bakengeera n'oguchiibaza ntya omu mirhima yaabo: «Leero oyu mwana nj'aba muntu muchi?» Kwenge okuboko kwa Nnaweerhu kwaliiri haguma naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olwimpo lwa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Eshe Zakariya ayunjuzwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu, aleeba ntya:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Nnaweerhu agishwe, Nnamahanga w'olubaga lw'eIsraheeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">kwenge ayinjire gurhabaala n'oguchungula olubaga lwage.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Arhulerheere omuchunguzi w'obuhashe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">gurhengera omu mulala g'omukozi waage <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />nk'oku anabiderhaga gurhengera miira kugerera abaleebi baage batagatiifu oku<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />arhushwekuula oku banzi beerhu n'ogurhukuula omu maboko m'abarhushomba booshi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.71 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 18:18">Nanga 18.18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ayerekeene obubabale bwage oku ba daarha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">n'okuyibuka <char style="w" lemma="Gihango:">egihango</char> chaage gitagatiifu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nnamahanga ajirire ntyo gukulikiza endahiro alahizizaga shookuluza weerhu <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Eyo ndahiro yali y'ogurhukuula omu maboko m'bashombanyi beerhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">yi rhumukolera buzira buuba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />yi rhuba batagatiifu n'abakwaneene omu meesho maage esiku zooshi z'akalamo keerhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Naawe mwana waani, nji wahamagalwa muleebi wa Nnamahanga w' Elugulu Bweneene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kwenge nji wayinja nka murhumwa wa Nnaweerhu omu gurheganya enjira yaage,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />yi nj'amenyesa olubaga lwage obuchunguke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">omu kubabalira ebyaaha byaabo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />kugerera obubabale bwa Nnamahanga weerhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Kugerera obo bubabale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Nnamahanga arhukoleezeza ezuuba gurhengera elugulu,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />y'akoleezeza abayikeere omu mwizimya n'omu gichuuchu ch'olufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">n'okuyerekeza amagulu meerhu omu njira y'omurhuula.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogukula kwa Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Oyo mwana agendekera gukula n'okugwarha omurhima guzibuhire. Abeera omu mpinga kugera amango m'oguchiyeerekana oku lubaga lw'eIsraheeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Okuburhwa kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mw'amo mango omwami mukulu w'aBarooma oyirikwa <char style="w" lemma="Kayizaari:">Kayizaari</char> Ogisitu aleerha erhegeko liderhere oku abantu booshi baganjwe omu bihugo byooshi by'obwami bwage. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Olu luganjo lwambere lwaba amango Kureniyo aliiri murhegesi w'egihugo ch'eSuriya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Suriya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">chaliiri gihugo ch'obulagiirire emalambo m'eGalilaaya (2.4). Hali amango maguma-maguma, omurhegesi w'eSuriya aligwerhe oburhegesi oku bihugo by'eYudeeya n'eGalilaaya.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Abantu booshi bagenda guchiyandikiisa ngasi muguma omu gishagala ch'akavukiiro kaage. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yozefu naye arhenga omu gishagala ch'eNazareeti ch'omu Galilaaya. Achiyeerekeza omu gihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> omu gishagala omwami <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> aburhwaga mo chiyirikwa Beteleheemu. Kwenge aliiri w'omu mulala gwa Daawudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Aja yo guchiyandikiisa haguma na Mariya mushambaaza waage. Na Mariya ey'ali bukule.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Oku bali eBeteleheemu, olusiku lwage l'okuburha lwagera ho. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Aburha omugala w'efula. Amuyambisa engobi, amulyaamiza omu hikenzi hy'okuliisiza mo ebirhungano, kwenge nta hantu haalichiri ho omu nju y'okuyankirira abahiisi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abangere babonekerwa na malahika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 2:1-15">Matayo 2.1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mw'echo gihugo mwaliiri abangere bagendaga balaala balanga obuso bwabo omu mashwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" /><char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">Malahika</char> wa Nnaweerhu ava ababonekera. Obulangashane bwa Nnaweerhu bwabamolekera. Bayuubaha bweneene. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Aliko malahika ababwira ntya: «Murhayuubahaga, kwenge mbalerheere oMwazi Mwinja, gwashagalusa bweneene abantu booshi. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Omu budufu bwa zeene, oMuchunguzi wenyu aburhirwe omu gishagala cha <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>: ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />N'echimenyeeso cheechi: mwashimaana enjolyaana eyambiiswe engobi, ey'elyamiizwe omu hikenzi hy'okuliisiza mo ebirhungano.» <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ho n'aho, echigusho chinene cha bamalahika gurhenga empingu chabugaana ola malahika, baliiri guharamya Nnamahanga n'okuderha ntya:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Obukuuze bunene emwa Nnamahanga omu mpingu z'elugulu bweneene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">n'oku gulu, obuholo omu bantu baage asimiiswa nabo!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abangere baja eBeteleheemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">Bamalahika</char> babeere babaleka n'okugaluka empingu, abo bangere babwirana ntya: «Boonabuno, rhuje eBeteleheemu kulola ebyabeere yo, ebi Nnaweerhu arhumenyeesize.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Baaja yo jubaajuba. Bashigaana Mariya na Yozefu n'omwana ey'alyaamire omu hikenzi hy'okuliisiza mw'ebirhungano.<figure style="fig" alt="Marie, Joseph et l'enfant Jésus visité par les bergers" file="CN01623b.tif" size="span" ref="2.16">Mariya, Yozefu n'enjolyaana Yeesu barhangulwa n'abangere</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Babeere baabona enjolyaana, baabala ebi malahika abwiraga bo elugulu w'oyo mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Booshi bayunvaga ebi abangere baderhaga basoomerwa bweneene. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mariya yeewe aliiri kubiika ebyo byooshi oku murhima gwage n'ogukengeera bichi biderhere. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Abangere nabo bagaluka eyi bali bakuuza Nnamahanga n'okumuharamya oku byooshi bayunvire n'okubona ko nk'oku balibwirirwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omwana akembuulwa n'oguhaabwa eziino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Habeere hagera siku munaane omwana aburhirwe, <char style="w" lemma="Nkembuulo:">bamukembuula</char>, bamuyirika Yeesu, ly'eziino <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> ali amuyirikire embere nyina aheeke obukule.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okumolekwa kwa Yeesu omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Amango esiku zayeneraga z'ogucheesibwa nk'oku <char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">eRhegeko</char> lya <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> lyaaliderhere, Yozefu na Mariya baava bazamuukira eYerusaleema kuyeerekana omwana emwa Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Bulaala biyandikirwe ntya omu Rhegeko lya Nnaweerhu: «Ngasi mwana w'obuzaana nji waaburhwa w'olubere, arhuulwe emwa Nnaweerhu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 13:2">Lubunguluko 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 18:15-16">Migani 18.15-16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Balikwaneene guhaana entuulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hanoola eri ntuulo y'ogusireezwa. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="LEV 12:8">Balaawi 12.8</ref>. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Entungulu eri nyunyi y'obuuko bw'eguuku.</char></note> ehemerwe mw'elyo Rhegeko lya Nnaweerhu: «Maguuku mabiri changwa enyunyi ebiri z'entungulu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simeooni akuuza Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Haliiri muntu muguma eYerusaleema oyirikwa Simeooni. Aliiri muntu okwaneene embere za Nnamahanga n'okumukenga. Aliiri kulinga owarhulereza Israheeli, na Muuka-Mutagatiifu aliiri haguma naye. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Muuka-Mutagatiifu ali mubwirire oku arhagafiire arhaza kubona <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> wa Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simeooni ava aja omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> eyi ayerekeezwe na Muuka-Mutagatiifu. Amango ababusi ba Yeesu bamuleerhaga kujira eby'<char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">eRhegeko</char> lihemere, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeooni amurhoola omu maboko maage, akuuza Nnamahanga n'okuderha ntya:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Nnaweerhu wajirire nk'oku walaganyaga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">okola wakaleka omuja waawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">afe n'omurhuula nka okw'echinwa chaawe chiderhere.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwenge nachibweneere obuchunguke bwawe n'ameesho maani.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Obu buchunguke warheganyaga embere za ngasi lubaga,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />b'obumoleke nji bwakumenyesa oku bapagaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">Na kandi nji bwaba bukuuze bwa Israheeli, lubaga lwawe.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obuleebi bwa Simeooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Eshe na nyina wa Yeesu basoomerwa n'ebi Simeooni aliiri kuderha elugulu w'omwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeooni abagisha n'okubwira Mariya nyina wa Yeesu ntya: «Oyu mwana ali ho yi bantu banene barhoge n'abandi bayinamuke omu Israheeli. Nj'aba chimenyeeso charhenga emwa Nnamahanga, banene nji bachilahira. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Na ntyo, nj'abishuula enkengeero zibishirwe omu mirhima ya banene. Naawe Mariya, nji wababala bweneene omu murhima gwawe nk'ogwachumirhirwe n'akeere.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omuleebi w'omukazi Haana abala emyaazi y'omwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Haliiri omuleebi-kazi muguma oyirikwa Haana, mwali wa Fanuweeri, w'omu mulala gwa Haseeri. Oyo Haana abaaga akola mugeekulu wa myaaka minene. Abaaga amalama myaaka mushanvu yonyine n'eba gurhengera ogushabwa kwage, buzinda bwaho eba afa. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Alibeerere mushumbakazi, guhika amango ageraga omu myaaka makumi gali munaane n'ene. Abaaga arharhenga omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>, aliko ey'anakolera Nnamahanga ezuuba n'obudufu omu guchiibuza kulya n'omu kugenda asaliira. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Naye agera ho mw'ebyo bishanji n'okuva ahwanza gusiimiriza Nnamahanga. Booshi baliiri kulingiriza oguchungulwa kwa Yerusaleema, abalira bo elugulu w'oyo mwana.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abazeere ba Yeesu bagaluka eNazareeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Abazeere ba Yeesu babeere bamala kujira nk'oku <char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">eRhegeko</char> lya Nnaweerhu lihemere, bagaluka naye eGalilaaya omu gishagala chaabo ch'eNazareeti.<verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Oyo mwana Yeesu aliiri gukula n'okugwarha emisi. Aliyunjwire n'obwenge bunene, n'omugisho gwa Nnamahanga gwaliiri haguma naye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Ngasi mwaka, abazeere ba Yeesu bagendaga baja eYerusaleema oku lusiku lukulu lwa <char style="w">Paasaka</char>.<verse eid="LUK 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yeesu abeere agwarha myaaka ekumi n'ebiri, bazamuukira yo naye gukulikirana n'emicho y'olusiku lukulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Olusiku lukulu lwa Paasaka lwabeere lwahwa, bafuluka. Aliko omwana Yeesu asigala eYerusaleema. Ababusi baage barhamenyaga chiro. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Baliiri gukengeera oku nkabaga Yeesu ali haguma n'abandi bantu baliiri nabo omu lugenzi. Balambagira ezuuba lyooshi. Baja barhondera kumushonda ahagarhi ka beene baabo n'abantu babayinji. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Aliko barhamubonaga. Baava bagaluka eYerusaleema eyi bali bamushonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Buzinda bwa siku esharhu, bamushimaana omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> ayikeere ahagarhi k'abigiriza b'eRhegeko lya Nnamahanga. Aliiri kubayunviriza n'okubabaza ebibazo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Booshi baliiri kumuyunviriza basoomererwa obwenge bwage n'ebishubizo aliiri guhaana. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ababusi baage babeere bamubona, baashalama. Nyina amubwira ntya: «Mwana waani, charhumire warhujira ntya? Yisho haguma naani rhwaliiri kugushonda n'obuuba.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Gichi charhumaga mwanshonda? Ka murhamenyere oku nkwaneene kuba omu Nju ya Daarha?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Aliko barhayunvaga ech'aliiri kubabwira. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yeesu achima nabo eNazareeti. Aliiri kubakenga. Nyina aliiri kubiika ebyo binwa byooshi omu murhima gwage.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yeesu aliiri gukula omu bwenge bunene, omu bule n'omu migisho embere za Nnamahanga n'abantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Enyigirizo za Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-6">Matayo 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-6">Mariko 1.2-6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-23">Yohaana 1.19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Omu mwaka gw'ekumi na garhaano g'oburhegesi bw'omwami mukulu w'aBarooma <char style="w" lemma="Kayizaari:">Kayizaari</char> Tiberiyo, Ponsiyo Pilaato aliiri mwimangizi w'egihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char>. Na <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> aliiri mwimangizi w'egihugo ch'eGalilaaya na mwene waabo oyirikwa Firipo omu gihugo ch'eItureya na ech'eTarakoniiti. Lisaniya naye aliiri mwimangizi w'egihugo ch'eHabileeni. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Hanaasi na Kayaafa bo baliiri <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">bakulu b'abadaahwa</char>. Mwamo mango, echinwa cha Nnamahanga chahikira Yohaana mugala wa Zakariya omu mpinga.<verse eid="LUK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohaana agera omu bihugo byooshi byalitureene n'olwinji lw'eYorodaani. Aliiri kuyaamagaza ntya: «Muleke ebyaaha byenyu, <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">mubatiizwe</char> yi Nnamahanga ababalira.» <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Na ntya byaava byaagera ho eby'omuleebi Isaya ayandikaga omu gitaabu chaage mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Muntu muguma ali ahamagaza omu mpinga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Murheganye enjira ya Nnaweerhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Mumujirire enjira zilambuukire!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ngasi lubanda nji lwayunjuzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ngasi musozi na ngasi hirhondo nji byalambuulwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ngasi rukumba lw'enjira nji lwagonyoolwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Enjira zibiihire nji zalambuulwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na ngasi muntu nj'abona obuchunguke Nnamahanga ahaana.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isaya 40.3-5</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">luyandikirwe omu mandiko ma miira m'ekigiriki.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amahano ma Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:7-10">Matayo 3.7-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Abantu banene bayinja emwa Yohaana mpu <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">ababatiize</char>. Alema ababwira ntya: «Mwe buuko bw'enjoka, nde wabayigiriize guchilanga oku buhane bwayinjire? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Leero, muleme mwayeerekana kugerera ebijiro binja oku mwalekere ebyaaha byenyu. Murhachibwiraga mpu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char> ali shookuluza weerhu.› Kwenge mbabwirire oku Nnamahanga agakoleesa ama mabaale n'okumajira baana ba Abrahaamu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Embasha ekola eri hoofu guchiira emirhi oku mizi. Nkaasi murhi gurhayeezeze amalehe menja, gwachiibwa n'ogukabulwa omu muliro.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oguhindamuka looshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Abantu baliiri kumubaza ntya: «Gichi rhujaage rhwajira?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Abashubiza ntya: «Ogwerhe simiisi ebiri agwasizwe guhaana nguma okw'orhayigwerhe. Ogwerhe ech'okulya naye ajire ntyo.» <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Ab'<char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">ogufurhiisa amakooli</char> nabo bayinja <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">kubatiizwa</char>. Baabaza Yohaana ntya: «Mwigiriza, bichi rhukwaneene kujira?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ashubiza bo ntya: «Murhahoreesaga binene kulusha ebi murhegekerwe guhoreesa.» <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Abasoda nabo baamubaza ntya: «Neerhu, bichi rhukwaneene kujira?» Ashubiza bo ntya: «Murhanyagaga omuntu ehyaage changwa gusidaaka omuntu oku bushaabusha. Aliko musimiiswe n'omukamarho gwenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohaana Mubatiiza abala omwazi g'owayinjire</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:11-12">Matayo 3.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Mariko 1.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:24-28">Yohaana 1.24-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Olubaga lwaliiri kulingiriza n'obulangaalire, ngasi muguma aliiri gukengeera omu murhima gwage oku nkabaga Yohaana ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohaana abwira bo ntya: «Nyoono ndi <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">nababatiiza</char> omu menji; aliko owayinja agwerhe obuhashe kundusha. Ntakwaneene chiro gushwekuula omugozi gw'ebiraato byaage. Yeewe nj'ababatiiza na Muuka-Mutagatiifu, n'omu muliro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Afarhire omu fune zaage engooko y'okuyeera, abiiza echibuga chaage; ahira amahemba olwage lunda n'emyaavu olwage lunda. Nj'agusha amahemba omu nguli yaage, sy'aliko nj'ayoosa emyaavu omu muliro gurhazima chiro n'ehityu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogushwekwa kwa Yohaana Mubatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Matayo 14.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mariko 6.17-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohaana ayigiriza olubaga oMwazi Mwinja omu kubaheereza ezindi nyigirizo zinene z'okubaseeza omurhima.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Aliko Yohaana akalihira <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char>, wali yimire omu gihugo ch'eGalilaaya, kwenge aliyingiire Herodiya muka mwene waabo, n'okwenge abaaga ey'akolere ebindi bijiro binene bibiihire. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Kw'ebyo byooshi, Heroode ayongeera ko echindi chijiro chibi ch'oguhiriisa Yohaana omu munyororo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okubatiizwa kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariko 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:29-34">Yohaana 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Abantu booshi babeere bamala <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">kubatiizwa</char>, Yeesu naye abatiizwa. Olo lusiku, oku Yeesu ali gusaliira, empingu yagichinguula, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Muuka-Mutagatiifu amugwirira ko omu shusho ly'eguuku. Omulenge gwayunviikana ntya gurhengera empingu: «Oli Mugala waani muzigirwa; nsimiisizwe nawe bweneene.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Nanga 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isaya 42.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Egisisi cha Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1.1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Amango Yeesu arhonderaga kuyigiriza, aligwerhe emyaaka yakagera ku makumyaasharhu. Abantu baliiri kumurhoola nka mwene Yozefu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yozefu aliiri Mugala wa Heeli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heeli aliiri mugala wa Mataati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Mataati aliiri mugala wa Laawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Laawi aliiri mugala wa Meleki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Meleki aliiri mugala wa Janaayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Janaayi aliiri mugala wa Yozefu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yozefu aliiri mugala wa Matatiyaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Matatiyaasi aliiri mugala wa Amoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amoosi aliiri mugala wa Nahuumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahuumu aliiri mugala wa Esuuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esuuli aliiri mugala wa Nagaayi,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagaayi aliiri Mugala wa Maati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Maati aliiri mugala wa Matatiyaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatiyaasi aliiri mugala wa Semeyini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeyini aliiri mugala wa Yezeechi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Yezeechi aliiri mugala wa Yooda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yooda aliiri Mugala wa Yohanaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Yohanaani aliiri mugala wa Reesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Reesa aliiri mugala wa Zorobabeeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Zorobabeeli aliiri mugala wa Shalitiyeeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Shalitiyeeri aliiri mugala wa Neeri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neeri aliiri mugala wa Meleechi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Meleechi aliiri mugala wa Aadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Aadi aliiri mugala wa Gosaame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Gosaame aliiri mugala wa Elimadaame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Elimadaame aliiri mugala wa Ere,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ere aliiri mugala wa Yooshuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yooshuwa aliiri mugala wa Eliyezeeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyezeeri aliiri mugala wa Yoriime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yoriime aliiri mugala wa Mataati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Mataati aliiri mugala wa <char style="w">Laawi</char>,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Laawi aliiri mugala wa Simeooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeooni aliiri mugala wa Yuuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yuuda aliiri mugala wa Yozefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yozefu aliiri mugala wa Yonaami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonaami aliiri mugala wa Eliyakiimu,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakiimu aliiri mugala wa Meleeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Meleeya aliiri mugala wa Meena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Meena aliiri mugala wa Mattata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mattata aliiri mugala wa Nataamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Nataamu aliiri mugala wa <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daawudi aliiri mugala wa Yeese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yeese aliiri mugala wa Yobeedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yobeedi aliiri mugala wa Boazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boazi aliiri mugala wa Saala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Saala aliiri mugala wa Nasooni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasooni aliiri mugala wa Aminadaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadaabu aliiri mugala wa Adimiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Adimiini aliiri mugala wa Ariini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Ariini aliiri mugala wa Hesiroomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Hesiroomi aliiri mugala wa Pereesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Pereesi aliiri mugala wa Yuuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuuda aliiri mugala wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakobo aliiri mugala wa Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Isaka aliiri mugala wa <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abrahaamu aliiri mugala wa Teera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Teera aliiri mugala wa Nahoori,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahoori aliiri mugala wa Seruugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Seruugi aliiri mugala wa Reehu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reehu aliiri mugala wa Peleegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Peleegi aliiri mugala wa Hebeeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Hebeeri aliiri mugala wa Sheela,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sheela aliiri mugala wa Kenaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenaani aliiri mugala wa Arapakasaadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Arapakasaadi aliiri mugala wa Seemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Seemu aliiri mugala wa Noowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Noowa aliiri mugala wa Lameeki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameeki aliiri mugala wa Matusaleemi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Matusaleemi aliiri mugala wa Henooka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Henooka aliiri mugala wa Yereedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Yereedi aliiri mugala wa Malaleeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Malaleeli aliiri mugala wa Kenaani,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenaani aliiri mugala wa Enoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enoosi aliiri mugala wa Seeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Seeti aliiri mugala wa Adaamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adaamu aliiri mugala wa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu ageregezwa na Shetaani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mariko 1.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yeesu arhenga omu lwinji lw'eYorodaani ey'ayunjwizwe Muuka-Mutagatiifu. Aheekwa na Muuka-Mutagatiifu omu mpinga. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Omoola mpinga, ageregezwa na Shetaani gihe cha siku makumi mane. Arhalyaaga chintu mw'ezoola siku. Zabeere zaahwa, ayunva enzara. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetaani aja amubwira ntya: «Akaba oli Mugala wa Nnamahanga, bwira eli baale lihinduke mugati.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Biyandikirwe: ‹Omuntu arhakalama n'omugati gonyine.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Rhegeko 8.3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shetaani ava amuheeka elugulu bweneene, amuyeereka omu gashanji kageeke amaami mooshi m'egulu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Shetaani amubwira ntya: «Nji naguheereza obuhashe booshi n'obukuuze bw'ama maami mooshi. Nahaabirwe ebyoola byooshi. Naani nakabiheereza eyi nshondere. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Okamparamya, byooshi byaaba byaawe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Biyandikirwe: ‹Oharamye Nnaweerhu, Nnamahanga waawe n'okumukolera yenyine.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Rhegeko 6.13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shetaani ashuba kumuheeka eYerusaleema. Amuhira elugulu w'<char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">eNju ya Nnamahanga</char> n'okumubwira: «Akaba oli Mugala wa Nnamahanga, chiikabula gurhenga hano kuja eshiishi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kwenge aMandiko Matagatiifu maderhere ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‹Nnamahanga nj'arhegeka <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char> baage bakulange.›<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na kandi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">‹Baguheeka omu maboko maabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">y'okugulu kwawe nji gurhasiirhalaga oku baale.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Nanga 91.11-12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «aMandiko Matagatiifu maderhere ntya: ‹Orhahira okageregeza Nnaweerhu, Nnamahanga waawe.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Rhegeko 6.16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Abeere amala kugeregeza Yeesu omu ngasi kuntu, Shetaani aja hale naye kugera ekindi gihe.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu arhondera akaasi kaage eGalilaaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mariko 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:1-3">Yohaana 4.1-3</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 4:43-46">43-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yeesu agaluka eGalilaaya eyi ayunjwire obuhashe bwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu. Emyaazi yaage y'amenyikana mwaho hantu hooshi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Alema ayigiriza omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char> na ngasi muntu alema amukuuza.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alahirwa eNazareeti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariko 6.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yeesu aja eNazareeti, emunda alemberwaga. Olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, aja omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> nk'oku ali komeere. Ayimanga gusoma aMandiko Matagatiifu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bamuheereza egitaabu ch'omuleebi Isaya. Azinguula cho n'okuva abona olukere luyandikirwe ntya:<figure style="fig" alt="Le Livre de Saintes Ecritures" file="HK00150B.TIF" size="span" ref="4.17">eGitaabu ch'aMandiko Matagatiifu</figure><verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«oMuuka gwa Nnaweerhu gundi ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kwenge akinshogere mpu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ndeme nayigiriza abakene oMwazi Mwinja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Antumire kuyaamagiza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ogushwekuulwa kw'abali omu munyororo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">n'empumi oguhumuulwa ameesho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">n'okulikuulwa kw'ababonereerwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />n'okuyaamagaza omwaka Nnaweerhu ayeerekana olukogo lwage.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isaya 61.1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yeesu azinga egitaabu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Echo gitaabu ch'ali yandikirwe oku luhu.</char></note>, achigalulira omukozi n'okuyikala. Abantu booshi baliiri omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> baliiri kumuseeza kw'ameesho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ava ahwanza kubabwira ntya: «Zeene aMandiko Matagatiifu mwayuusa kuyunva mamayeenera.»<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Booshi baalema bamudumiiriza n'ogusoomererwa ebinwa binja aliiri kuderha. Baalema baderha ntya: «K'arhali mugala wa Yozefu oyuula?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeesu abwira bo ntya: «Okuli, mwambwira oguula mugani: ‹Mufumu, ochifumye wenyine.› Na kandi mwambwira: ‹Rhwayunviirhe ebiwajirire byooshi eGaperinaumu. Jira ebiri nk'ebyo kuno mwenyu nako.›» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ashubi yongeera ntya: «Mbabwirire <char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">okuli</char>: nta muleebi oyankirirwa bwinja omu gishagala chaabo <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Okuli, mbabwirire okw'eIsraheeli haliiri abashumbakazi banene amango ma <char style="w" lemma="Eliya:">Eliya</char>. Amo mango envula yamala myaaka esharhu na myeezi ndarhu buzira gurhoga. Enzara nene yabonekana omu gihugo chooshi. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Sy'aliko Eliya arharhumwaga emwa muguma wabo, aliko arhumwa emw'omushumbakazi muguma wali lamire eSarepata omu gihugo ch'Sidoona. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Haliiri kandi ababenzibenzi banene omu Israheeli amango m'omuleebi Elisha. Na ntaaye omu bo wafumire, aliko oMusuuriya Namaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Baami 5.1-14</ref>.</char></note> yenyine.» <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Booshi baliiri omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> babeere bayunva ntyo, bakaliha. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bayimanga, bakuula Yeesu omu gishagala, bamuheeka elugulu w'omusozi gwaliyumbakirwe ko echo gishagala mpu yi bamushunika omu lubanda. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Aliko agera ahagarhi kaabo, achigendera.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omuntu walifarhirwe n'omuzimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mariko 1.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Enyuma z'ebi, Yeesu aja ayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eGaperinaumu ch'omu gihugo ch'eGalilaaya. Olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char> lwabeere lwahika, agenda kuyigiriza omu sinagoogi. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Abantu basoomererwa bweneene enyigirizo zaage, kwenge aliiri kuderha n'oburhegesi.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> haliiri omuntu walifarhirwe n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">omuzimu</char>. Akankama ntya n'omulenge munene: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Yoo! Yeesu w'eNazareeti, gichi warhushonda ko? K'oyinjire gurhumala? Nkuyinji! Oli Mutagatiifu wa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yeesu akankamira bweneene oyo omuzimu n'okumubwira ntya: «Sira, rhenga m'oyu muntu!» Omuzimu akabula oyo muntu oku budaka ahagarhi k'abantu n'okumurhenga mo buzira kumujira kubi. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Abantu booshi basoomerwa n'okubwirana ntya: «Byo bich'ibi? Oyu muntu y'arhegeka n'ogukalihira n'emisi abazimu, nabo banahuluka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />N'emyaazi eyerekeere Yeesu yayandaala mw'echo gihugo chooshi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya abalwala banene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariko 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yeesu ahuluka omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> ayeerekeza emwa Simooni. Nazaala wa Simooni ali libukire n'eshuushira linene. Baahema Yeesu amufumye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yeesu amuyegeera, akalihira eshuushira, nalyo lyamuleka. Ho n'aho oyo mukazi ayuumuka n'ogurhondera kubakolera.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ezuuba lyabeere lyaazika, abantu baligwerhe abalwala ba ngasi ndwala, baleerhera bo Yeesu. Ahira amaboko ku ngasi muguma n'okubafumya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" /><char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">Abazimu</char> barhenga omu balwala banene eyi bali babweja ntya: «Oli Mugala wa Nnamahanga!» Aliko Yeesu abakalihira n'okubabuza kuderha. Kwenge boowe baliyinji okw'ali <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ayigiriza oMwazi Mwinja omu gihugo ch'eYudeeya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Matayo 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mariko 1.35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bwabeere bwacha, Yeesu arhenga ahoola, achijiira ahantu harhali bantu. Abantu banene barhondera kumushonda. Babeere bamushimaana, bashonda kumubuza arhabalekaga. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Aliko Yeesu abwira bo ntya: «Ngwasize kuyigiriza oMwazi Mwinja g'obwime bwa Nnamahanga omu bindi bishagala nabyo. Kwenge echo chicharhumaga Nnamahanga antuma.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Alema ayigiriza omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> z'egihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Abigirizwa barhanzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariko 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">Yohaana 1.35-51</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-11">21.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lusiku luguma, Yeesu aliyimangire aha burhambi bw'enyanja eyirikwa Genezareeti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Genezareeti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eri nyanja eshuba kuyirikwa nyanja y'eGalilaaya.</char></note>. Abantu banene balwisa kuja aha burhambi bwage kuyunviriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Abona maarho mabiri mali emushengo. Abashaana eyi barhengere mo bakola bali gushuka emilaga yaabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yeesu ashonera omu bwarho buguma. Bwaliiri bwa Simooni. Yeesu amuhema okw'abushunike hale bugeeke n'emushengo. Yeesu ayikala m'obo bwarho n'ogurhondera guhaana enyigirizo zaage oku bantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Abeere amala kuderha, abwira Simooni ntya: «Shegera hale, ah'amenji maleehere. Wooyo n'abenyu, muhire emilaga yenyu omu menji, murhege.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simooni amushubiza ntya: «Mwigiriza, rhwalibukire obudufu booshi, rhwamanahina. Aliko obo wamambwira oku njire ntyo, nahira emilaga omu menji.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Babeere baajira ntyo, bayirha efi zinene bweneene, oku bulyo emilaga yaabo yarhondera guchiibera. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Basimira abaabo baliiri omu bwindi bwarho mpu bayinje babagwase. Aboola bayinja. Booshi haguma bayunjuza amo maarho mabiri, oku bulyo maalema mayika omu menji. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simooni Petero abeere abona ebyoola, afukama embere za Yeesu n'okuderha ntya: «Orhanyegeeraga, Nnaweerhu, kwenge nyoono ndi muntu w'ebyaaha!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simooni n'abaliiri naye, booshi baalisomeerwe ntya elugulu w'efi zinene bayirhaga. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yakobo na Yohaana, bagala ba Zebedayo, baliiri gurhega haguma na Simooni, nabo basoomerwa. Aliko Yeesu abwira Simooni ntya: «Orhayuubahaga: gurhengera zeene waaja waloba abantu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Baava basiika amaarho maabo emushengo. Baaleka byooshi, bakulikira Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omubenzibenzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariko 1.40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Amango Yeesu aliiri omu gishagala chiguma ch'omu bishagala by'eGalilaaya, haahulukira omuntu oyunjwire ebibenzi. Abeere abona Yeesu, achikabula embere zaage, amalanga oku budaka n'okumuyinginga ntya: «Nnaweerhu, akaba bigusimiisize, wakancheesa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yeesu alambuula okuboko, amuhuma ko n'okuderha ntya: «Binsimiisize, ocheeswe!» Ho n'aho, <char style="w" lemma="Bibenzi:">ebibenzi</char> by'oyo muntu byaafuma. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yeesu amurhegeka ntya: «Nta muntu obwirage ebiila. Aliko oje guchiyeerekana emw'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa</char>, ohaane entuulo y'ogucheeswa nk'oku <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> ayirhegekaga. K'okuyeereka abantu booshi oku wafumire.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Aliko emyaazi eyerekeere Yeesu yayandaala hooshi. Abantu banene baalema bachiigusha mpu bamuyunvirize, anabafumye endwala zaabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Aliko Yeesu alema ayongoloka kuja gusaliira aharhali bantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omuntu ohunzize</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariko 2.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lusiku luguma, Yeesu aliiri kuyigiriza. <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> n'abigiriza b'amarhegeko bali bayikeere ahoola, bahulukiraga omu bishagala byooshi by'eGalilaaya, by'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> n'eYerusaleema. N'obuhashe bwa Nnaweerhu bwaliiri haguma naye y'afumya abalwala. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ho n'aho abantu baguma baagera ho baheekere omuntu ohunzize oku gipoyi. Baliiri gushonda kumuheeka omu nju n'okumurhabika embere za Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Aliko baabula ngahe bakamugezeza elugulu w'abantu banene. Baava bashona oku nju elugulu n'ogukubuula amatebura, <figure style="fig" alt="Les gens font passer le malade dans les tuiles" file="WA03824b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.19">Abantu bagezeza omulwala omu matebura m'enju</figure>bamuchimiza oku gipoyi ahagarhiigarhi k'echigusho ch'abantu embere za Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yeesu abeere abona obwemeezi bw'abo, abwira oyo mulwala ntya: «Mwira waani, ebyaaha byaawe byababaliirwe.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko">Abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'aBafarisaayo barhondera gukengeera ntya: «Oyu mulume ali nde oli kudukanga Nnamahanga? Nde wakagala kubabalira ebyaaha arhali Nnamahanga yenyine?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yeesu amenya enkengeero zaabo, ava ababaza ntya: «Chagarhuma mwagwarha enkengeero ziri ntya omu mirhima yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Bichi biyoolohere, akaba okuderha ntya: ‹Ebyaaha byaawe byababaliirwe›, changwa okuderha: ‹Yimanga, olambagire?› <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Leero nshondere mumenye oku <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> agwerhe obuhashe b'okubabalira ebyaaha omu gulu.» Ava abwira oyo mulwala ohunzize ntya: «Nkubwirire, yimanga, rhoola egipoyi chaawe, ogaluke emwawe!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ho n'aho oyo muntu ayimanga embere z'abantu booshi, ava arhoola egipoyi chaage aliiri kulyaama ko, n'oguchijiira emwage ey'aheerhe akuuza Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Booshi basoomerwa, bakuuza Nnamahanga. Bayuubaha n'okuderha ntya: «Zeene rhwabwene oku bintu bisomeezwe!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ahamagala Laawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariko 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Buzinda bwaho, Yeesu ahuluka, abona <char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">omufurhiisa w'amakooli</char> oyirikwa <char style="w" lemma="Laawi:">Laawi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Laawi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye yirikwa kandi Matayo.</char></note>, ey'ayikeere ahantu bafurhiisiza. Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Nkulikira!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Laawi aleka byooshi, ayimanga n'okumukulikira.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Laawi:">Laawi</char> amujirira esheego nene omu mwage. <char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">Abafurhiisa b'amakooli</char> banene n'abandi bantu baliiri gusangira meeza maguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> balunduma n'okubwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> ba Yeesu ntya: «Chagarhuma mwalya n'okunywa haguma n'abafurhiisa b'amakooli n'abanyabyaaha?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Arhali abantu bagumaguma bo bakenera omufumu sy'aliko abalwala. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ntayinjaga guhamagala abakengereere oku bakwaneene sy'aliko abayinji oku bali banyabyaaha yi babileka n'okugalukira Nnamahanga.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogusaliira n'oguchiibuza kulya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariko 2.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> bamubwira ntya: «<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> ba Yohaana kuguma n'abeerhu bazigaana guchiibuza kulya banajira n'esaala, aliko ab'emwawe boowe yi bagendeerera kulya n'okunywa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yeesu ashubiza bo ntya: «Ka mwakabuza abeera b'omuhya-mulume kulya n'okunywa n'obo omuhya-mulume achiri haguma nabo? Nangwa! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Nji hayinja amango banyegwa omuhya mulume, mw'ezo siku nji bachiibuza okulya n'okunywa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Abwira bo kandi guno mugani: «Ntaaye okuula ehisharhe oku mwenda muhyaahya mpu ahihangire oku mwenda gushaajire. Kwenge owajira ntyo, nj'aba aberere omwenda muhyaahya, n'ehisharhe arhoolere hirhakananiira oku gushaajire. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Na ntyo, ntaaye ohira edivaayi y'omuhyo omu masupa m'oluhu lushaajire.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amasupa m'oluhu: aBayaahudi baliiri bajira amasupa omu oluhu. Mw'amo masupa baliiri babika mo amenji, amarha, edivaayi n'amavurha. Amo masupa, amango malichiri mahyaahya, maliiri marhunda. Aliko amango mamarhondera gushaja, manakomera, elugulu w'oko marhagachirhunda.</char></note> Nk'ajirire ntyo, eyo divaayi y'omuhyo yanabera amo masupa. Edivaayi yanasheesheka n'amasupa mafa busha. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Aliko bihemere guhira edivaayi y'omuhyo omu ndaha zihyaahya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Na nta muntu wanywere oku divaayi y'enchulama wagasiima ey'omuhyo, kwenge baderha oku ey'enchulama y'enyinja.»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu n'eSaabato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariko 2.23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lusiku luguma lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, Yeesu n'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage baliiri kulenga omu mashwa m'engano. Abigirizwa baage bayaagula emihuli y'engano, bayivunga omu fune n'okulya embeke. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> baguma bababaza ntya: «Chagarhuma mwajira ebilahiizwe olusiku lw'eSaabato?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Ka murhasomaga ebi <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> ajiraga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1 Samweri 21.2-7</ref>.</char></note> n'abaliiri haguma naye eyi bayunviirhe enzara? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Aja omu Nju ya Nnamahanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mw'amo mango, eNju ya Nnamahanga (Kajumiro) yabaaga erhazashuba kuyumbakwa.</char></note>, arhoola emigati barhuuliraga Nnamahanga. Ayilya ko, ayiha oku baliiri haguma naye, n'obo eRhegeko lyeerhu liyemereere okw'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abadaahwa</char> bonyine bagwasize kulya yo.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Kandi Yeesu ababwira ntya: «<char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ye nyina eSaabato.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omuntu w'okuboko guhunzize</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariko 3.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Olwindi lusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, Yeesu aja omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> kuyigiriza. Ahoola haliiri omuntu muguma w'okuboko kw'ekulyo guhunzize. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" /><char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">Abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> baliiri kumuloleereza bweneene yi baabona akaba agafumya olusiku lw'eSaabato, kwenge baliiri gushonda echagarhuma bamusidaaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Aliko Yeesu aliyinji enkengeero zaabo. Ava abwira ntya oyo muntu w'okuboko guhunzize: «Yimanga, oje ahagarhi k'abantu booshi.» Ava ayuumuka n'okuja ho. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yeesu abwira bo ntya: «Mbabazize ntya: gichi chiyemereerwe olusiku lw'eSaabato? Okujira amenja changwa amabi? Ogufumya omuntu changwa okumuleka afe?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Abalola booshi, abwira oyo muntu ntya: «Gonyoola okuboko kwawe.» Oyo muntu akugonyoola n'okuva kwafuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Aliko abigiriza b'amarhegeko n'aBafarisaayo bayunjulwa n'omujinya n'ogurhondera kubazana gurhe bajirage Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu achishoga entumwa ekumi n'ebiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariko 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:13">Bijiro 1.13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Amo mango, Yeesu aja oku musozi kuja gusaliira. Amala k'obudufu booshi ey'ali asaliira Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bwacheere eseezi, ahamagala <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage, achishoga mw'ekumi na babiri. Abayirika «<char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Ntumwa</char>.» Ezo ntumwa zeezi: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simooni oyu Yeesu ahaaga eziino lya Petero, na Ndereya mwene waabo, Yakobo na Yohaana, Firipo na Baritolomaayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo na Tomaasi, Yakobo mwene Lufaayo na Simooni waliiri <char style="w" lemma="Bazelooti:">Muzelooti</char>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" /><char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya:">Yuuda</char> mwene Yakobo na Yuuda Isikariyooti, ye wahindukaga mulenzi.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ayigiriza abantu n'ogufumya abalwala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Matayo 4.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-13">Mariko 3.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yeesu ayandagala nabo gurhenga oku musozi n'okuyimanga omu kabanda ahaliiri <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage banene. Ahoola haliiri n'echigusho chinene ch'abantu: abantu b'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char>, ab'eYerusaleema na ab'echamashinji ch'eTiiro na ech'eSidoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tiiro na Sidoona </char><char style="ft" closed="false">birhali bishagala by'eBuyaahudi.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bayinjaga mpu bamuyunviirize anabafumye endwala zaabo. Abantu baalifarhirwe n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">abazimu</char> baafuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ngasi muntu aliiri gushonda amuhume ko, bulaala obuhashe bwa Nnamahanga bwaliiri kumurhenga ko n'okubafumya booshi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugisho n'obuhanya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:2-12">Matayo 5.2-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yeesu aja alola <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage n'okuderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Mugishirwe, mwe muli bakene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">kwenge oBwami bwa Nnamahanga buli bwenyu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mugishirwe, mwe muli nzara buno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">kwenge nji mwayuugurha! Mugishirwe, mwe muli kulira buno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">kwenge nji mwasheka!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mugishirwe, akaba abantu bakabayanga, akaba bakabalahira, bakabadukanga n'okuderha kubi elugulu w'amaziino menyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">kwenge muyemereere <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Musiime n'ogushagaluka amango ebyoola nji byabahikira, kwenge oluhembo lwenyu luli lunene omu mpingu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:23">Ntyo maani ku bashookuluza baabo baliiri kulibuza abaleebi ba Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Aliko buhanya bwenyu mwe bachire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">Kwenge mwabo mwahaabirwe olwenyu luhembo!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Buhanya bwenyu mwe muyugurhire buno!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kwenge nji mwagwarha enzara!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Buhanya bwenyu mwe muli gusheka buno!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kwenge nji mwaba omu mishiibo n'omu malira!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Buhanya bwenyu akaba abantu booshi bali kubaderha bwinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">kwenge ntyo ku bashookuluza baabo baliiri kujirira abaleebi b'obubeeshi!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obuzigire oku banzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5.38-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Aliko mbabwirire, mwe muli kunyunva: musiime bashombanyi benyu, mujire amenja oku babashombere; <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />mugishe abanabavuma n'ogusaliirira ababadukanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Akaba omuntu agushuurhire oku rhama liguma, omuyeerekeze n'elindi; nk'omuntu akunyagire egorhe lyaawe, omuleke arhoole n'esimiisi yaawe.<verse eid="LUK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />«Ohe ngasi yeeshi oguhemere echintu, na nk'omuntu agurhoolere ehyaawe, orhagishiibaga wamuhema hyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />«Mujirire abantu nk'oku mushondere abandi babajirirage. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Nka musiimire aba basiima bonyine, mukengereere oku nji mwahaabwa oluhembo? Nanga! aBanyabyaaha nabo basiima aba basiima! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />N'akonva mujira amenja oku babajirira amenja bonyine, mukengereere oku nji mwahaabwa oluhembo? Nanga! aBanyabyaaha nabo baajira ntyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />N'akaba muyindika aba mulangaalire oku nabo nji babajuha, mukengereere oku nji mwahaabwa oluhembo? Nanga! aBanyabyaaha nabo bayindika abandi banyabyaaha yi nji babajuha! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ahuubwe, musiime bashombanyi benyu, mubajirire amenja n'oguhoza buzira kulingiriza kugalulirwa echintu. Ntyo, nji mwahaabwa oluhembo lunene n'okuba beene Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene, kwenge ali mwinja oku barhasiima n'oku babi.<verse eid="LUK 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />«Mube n'olukogo nk'oku Yisho ali w'olukogo.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogurhaacha olwabeene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Murhachiiraga muntu olushinja na Nnamahanga naye arhakabachiira lushinja. Murhaderhaga okw'abandi bahanwe na Nnamahanga arhakaderha oku muhanwe. Ahuubwe mubabalire abandi na Nnamahanga nj'abababalira. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muhe abandi na Nnamahanga nj'abaha. Nji mwahaabwa omulengo gulengerwe bwinja, gusindagiirwe n'okuyunjuzwa bweneene kugera ogusheeshekala. Bulaala Nnamahanga nj'abalengera n'omulengo mulengera mo abandi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yeesu ashuba kubabwira omugani: «Empumi erhakalambagiza eyindi mpumi, k'arhali ntyo? Akaba ntyo, oku bali babiri booshi banarhogera omu kijokole. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Omwigirizwa</char> arhaba elugulu w'omwigiriza waage; alik'omwigirizwa oyigiriizwe bwinja anaba kuguma n'omwigiriza waage.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />«Chagarhuma walola ehirhi hiri omu liisho lya mwene wenyu n'obo orhamenyere egirhi chiri omu liisho lyawe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Gurhe wakabwira mwene wenyu ntya: ‹Mwene weerhu, leka ngukuule ehi hirhi hiri omu liisho lyawe›, werhabwene chiro egirhi chiri omu ly'emwawe? We ndyaalya we, rhang'okuule egirhi chiri omu liisho lyawe y'obona bwinja n'ogukuula ehirhi omu liisho lya mwene wenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omurhi n'amalehe mago</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Omurhi mwinja gurhayeeza amalehe mabi. N'omurhi gulwere gurhayeeza amalehe menja. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ngasi murhi gumenyikana oku malehe maago. Barhacha amalehe m'omutiini oku mirhi y'emishaaki n'emizabiibu oku marhovu. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Omuntu mwinja akuula ebintu binja biri omu murhima gwage n'omuntu mubi naye akuula ebintu bibi biri omu murhima gwage. Kwenge obuunu bwa ngasi muntu buderha ebiyunjwire oku murhima gwage.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enju ebiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Girhuma mumpamagala ‹Nnaweerhu, Nnaweerhu›, n'obo murhajira ebi mbabwirire?<verse eid="LUK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />«Omuntu w'okuja emunda ndi, oyunva ebinwa byaani n'okubihira omu bijiro, tala gurhe ashushire: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />ali nka muntu oli kuyumbaka enju. Ajokwere bweneene omu budaka kugera oku baale, arhonderera ahoola kuyumbaka. Amango emisuuka yayinjaga, amenji m'olwinji machishenya kw'eyo nju, aliko marhagalaga kuyishaganya, kwenge eyo nju yali yumbakirwe bwinja. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Aliko, oyunviirhe ebinwa byaani buzira kubihira omu bijiro ali nka muntu oyumbakire enju oku budaka buzira kujokola y'arhonderera ahoola kuyumbaka bwinja. Amango emisuuka yagishenyaga kw'eyo nju, yahika yaagwa: yashandaakala looshi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omuja w'omukulu w'abasoda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8.5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yohaana 4.46-54</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yeesu abeere amamala kubwira olubaga lwaliiri kumuyunviriza ebi binwa byooshi, aja eGaperinaumu.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Eyoola, omukulu w'abasoda w'ekirooma aligwerhe omuja waage w'akamaro. Oyo muja alilwere bweneene ey'ali bufa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Oyo mukulu w'abasoda abeere ayunva yi baderha ebiyerekeere Yeesu, amurhumira <char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> baguma b'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> kumuhema ayinje amufumize oyo omuja waage. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Babeere baagera emwa Yeesu, barhondera kumuyinginga bweneene n'okuderha ntya: «Oyu mukulu w'abasoda akwaneene gurhabaalwa naawe. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kwenge anasiima olubaga lwerhu, yeewe ye wayumbakisaga <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">esinagoogi</char> yeerhu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Nnaweerhu ava agenda nabo. Abeere akola ali hoofu n'enju, oyo mukulu w'abasoda arhuma abeera baage kubwira Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza, orhashiibaga wachilibuza. Nyoono ntakwaneene mp'ohike omu mwani. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Chegirhumire ntayinja nyenyine emunda oli. Aliko oderhe chinwa chiguma chonyine y'omuja waani afuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwenge naani ndi eshiishi w'abanrhegekere na kandi ngwerhe abasoda nyimangiire. Nkabwira muguma ntya: ‹Genda!›, anagenda, na nkabwira owindi ntya: ‹Yinja!›, anayinja; na nkabwira omuja waani ntya: ‹Kola echiila!›, anagikola.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yeesu abeere ayunva ebyo binwa, asomererwa oyo mukulu w'abasoda. Ahindamuka abwira ntya echigusho ch'abantu bali bamukulikiire: «Mbabwirire oku ntashubiraga kubona obwemeezi buli ntya, nangwa! Chiro n'omu Israheeli.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bala beera omukulu w'abasoda arhumaga, babeere bagaluka bashimaana omuja afumire.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afuula omwana w'omushumbakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Enyuma z'aho, Yeesu aja omu gishagala chiguma chiyirikwa Naiina. <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> baage n'echigusho chinene ch'abantu bamuherekeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Abeere agera hoofu n'omulyango g'olugo lw'echo gishagala, haahulukira abantu baliiri kuja guhamba omufu. Oyo mufu aliiri mwana w'echinege w'omushumbakazi muguma. Abantu banene b'ahoola baliiri haguma n'oyo mushumbakazi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Nnaweerhu abeere amubona, amuyunvira obonjo bweneene n'okumubwira ntya: «Orhaliraga!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ayegeera n'okuva ahuma oku gipoyi. Abaali giheekere bayimanga. Yeesu aderha ntya: «Musole we, nkubwirire ntya: zuuka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Nyagufa azuuka, ayikala n'ogurhondera kuderha. Yeesu amugalulira nyina. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Booshi bayuubaha. Bakuuza Nnamahanga omu kuderha ntya: «Rhwabonekeerwe n'omuleebi mukulu!», na kandi: «Nnamahanga ayinjire gurhabaala olubaga lwage!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />N'omu <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">Yudeeya</char> yooshi na hoofu nayo hooshi, abantu bamenya ebi Yeesu ali ajirire.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohaana Mubatiiza arhuma abigirizwa baage emwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11.2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> ba Yohaana bamubwira byooshi Yeesu aliiri kujira. Yohaana ahamagala babiri omu bo, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />abarhuma emwa Nnaweerhu kumubaza ntya: «Ka wooyo we Masiiya Nnamahanga alaganyaga changwa rhukwaneene kulinga owindi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Abo bigirizwa babiri babeere baahika hoofu na Yeesu, bamubwira ntya: «Yohaana Mubatiiza arhurhumire gukubaza ntya: ‹Ka wooyo we Masiiya ogwasizwe kuyinja changwa rhukwaneene kulinga owindi?›» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mw'akoola gashanji, Yeesu afumya abantu banene endwala zaabo, obulema, n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">abazimu</char>, n'okugalulira empumi okubona. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yeesu ashubiza abigirizwa ba Yohaana ntya: «Muje kubalira Yohaana ebi mwabwene n'okuyunva:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">empumi yi zabona, ebirema yi byalambagira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">ababenzibenzi yi baafuma, ebihuli yi byayunva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">abafu yi bafuuka, n'oMwazi Mwinja yi gwashambaalirwa abakene.<verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Agishwe olaala orhakaleka kunyemeera!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Abarhumwa ba Yohaana babeere bagenda, Yeesu ava arhondera kubwira ntya olubaga lwali ho elugulu wa Yohaana: «Gichi mwajaagilola omu mpinga? Ka lusheke lushaganyizwe n'omuyaga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Kandi, gichi mwajaaga kulola? Ka muntu oyambeere emishangi minja? Aliko abayambala emishangi minja n'okulama omu muhimbo bali omu nju z'abaami. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Aliko si, gichi mwajaaga mwaja kulola? Omuleebi? Neechi, mbabwirire okw'ali muleebi, na kandi yeewe alushire omuleebi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Kwenge Yohaana y'aMandiko Matagatiifu maderhaga ntya elugulu waage:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Ntumire omubala mwazi waani agurhange embere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">kugurheganyiza enjira.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaaki 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:20">Lubunguluko 23.20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Mbabwirire oku omu booshi baburhirwe n'abakazi, harhashubiraga kuba omukulu kulusha Yohaana. Aliko, omugeeke bweneene omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga ali mukulu kumulusha.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Olubaga looshi n'<char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">abafurhiisa b'amakooli</char> bali bamuyunviriize, bayemeera oku Nnamahanga akwaneene, <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">banachibatiziisa</char> emwa Yohaana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Aliko <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> balahiire eki Nnamahanga ashondaga oku bo n'okuva balahira kubatiizwa na Yohaana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Abantu bali zeene nakabashushanya na nde? Bashushire nde? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bashushire n'abaana bayikeere embuga, eyi baguma yi bahamagala abaabo ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Rhwabazihiire omulizi aliko murhazinire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Rhwabayimpiire enyimpo z'emishiibo aliko murhalirire!›<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Amango Yohaana Mubatiiza ayinjaga, arhaliiri kulya emigati n'okunywa edivaayi. Mwamuderha ntya: ‹Agwarhirwe n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">omuzimu</char>!› <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Leero <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> amayinja, ali kulya n'okunywa. Kandi mwamamuderha ntya: ‹Tala oyu muntu oganiiza okulya konyine n'okunywa edivaayi. Ali mwira w'<char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">abafurhiisa b'amakooli</char> n'abandi banyabyaaha!› <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Aliko, obwenge bunene bwa Nnamahanga buyinjikeene nka b'okuli oku booshi babuyemeera.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ababalira omukazi w'ebyaaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariko 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohaana 12.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">oMufarisaayo</char> muguma alaalika Yeesu kulya haguma naye. Aja omu nju yaage, bayikala kulya ebiryo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mw'echo gishagala mwaliiri omukazi w'ebyaaha. Abeere ayunva oku Yeesu y'alya emw'oyo Mufarisaayo, aleerha omukebo gw'amarashi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ayimanga enyuma za Yeesu, aha burhambi bw'amagulu maage. Arhondera kulira n'okulobya amagulu ma Yeesu n'emiziga yaage. Ashangula amagulu ma Yeesu n'enviiri zaage, amahoobera, n'okumashiiga kw'amarashi.<figure style="fig" alt="Une femme pécheresse lave les pieds de Jésus par ses larmes" file="WA03839b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7.38">Mukazi muguma w'ebyaaha ashuka amagulu ma Yeesu n'emiziga yaage</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Oyo Mufarisaayo walaalikaga Yeesu abeere abona ntyo, achibwira ntya omu murhima gwage: «Oyu muntu nk'aliiri muleebi wa Nnamahanga, singa amenyere oyu mukazi wamuhumire ko ali nde, okw'ali munyabyaaha.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yeesu abwira oyo Mufarisaayo ntya: «Simooni, ngwerhe echinwa ch'ogukubwira.» Simooni ashubiza ntya: «Derha, Mwigiriza.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yeesu aderha ntya: «Bantu babiri baligwerhe omwinda gw'owabayindikaga. Muguma aligwerhe omwinda gw'<char style="w" lemma="Dinaari:">edinaari</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Edinaari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zaliiri furanga. Dinaari nguma yakakoleerwe omuzizi muguma.</char></note> magana marhaano n'owindi makumi marhaano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Nka kunoola booshi ntaaye waligalire kumujuha, abababalira booshi oku bali babiri. Nde nji wamusiima bweneene mw'aba babiri?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simooni amushubiza ntya: «Nkengereere k'olaala ababaliraga walimugwerhe mwinda munene.» Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Waderhere okuli.» <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ashuba guhindamukira emunda oyo mukazi ali n'okubwira Simooni ntya: «K'obwene oyu mukazi? Najiire omu mwawe, chiro orhampeere amenji m'ogushuka amagulu, aliko yeewe anshukire amagulu n'emiziga yaage n'okumashangula n'enviiri zaage. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wooyo orhanyankiriire omu kumpoobera, aliko yeewe arhalekere guhoobera amagulu maani gurhengera aha najiriire omu mwawe. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wooyo orhashiigire amavurha omu rhwe lyaani, aliko yeewe ashiigire amarashi oku magulu maani. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Cho girhumire nkubwirire oku obuzigire bunene anyerekere, buyerekeene okw'ebyaaha byaage binene byababaliirwe. Aliko obabaliirwe bugeeke anayeerekana obuzigire bugeeke.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yeesu abwira oyo mukazi ntya: «Ebyaaha byaawe byababaliirwe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Abaliiri kulya oku meeza haguma na Yeesu barhondera guchidedeesa ntya: «Oyu ali nde w'okubabalira n'ebyaaha nabyo?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Aliko Yeesu abwira oyo mukazi ntya: «Obwemeezi bwawe bwaguchungwire; ogende n'omurhuula.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Abakazi baherekezaga Yeesu omu kaasi kaage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Buzinda bw'aho, Yeesu alenga omu bishagala bineneenene n'omu bigeekegeeke. Agenda ayaamagaza n'okubala oMwazi Mwinja gw'obwime bwa Nnamahanga. Entumwa zaage ekumi n'ebiri zaliiri haguma naye, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />n'abakazi baguma Yeesu akuulaga mw' <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> n'abandi afumyaga endwala: Mariya oyirikwa w'eMagadala, warhengwaga mo bazimu mushanvu, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Jaani muka Chuuza waliiri mwimangizi w'ebikulo bya <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char>, Suzana, n'abandi bakazi banene barhabaalaga n'ebikulo byaabo akaasi ka Yeesu n'entumwa zaage.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omuhinzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariko 4.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Abantu banene bayegeera Yeesu, barhengeraga omu ngasi gishagala. Abachiira guno mugani: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Haliiri muhinzi muguma, agenda kubyaala emburho yaage. Okw'ali kubyaala, embeke ziguma zarhogera aha burhambirhambi bw'enjira: zalabarhwa, n'enyunyi z'omu chaalege zalya zo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ezindi zarhogera oku mabaale. Zabeere zamera, zayuuma, kwenge zabulaga amenji. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ezindi zarhogera omu mishaaki; emishaaki yamera haguma nazo n'okuzifundeeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ezindi mbeke zarhogera omu budaka bwinja; zabeere zamera, zayeeza ngasi nguma amagana m'amalehe.» Yeesu abeere amala kuderha ebyoola, ayaamagaza ntya: «Ogwerhe amarhwi m'okuyunva, ayunve!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Egirhuma Yeesu aderha omu migani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariko 4.10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> baage baamubaza ech'ogo mugani gwali guderhere. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Abashubiza ntya: «Mwabo, mwahaabirwe okumenya ebibishirwe by'obwime bwa Nnamahanga. Aliko oku bandi, bibabwirirwe omu migani, yi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‹nka baabona, ntaacho babonage,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">na nka bayunviriza, ntaacho bayunvage.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isaya 6.9</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">luyandikirwe omu mandiko ma miira m'ekigiriki.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ahuguula omugani g'omuhinzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariko 4.13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Ogu mugani guderhere ntya: emburho zishushanyizwe n'eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Embeke ziri aha burhambirhambi bw'enjira, zishushanyizwe n'abantu bayunviriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. Aliko Shetaani anayinja gukuula eChinwa omu mirhima yaabo yi barhabaaga n'obwemeezi n'oguchungulwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ezarhogeraga oku mabaale, zishushanyizwe n'abanayunviiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'oguchiyankirira n'obushagaluke. Aliko girhagwarha emizi omu mirhima yaabo, banagwarha obwemeezi omu gashanji kageeke n'amango emirhego yayinjaga banaleka obwemeezi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Embeke zarhogeraga omu mishaaki zishushanyizwe n'abantu bayunva eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. Aliko emilago, obuchire n'obuloke bw'akalamo byanabafundeeza, banafundwa kuyeeza amalehe makulire. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Embeke zarhogeraga omu budaka bwinja, zishushanyizwe n'abayunva eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'oguchibiika omu murhima mwinja gunakwiriire, n'omu guchihangaana banagwarha amalehe.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani gw'etara</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mariko 4.21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Omuntu arhakamala guchaana etara mpu aliyuubike kw'echintu changwa alihire omu ntalule. Aliko alihanika oku gikondo, y'abaaja omu nju baabona obumoleke. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwenge ntaacho chibishirwe girhakabishuulwa, na ntaacho chijirirwe omu bwibisho girhakamenyikana n'okuleerhwa ahabonekeene. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Muchilange okuntu muyunviriza; kwenge nji baaha ogwerhe; aliko orhagwerhe nji bamunyega chiro n'ehyakengereere oku agwerhe.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina na beene baabo Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariko 3.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nyina na beene baabo Yeesu bayinja emunda ali, aliko barhakagalire kumuyegeera elugulu w'abantu banene. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Bantu baguma babwira Yeesu ntya: «Nyoko na beene benyu bayimangire ahambuga, bali bashonda gukulola.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Aliko abashubiza ntya: «Nyaama na beene beerhu, bali bantu bayunva eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'okugihira omu bijiro.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu akalihira omulaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:18">Matayo 8.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariko 4.35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lusiku luguma, Yeesu aja omu bwarho haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage. Ababwira ntya: «Rhuyambukire eshiiriza w'enyanja.» Baava bagenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Oku bali kugenda, Yeesu alyaama. Omulaba munene gwasuuka omu nyanja, obwarho bwalema bwarhoola amenji. Baliiri hoofu kuzika. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Baava baja kumuchula, bamubwira ntya: «Mwigiriza, Mwigiriza, rhwafa!» Azuukire, akankamira omulaba n'ebivundu. Byarhuleera. Endeera yaba. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yeesu aja ababaza ntya: «Ngahe obwemeezi bwenyu buli?» Bayuubaha n'ogusoomerwa, baalema babwirana ntya: «Oyu ali nde? Y'arhegeka chiro omulaba n'amenji, byanamukenga.»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omuntu ofarhirwe n'abazimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariko 5.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Bagendekera n'olugenzi lwabo guhika omu gihugo ch'aBageraasi, chiloleene n'eche Galilaaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yeesu abeere ayoomoka, muntu muguma w'ahoola ayinja embere zaage. Oyo muntu alifarhirwe n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char>. Gurhengera miira arhayambalaga emyambalo. Arhanabeeraga omu nju aliko oku mashinda. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Abeere abona Yeesu, ashuurha olujamu, achikabula embere z'amagulu maage n'okuderha ntya n'omulenge munene: «Yeesu, Mugala wa Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene, chagarhuma wachiiheba omu byaani? Ngurhebereeze, orhandibuzaga!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Aliikaga omulenge ntyo kwenge Yeesu alirhegekere oyo <char style="w">muzimu</char> okw'arhenge m'oyo muntu. Oyo muzimu abaaga anafarha oyo muntu siku zinene. Baliiri kumulanga ey'azirikirwe amaboko n'obulegule n'ebyuuma oku magulu. Aliko agendaga acha ebyo biziriko n'oguheekwa n'oyo muzimu omu mpinga. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yeesu amubaza ntya: «Eziino lyawe we nde?» Ashubiza ntya: «Nyoono, nye Rhuli banene»; kwenge abazimu banene balimujiire mo. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Abo bazimu bamuyinginga okw'arhabarhegekaga kuja ekuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ahoola haliiri obuso bw'engulube zinene bwaliiri kulagirwa oku musozi. Abo bazimu barhebeereza Yeesu oku abayemereere baje mw'ezo ngulube. Abayemeerera ntyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Bala bazimu barhenga m'oyo muntu, baja omu ngulube, n'obo buso booshi bwachima bwalibirha oku musozi, bwachiiroha omu nyanja n'okuzika.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Abangere b'ezo ngulube babeere baabona ebyabeere, balibirha n'okuyandaaza ogo mwazi mw'echo gishagala chinene n'omu rhwango rhutureene ho. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Abantu bayinja kulola ebyabeere. Baahika emunda Yeesu ali, bashigaana oyo muntu <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> barhengaga mo ayikeere aha burhambi bw'amagulu ma Yeesu, ey'ayambeere, anakola agwerhe obwenge booshi. Abantu bayuubaha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ababonaga ebyabaaga baabalira abandi gurhe oyo muntu waliiri mw'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">abazimu</char> afumyagwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Abantu booshi b'egihugo ch'aBageraasi baahema Yeesu arhenge emwabo, kwenge bali bafarhirwe n'obuuba bunene. Yeesu ava aja omu bwarho, achigalukira. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Omuntu warhengagwa mw'abazimu arhebeereza Yeesu okw'agende haguma naye. Aliko Yeesu amulahirira, amubwira ntya: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Ogaluke emwawe n'okubala byooshi Nnamahanga akujiriire.» Agenda, ayaamagaza omu gishagala chinene chooshi ebi Yeesu amujiriire byooshi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afuula mwali wa Yaiiro n'ogufumya omukazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariko 5.21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yeesu abeere agaluka eGalilaaya, ayankiirirwa n'abantu banene, kwenge baliiri kumulinga. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ho n'aho haahulukira omuntu muguma oyirikwa Yaiiro. Aliiri mukulu w'<char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">esinagoogi</char>. Achikabula hoofu n'amagulu ma Yeesu ey'ali kumurhebeereza oku aje emwage, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwenge omwali w'echinege aliiri hoofu h'ogufa. Oyo mwali aligwerhe myaaka ekumi n'ebiri. Amango Yeesu aliiri kuja yo, abantu banene baliiri kumufundeeza bweneene.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ahoola haliiri omukazi muguma w'alilwere gurhengera myaaka ekumi n'ebiri endwala y'okuva eshagama. Abaaga amalire ebikulo byaage byooshi oku bafumu, aliko ntaaye n'omuguma wagalire kumufumya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ayegeera enyuma za Yeesu, n'oguhuma oku mushoojo gw'efulema yaage. Ho n'aho, okuva kwage kw'eshagama kwahwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yeesu abaza ntya: «Nde wampumire ko?» Abantu booshi bahakana. Petero aja amubwira ntya: «Mwigiriza, abantu banene yi bagufundeeza n'okugushunika!» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Aliko Yeesu aderha ntya: «Hali omuntu wampumire ko. Nyoono menyere bwinja oku hali emisi yantengere ko.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Oyo mukazi abeere abona okw'amenyikeene, ayinja adirhimana guchikabula hoofu n'amagulu ma Yeesu. Achirhondoola embere z'abantu booshi echarhumaga amuhuma ko na gurhe afumaga ho n'aho. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Mwali waani, obwemeezi bwawe bwagufumize; ogende n'omurhuula.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Oku Yeesu achiri aderha, hagera omuntu warhengera emw'ola mukulu w'esinagoogi. Abwira oyoola mukulu ntya: «Mwali waawe afiire, orhagishiibaga walunza oMwigiriza.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Aliko Yeesu abeere abiyunva, abwira Yaiiro ntya: «Orhayuubahaga, yemeera konyine, mwali waawe afuma.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yeesu agerere emwa Yaiiro, arhayemeeraga omuntu aja omu nju haguma naye arhali Petero, Yohaana na Yakobo, haguma n'eshe na nyina w'oyo mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Abantu booshi balemaga balira n'okulumwa elugulu w'oyo munyere. Aliko Yeesu aderha ntya: «Murhaliraga, arhafiire, ahuubwe alyaamire!» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Boowe bamushekera, eyi bayinji okw'oyo munyere afiire. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Aliko amufarhira oku kuboko n'okuderha ntya n'omulenge munene: «Mwana waani, zuuka!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Omuuka gwage gwagaluka, ho n'aho ayimanga. Yeesu arhegeka oku bamuhe ebiryo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Abazeere b'oyo munyere basoomerwa. Aliko Yeesu abarhegeka oku ntaaye babwirage ebyabeere.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu arhuma entumwa zaage ekumi n'ebiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-14">Matayo 10.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariko 6.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yeesu ahamagala entumwa zaage ekumi n'ebiri aziheereza obuhashe n'oburhegesi b'ogukuula <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> booshi n'ogufumya endwala. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Azirhuma kuyigiriza enyigirizo ziyerekeere obwime bwa Nnamahanga n'ogufumya abalwala. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Abwira ezo ntumwa ntya: «Ntaacho muchiyikirage omu lugenzi lwenyu: ebe nkoni changwa eshaho, bibe biryo changwa efuranga, na ntaaye oheekage simiisi ebiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Enju nji babayankirira mo, muyibeere mo kugera amango nji mwaja ahandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ngasi hantu abantu nji balahira kubayankirira, murhenge omu gishagala chaabo munakunguurhe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogukunguurha olujuchu oku magulu kwaliiri kuderha k'omuntu warhumirwe arhachigwerhe mwinda oku bantu arhumwaga ko akaba balahiire omwazi abaleerheraga. </char></note> olujuchu lw'amagulu menyu. Okoola kuli kubayeereka oku Nnamahanga nj'abahana.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ezo ntumwa zagenda, zarhondera kulenga omu ngasi gishagala. Zaliiri kuyigiriza oMwazi Mwinja n'ogufumya abalwala ngasi hooshi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heroode abula olwimango</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Matayo 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mariko 6.14-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char>, murhegesi w'eGalilaaya, abeere ayunva byooshi biri byaagera, abula olwimango. Kwenge baguma baliiri kuderha mpu Yohaana afuukire gurhenga omu bafu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Abandi bantu balemaga baderha mpu <char style="w" lemma="Eliya:">Eliya</char> yi wagalukire. Abandi balemaga baderha mpu muguma omu baleebi ba miira yi wafuukire. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Aliko Heroode aderha ntya: «Nyoono nye naderhaga bache Yohaana erhwe. Ye nde oyu naye ndi nayunva baderha ebintu biri ntya elugulu waage?» Byaarhuma Heroode naye ashonda kubona Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ayuugusya balume bihumbi birhaano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yohaana 6.1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Entumwa</char> zagaluka emunda Yeesu ali zanamubwira byooshi zajiraga. Aziheeka ahantu harhali lwamo oku lunda luyerekeere egishagala ch'eBetesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Abantu banene babeere bamenya okw'ajiire yo, bamukulikira. Yeesu abayankirira. Alema ababwira ebinwa biyerekeere obwime bwa Nnamahanga, anafumya abantu bali bakeneere ogufuma.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ezuuba lyarhondeere kuzika, entumwa ekumi n'ebiri zaja zayegeera Yeesu n'okumubwira ntya: «Galula aba bantu yi baja emunda balaala, yi banabona ebiryo omu bishagala n'omu mizi ya hoofu, kwenge rhuli omu mpinga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Aliko Yeesu abwira entumwa zaage ntya: «Mubahe mwenyine ebi baalya!» Entumwa zaderha ntya: «Rhugwerhe migati erhaano yonyine n'efi ebiri. K'oshondere rhwenyine rhuje kugula ebiryo by'aba bantu booshi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />N'obo haliiri hoofu nka balume bihumbi birhaano. Yeesu abwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Mubayikaze bigusho-bigusho by'abantu makumi marhaano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Abigirizwa baajira ntyo, babayikaza booshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yeesu arhoola ela migati erhaano na zila fi ebiri, ayerekeza ameesho empingu, abigisha. Yeesu ava abichagulanga, anarhondera abiha abigirizwa baage yi babigabira abantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Abantu booshi baalya banayuugurha. Abigirizwa baheeka rhurhanda ekumi na rhubiri rhw'ebichiira byasigalaga.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero aderha oku Yeesu ye Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mariko 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:67-71">Yohaana 6.67-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lusiku luguma eyi Yeesu ali asaliira aharhali abantu, eyi n'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage bachigushire haguma naye, Yeesu ababaza ntya: «Abantu bali kuderha oku nye nde?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Abigirizwa bashubiza ntya: «Baguma yi baderha oku we Yohaana Mubatiiza; n'abandi mpu we <char style="w" lemma="Eliya:">Eliya</char>, abandi mpu oli muguma w'omu baleebi ba miira wafuukire.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yeesu abaza abigirizwa baage ntya: «Aliko si, nenyu muderha oku nye nde?» Petero ashubiza ntya: «Wooyo oli <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> wa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yeesu abuza abigirizwa baage oku ntaaye babwirage ebyoola. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ashuba kuderha oku bihemere <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> alibuke bweneene, alahirwe n'<char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi, <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char>, ayirhwe n'olusiku lwa gasharhu afuuke.<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogukulikira Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Matayo 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mariko 8.34–9.1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yeesu aja abwira abantu booshi ntya: «Akaba hali oshondere kunkulikira, achilahire yenyine, aheeke omusalaaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Oguheeka omusalaaba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuli kuyemeera kulibuka changwa ogufa elugulu wa Kirisitu.</char></note> gwage ngasi lusiku, anankulikire. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Bulaala, owashonda guchungula akalamo kaage, agaheza; sy'aliko owaheza akalamo kaage eyi nye ntumire, agachungula. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Gichi bimaliire omuntu okugwarha ebikulo by'egulu lyooshi, aliko aheze akalamo kaage? Ntaacho! <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nk'omuntu anyunviire eshoni, anaziyunvire emyaazi yaani, <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> naye nj'amuyunvira eshoni hano nj'agaluka omu bukuuze bwage, bo na bukuuze bw'Eshe na bwa <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char> batagatiifu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mbabwirire okuli: Baguma omu bali hano barhaafa embere babone obwime bwa Nnamahanga.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ahindamulwa eshusho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Matayo 17.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-10">Mariko 9.2-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Enyuma w'esiku zakagera ku munaane Yeesu aderhere ntyo, arhoola Petero, Yohaana na Yakobo; azamuukira oku musozi guhema Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Abeere ali ahema, eshusho ly'amalanga maage lyahindamuka, n'emyambalo yaage yaba mweru bweneene n'okubaraganya. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ho n'aho haboneka bantu babiri bali kuganiira naye: baliiri <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Eliya:">Eliya</char>, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />babonekana omu bukuuze gurhenga emwa Nnamahanga. Baalema baganiira haguma na Yeesu ebiyerekeere okugenda kwage kwali kwaneene kuyenerera eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Mwamo mango, Petero n'abaabo baliiri ero bweneene. Basisimukire, baabona obukuuze bwa Yeesu na bala balume babiri baliyimangire haguma naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Muusa na Eliya babeere bali balekana na Yeesu, Petero amubwira ntya: «Mwigiriza, kuli kwinja rhubeere hano. Rhwayumbaka biraaro bisharhu: chiguma chaawe, echindi cha Muusa n'echindi cha Eliya.» Petero arhalimenyere ebyaliiri kuderha. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petero abeere ali aderha ntyo, oluhomo lwayinja lwanabashukulira n'egichuuchu chaalo. Abigirizwa babeere baabona oluhomo lwabashukulira, bayuubaha. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Omulenge gwayunviikana m'olo luhomo: «Oyuula ye Mugala waani nachishogere. Mumuyunve!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Enyuma w'ogo mulenge okuyunviikana, Yeesu obonekana ali yenyine. Abigirizwa baasira, na ntaaye babwirire chintu, mwamo mango, oku bibabonaga ko ahoola.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omwana oli mw'omuzimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mariko 9.14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, Yeesu na balaala bigirizwa basharhu aliiri nabo, barhenga oku musozi. Abantu banene bayinja gushigaanana na Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Omuntu muguma ayaamira ntya ahagarhi k'abantu: «Mwigiriza, nkuyingingire, ondolere ono mugala waani, kwenge ali w'echinege. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Hali omuzimu onamufarha, ho n'aho anamuyamiisa olujamu, anamudirhimanya bweneene, anamukuliisa olufula omu buunu, n'ogurhamurhenga mo juba, n'okumuleka eyi amamuvunangula. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nayingingire <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baawe bakuule oyo muzimu, aliko barhagalaga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yeesu aderha ntya: «Mwe gisisi chibi na chizira bwemeezi, kugera mango machi nabeera haguma nenyu n'okubalembera? Leerha mugala waawe hano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Omwana abeere ali ayegeera Yeesu, ola <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">muzimu</char> amubanda ahashi n'ogurhondera kumudirhimanya. Aliko Yeesu akalihira oyo muzimu, afumya omwana n'okumugalulira eshe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Abantu booshi basoomererwa obuhashe bunene bwa Nnamahanga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yeesu ashuba kubala olufu lwage</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariko 9.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Oku booshi bali basoomererwa byooshi Yeesu ali ajira, abwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Muyunve bwinja ebi nashonda kubabwira: <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ayinja guhanwa omu fune z'abantu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Aliko abigirizwa barhayunvaga echi chinwa, eby'echi chinwa chiderhere byalibishirhwe y'abigirizwa barhamenyaga echi chiderhere. Baanali bayuubahire kubaza Yeesu ebiyerekeere echi chinwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nde ye mukulu oku waabo?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariko 9.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Haahulukira obuhaka omu bigirizwa b'ogushonda kumenya nde oli mukulu omu bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yeesu walimenyere obukengeere bw'emirhima yaabo, arhoola omwana murho, amuhira eburhambi bwage. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Ababwira ntya: «Oyankiriire oyu mwana oku ziino lyaani anyankiire nyenyine. N'onyankiriire ayankiriire owantumaga. Bulaala oli mudoorho omu mweshi oyo yeeri mukulu kulusha.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Orhali mwanzi wenyu ali wenyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-41">Mariko 9.38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohaana ava aderha ntya: «Mwigiriza, rhwabonaga omuntu oli akuula <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> oku ziino lyaawe. Rhwamubuza bulaala arhagukulikira haguma neerhu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Murhamubuzaga, bulaala orhali mushombanyi wenyu ey'ali wenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBasamariya balahira kuyankirira Yeesu omu gishagala chaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Esiku Yeesu alikwaneene guheekwa omu mpingu zabeere zaaba hoofu, Yeesu ahiga bweneene kuja eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Arhuma ab'okubala emyaazi embere zaage. Bagenda n'okuja omu gishagala chiguma ch'aBasamariya kumurheganyiza eby'obulagiirire byooshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Aliko aBasamariya balahira kumuyankirira bulaala aliiri ayerekera eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> ba Yeesu, Yakobo na Yohaana babeere bamenya ntyo, baderha ntya: «Nnaweerhu, k'oshondere rhubwire omuliro guchime gurhenga empingu kubasingonyola?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yeesu abahindamukira n'okubakalihira. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Baava baja omu chindi gishagala.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gurhe omuntu agakulikira Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8.19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Babeere bali omu njira, omuntu muguma abwira Yeesu ntya: «Nagukulikira ngasi hooshi waaja.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Emitereri ejira enkunda n'enyunyi z'omu chaalege zijira enyogo, sy'aliko <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> arhajira ahagahengeka erhwe lyaage.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yeesu abwira owindi ntya: «Onkulikire.» Aliko oyo muntu aderha ntya: «Nnaweerhu, onyemereere ntange nje guhamba daarha.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Oleke abafu bahambe abafu baabo; wooyo ogende, oje kuyaamagaza oBwami bwa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Owindi muntu abwira Yeesu ntya: «Nnaweerhu, handeke nagukulikira, sy'aliko onyemereere ntange nje guseezera ab'emwani.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Omuntu wamarhondera guhinga akanashuba kulola enyuma, arhakwaneene omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu arhuma abigirizwa makumi gali mushanvu na babiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">Matayo 10.7-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Enyuma w'ebyoola, Nnaweerhu achishoga bandi bigirizwa makumi gali mushanvu na babiri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hali bindi bitaabu bya Luuka bya miira bishambeere makumi gali mushanvu. </char></note> Abarhuma babiri-babiri bamurhange omu gishagala chooshi na ngasi hooshi alikwaneene kuja. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Emyaaka y'ogushaluula elugire, sy'aliko abakozi bageehere. Leero, muheme nyina emyaaka arhume abakozi kuyishaluula. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mugende! Mbarhumire nka byaanabuzi ahagarhi ka banyambwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Murhaheekaga chiro lufuranga, changwa eshaho, changwa ebindi biraato. Na ntaaye mulamusage omu njira. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Omu ngasi nju nji mwaja mo, murhange muderhe ntya: ‹Omurhuula gube kw'eyi nju!› <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Akaba omoola muli omuntu oshondere omurhuula, ogo murhuula gwenyu gwanamubeera ko; n'akaba nanga, omurhuula gwenyu gwanabagalukira. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mubeere mw'eyoola nju, mulye munanywe ebi nji baabaha, kwenge omukozi akwaneene omukamarho gwage. Murhazereeraga omu maju. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Na ngasi gishagala nji mwaja mo, bakabayankirira, mulye ebi nji baabaha. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mufumye abalwala nji baaba mo, munababwire ntya: ‹Obwime bwa Nnamahanga bwabayegereere.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Aliko, omu ngasi gishagala nji mwaja mo nji bakalahira kubayankirira, mugende omu njira zaacho munababwire ntya: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Rhubakungurhiire olujuchu lw'egishagala chenyu lwali lunaniirire oku magulu meerhu, lo lubaage buhamiiriza bw'amabi menyu. Aliko mumenye k'obwime bwa Nnamahanga bwabayegereere.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mbabwirire oku m'olo lusiku nji byayoolohera Sodoomo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sodoomo chiri gishagala chiyerekeene ahantu halugire amabi.</char></note> kulusha echoola gishagala.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebishagala bilahiire kuyeemera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:21-23">Matayo 11.21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Buhanya buchi oku wooyo gishagala ch'eKoraziini! Buhanya buchi oku wooyo gishagala ch'eBetesayida! Akaba ebisomereene byajirikeene emwenyu byakajirikeene eTiiro n'eSidoona, singa hamaagera siku zinene abantu b'eyoola balekere ebyaaha byaabo, singa bayambeere ebigunira n'okuyikala omu luvu! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Cho charhuma, olusiku l'ogucha olushinja nji byayoolohera Tiiro na Sidoona kubalusha mwabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nawe gishagala ch'eGaperinaumu, k'omenyere mpu nji wazamuulwa guhika echaalege? Nangwa da! Nji wayandagazwa guhika ekuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Obayunviriize eyi nyoono ny'ayunviriize, obalahiire eyi nyoono ny'alahiire, n'ondahiire eyi alahiire owantumaga.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okugaluka kw'abigirizwa makumi gali mushanvu na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Abigirizwa makumi gali mushanvu na babiri bagaluka n'obushagaluke n'okuderha ntya: «Nnaweerhu, n'<char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> nabo yi barhukenga amango rhuli rhwabarhegeka oku ziino lyaawe.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Nabonaga Shetaani arhoga gurhengera omu chaalege nka mubaraganyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Muyunve bwinja: nabaheere oburhegesi b'okulabarha enjoka n'engobe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Engobe hiri hiruuru hy'esongi ly'omuchira guleehere linagwerhe ehisindani hy'obulozi. Hyagakoromesa bweneene, hali n'amango hyakayirha.</char></note>, n'ogusinyongola obuhashe booshi bw'mushombanyi, na ntaacho nji chabajira kubi.<figure style="fig" file="BK00058B.TIF" size="col" ref="10.19">Engobe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Sy'aliko murhasiimaga kwenge abazimu bali babayunva; ahuubwe musiime okuba amaziino menyu mayandikirwe omu mpingu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obushagaluke bwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mw'ako gashanji, Yeesu ayunjuzwa obushagaluke kugerera Muuka-Mutagatiifu, aderha ntya: «Daarha wee, Nnaweerhu w'omu mpingu n'omu gulu, ngusimiriize kwenge ebi bintu wabibishire abanyabwenge n'abahanga, wanabibishuulira abaana badoorho. Neechi Daarha, bulaala ntyo ku walisimiisizwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Daarha ampeere byooshi. Ntaaye onyinji nyoono Mugala nk'arhali Daarha yenyine, na ntaaye oyinji Daarha nk'arhali oMugala na ngasi yeeshi oMugala ashondere amumenye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omunezeero gw'abigirizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Matayo 13.16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yeesu ahindamukira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage, ababwirira ntya eburhambi: «Magishirwe ameesho mali maabona ebi muli mwabona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Bulaala, mbabwirire oku, baleebi banene n'abaami banene bali bashondere kubona ebi mwabo muli mwabona, aliko barhabibonaga ko. Bashondere kuyunva ebi mwabo muli mwayunva, aliko barhabiyunvaga ko.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'oMusamariya mwinja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mariko 12.28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Buzinda bw'ebi, <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">mwigiriza muguma w'amarhegeko</char> ayimanga n'okubaza Yeesu ntya omu kumurhega: «Mwigiriza, bichi nkwaneene kujira yi mbona akalamo k'esiku n'amango?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Bichi biyandikirwe omu <char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">Rhegeko</char>? Gurhe oliyunva eyi walisoma?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Omwigiriza w'amarhegeko ashubiza ntya: «Osiime Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga waawe n'omurhima gwawe gooshi, n'emisi yaawe yooshi n'obwenge bwawe bwooshi. Kandi: Osiime n'omutuuranyi waawe nka okw'ochisiima wenyine.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Rhegeko 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Balaawi 19.18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yeesu aja amubwira ntya: «Washubiize bwinja. Ojire ebyoola oderhere, nji waalama.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Aliko yeewe ashonda kuyeerekana okw'akwaneene. Abaza Yeesu ntya: «Omutuuranyi waani ye nde?»<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yeesu ashuba kumubwira ntya: «Haliiri muntu muguma warhengaga eYerusaleema guchimira eYeeriko. Abeere ali omu njira, abugaanana n'ebishumuusi. Byamunyega byooshi aligwerhe, bamushuurha banagenda eyi bamulekere nka mufu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Haahulukira <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa</char> muguma wachimaga mw'eyo njira, abeere abona oyo muntu, achigerera oku lwindi lunda lw'enjira, naye achigendera. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />oMulaawi muguma naye agera ahoola, abona oyo muntu, achigerera oku lwindi lunda lw'enjira, anachigendera. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Aliko, oMusamariya muguma waliiri lugenzi, ahika hoofu naye. Amubwene, amubeera obonjo. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ashegera aha ali, amushomoola ebibihulu omu kubisheeshera kw'amavurha n'edivaayi, abirhuba n'ebiraka.<figure style="fig" alt="Le bon samaritin bande les plaies de celui qui était frappé par des bandits" file="WA03863b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="10.34">oMusamariya mwinja arhuba ebihulu by'ola washuurhwaga n'ebishumuusi</figure> Amubarhulira oku ndogomi yaage, amuheeka omu nju y'abagenzi, anamulanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Eseezi ly'aho, oyo Musamariya akuula <char style="w" lemma="Dinaari:">dinaari</char> ebiri omu shaho yaage, aziheereza nyina enju y'abagenzi n'okuderha ntya: ‹Obuke bwinja oyu muntu. Hano ngaluka, nakujuha nyenyine ebindi byooshi waaba wakoleeseze k'oyu muntu.›» <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yeesu aja abaza ntya ola mwigiriza w'amarhegeko: «Nd'obwene mw'aba bantu basharhu walibeere mutuuranyi w'oyu muntu wabugaananaga n'ebishumuusi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Omwigiriza w'amarhegeko ashubiza ntya: «Ola muntu wamubeeraga obonjo.» Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Genda, nawe ojire ntyo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alambagirira Marita na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Oku Yeesu n'abigirizwa baage bali omu njira, Yeesu aja omu gishagala chiguma. Omukazi oyirikwa Marita amuyankirira. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Oyo Marita aligwerhe mwene waabo oyirikwa Mariya. Oyo Mariya ayikala embere za magulu ma Nnaweerhu, aliiri ayunviriza eChinwa chaage. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Aliko Marita yeewe aliiri gukola orhwasi rhunene. Ahulukira n'okuderha ntya: «Nnaweerhu, ka birhakulunzize kubona mwene weerhu andekere gukola orhwasi rhooshi nyenyine? Omubwire angwase maani.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Nnaweerhu amushubiza ntya: «Marita, Marita, oli wachilunza n'oguchikobola na bintu binene. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Hali chintu chiguma chonyine ch'obulagiirire. Mariya yeewe achishogere echintu gikwiriire, girhakamunyagwa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu ayigiriza abigirizwa baage gusaliira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lusiku luguma, Yeesu aliiri hantu haguma ey'ali gusaliira. Abeere amala gusaliira, muguma omu <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">bigirizwa</char> baage amubwira ntya: «Nnaweerhu, orhuyigirize gusaliira nk'oku Yohaana ayigirizaga abigirizwa baage.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Nka mwasaliira, mugende mwaderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‹Daarha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">eziino lyawe likuuzwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">obwime bwawe buyinje.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Orhuhe ebiryo byeerhu bya ngasi lusiku.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Orhubabalire ebyaaha byeerhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bulaala neerhu rhubabalira abarhujirira amabi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Orhanagenda warhuleka rhwarhogera omu chigeregezo.›»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yeesu ashuba kubwira abigirizwa baage ntya: «Nde omu mwabo wakagwarha mwira waage, akaja emwage ahagarhi k'obudufu kumubwira ntya: ‹Mwira waani, ompoze migati esharhu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />bulaala muguma omu beera baani ahikire ahamwani gurhengera omu lugenzi na ntaacho ngwerhe namusheegera.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Akaba owabo omushubiize ntya ey'anali omu mwage: ‹Leka okumbera erhwe; olunvi lwachingirwe miira, nyoono n'abaana baani, rhwalyaamire. Ntakagala kuzuuka mpu nguhe emigati.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Okuli mbabwirire, chiro akaba arhazuukire kumuha emigati bulaala ali mwira waage, azuuka bulaala mwira waage arhaluhire kumuyinginga, anamuha byooshi alagiriire.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />«Bobunoola nyoono mbabwirire ntya: Muheme, mwanahaabwa; mushonde, mwanabona; mukongoorhe oku lunvi, mwanachinguulirwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Bulaala ohema ahaabwa, oshonda abona n'okongoorha oku lunvi achinguulirwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nde y'eshe w'omwana omu mwabo nk'omugala amuhemere efi, akamuha enjoka ahaali h'efi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Changwa, nk'amuhemere egi, akamuha engobe? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Akaba mwabo, mwe bantu babi, muyinji guha abaana benyu ebintu binja, gurhe Daarha w'empingu ojira olukogo lunene kulusha agafundwa guhaana Muuka-Mutagatiifu oku bamuhemere ye?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu mpu ali Belizebuuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mariko 3.22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lusiku luguma, Yeesu aliiri gukuula <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">omuzimu</char> wajiraga omuntu muguma kuba nyamugama. Omuzimu abeere ahuluka, nyamugama arhondera kuderha. Abantu banene baliiri ahoola basoomerwa bweneene. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Aliko bantu baguma baderha ntya: «Yeesu ali akoleesa Belizebuuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belizebuuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">liri lindi ziino lya Shetaani.</char></note>, mukulu w'abazimu, omu guhulusa abazimu.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Abandi bantu nabo baarhega Yeesu omu kumuhema echimenyeeso ch'ogurhengera empingu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Aliko, Yeesu alimenyere enkengeero zaabo, ababwira ntya: «Obwami buchishandeeze bonyine, bujiire ebw'olufu lwabo; enju zaabo zanahenera mo ziguma oku zindi. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Akaba leero Shetaani ali achilwisa yenyine, gurhe obwami bwage bwakalama, kwenge muli mwaderha mpu nyoono ndi nakoleesa Belizebuuli omu guhulusa abazimu? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />N'akaba ndi nahulusa abazimu kugerera Belizebuuli, abaana benyu babahulusa kugerera nde? Chi nji charhuma bonyine nji baaba bazuuzi benyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Aliko, akaba ndi nahulusa abazimu kulengera obuhashe bwa Nnamahanga, k'okuderha k'obwime bwage bwabahikiire. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Omuntu w'emisi ohagarhiire emitwaro yaage, amango ali alanga enju yaage, ebikulo byaage eyi bilangirwe bwinja. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Aliko, akaba omulushire emisi agahulukira n'okumuhima, akamunyega emitwaro yaage yooshi alilangaliire; na ntyo anagabira abandi bantu ebintu amunyegaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Omuntu orhali haguma naani eyi ali andwisa; n'omuntu orhangwasa kugusha eyi ali ashandaaza.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okugaluka k'omuzimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Amango <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">omuzimu</char> arhengere omu muntu, anaja omu mpinga gushonda amahumuukiro. Na nk'amabulire, anaderha ntya: ‹Nkola kugaluka omu nju yaani, mula narhengeraga.› <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ey'ayigera mo, anayibugaana ehyagiirwe enarheganyizwe bwinja. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Leero, anaja agenda gushonda bandi bazimu mushanvu babi kumulusha. Baanaja mo n'okubeera mo. Oboorhere b'oyo muntu bwanaba bubi kulusha obwambere.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okulama bwinja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yeesu abeere ali aderha ntyo, omukazi muguma mw'abo bantu banene aderha n'omulenge munene n'okumubwira ntya: «Enda yaguheekaga egishwe n'amabeere makuyonsaga!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Aliko Yeesu ashubiza ntya: «Ahuubwe, bagishirwe abali bayunva eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'ogukulikira cho.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebimenyeeso bya Yoona na Mwene oMuntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Abantu banene babeere bali bachiigusha, Yeesu arhondera kuderha ntya: «Echi gisisi chiri gisisi chibi: chiri chashonda echimenyeeso. Girhagahaabwa echindi chimenyeeso kuleka echa Yoona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kwenge nka kulaala Yoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="JON 1:4">Yoona 1.4</ref>.</char></note> abaaga chimenyeeso oku bantu b'eNinaawi, ko n'oko <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> aba chimenyeeso kw'echiila gisisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Olusiku l'ogucha olushinja, omugoli w'egarhongo nj'ahulukira haguma n'abantu b'echi gisisi. Nj'abahaniisa, bulaala alirhengere omu mahanga ma hale kuja kuyunva ebinwa by'obwenge bunene bwa Solomoono. N'obo hanoola hali olushire Solomoono! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Amango m'ogucha olushinja, abantu b'eNinaawi nabo nji bayimanga haguma n'abantu b'echi gisisi, n'okugihaniisa. Kwenge balekere ebyaaha byaabo amango Yoona ayamagazaga omwazi. Leero hanoola hali olushire Yoona.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etara ly'omubiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">Matayo 6.22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Ntaaye ochaana etara mpu alihire ahabishirwe changwa omu garhanda; ahuubwe analihanika oku gikondo, y'abaaja omu nju baabona obumoleke. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Eliisho lyawe ly'etara ly'omubiri gwawe. Nk'eliisho lyawe likwiriire, omubiri gwawe gooshi nago gukolezeezwe. Aliko nk'alibiihire, omubiri gwawe nago eyi guli omu mwizimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ochilange obumoleke bukuli mo burhaba mwizimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Akaba leero omubiri gwawe gooshi gukolezeezwe, buzira kugwarha olunda n'oluguma omu mwizimya, omubiri gwawe gooshi nji gwaba gukolezeezwe kuguma n'amango etara likukoleezeza n'obumoleke bwalyo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu asidaaka aBafarisaayo n'abigiriza b'amarhegeko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:4-36">Matayo 23.4-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Oku Yeesu ali aderha, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">oMufarisaayo</char> muguma amulaalika emwage mpu aje kulya. Yeesu aja omu nju, ayikala n'okulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Oyo Mufarisaayo asoomerwa okubona Yeesu alya buzira gukalaba. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Aliko Nnaweerhu amubwira ntya: «Mwabo mwe Bafarisaayo muzigaana gucheesa emugongo w'engumbu n'embale, n'obo omu mirhima yenyu muyunjwire obushumuusi n'obubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwe binganyi! Owalemaga omubiri g'omuntu k'arhanali ye walemaga omurhima? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Aliko mwabo, muhaane n'omurhima g'obonjo ebiri omu mirhima yenyu, n'ebindi byooshi byacheeswa emwenyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Aliko buhanya buchi emwenyu, mwe <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">Bafarisaayo</char>! Munahaana entuulo y'echigabi chiguma ch'ekumi ch'ebirhi by'obulunge n'echa ngasi buuko bw'eshogo, aliko mwanagenda mwakeneereza kujira ebijiro bikwaneene n'obuzigire bwa Nnamahanga! Ebyoola bimwali mukwaneene kujira, buzira kuleka ebindi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Buhanya buchi emwenyu, mwe <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">Bafarisaayo</char>! Musiima kuyikala oku bichumbi by'embere omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char>, munasiima abantu babalamuse n'obukenge omu soko!<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />«Buhanya buchi oku mwabo! Muli nka shinda zirhagwerhe chimenyeeso, abantu banazilambagira ko buzira kumenya!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Muguma omu <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">bayigiriza amarhegeko</char> ava aderha ntya: «Mwigiriza, omu kuderha ntyo, orhudukangire neerhu!»<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Buhanya buchi oku mwabo nenyu <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">bigiriza b'amarhegeko</char>! Muheesa abantu emizigo ekomeere guheeka, nenyu mwenyine murhakanayihuma ko n'omudoke!<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />«Buhanya buchi oku mwabo! Muyumbaka bwinja eshinda z'abaleebi n'obo bashookuluza benyu bababayirhaga! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Omu kujira ntyo, muyerekeene oku muyemereere ebijiro bya bashookuluza benyu, bulaala boowe bo bayirhaga abaleebi, nenyu yi mwayumbaka eshinda zaabo! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Cho girhumire Nnamahanga omu bwenge bwage bunene aderhere ntya: ‹Nabarhumira abaleebi n'<char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">entumwa</char>. Bayirha baguma n'okulibuza abandi.› <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Cho girhumire echi gisisi nji chaabazwa eshagama yasheeshwaga y'abaleebi booshi gurhengera okulemwa kw'egulu, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />gurhengera oku shagama ya <char style="w" lemma="Abeeli:">Abeeli</char> kugera oku shagama ya Zakariya, wayirhwaga ahagarhi k'entuuliro n'ahantu hatagatiifu. Neechi, mbabwirire byo, echi gisisi nji chabazibwa byooshi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Buhanya buchi oku mwabo <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">bigiriza b'amarhegeko</char>! Mwakuulire olufunguulo loguchingula omulyango g'okuja omu nju y'okuyigira m'okumenya Nnamahanga. Nenyu mwenyine murhajaaga mo, n'abashondaga kuja mo, mwababuza.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yeesu ayuusize gurhenga ahoola, <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko: ">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> barhondera kumulunza bweneene n'okumubaza oku biyerekeere bintu binene, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />bashonda kumurhega, yi baabona echinwa chagarhuma bamusidaaka.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Muchilange obulyaalya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-33">Matayo 10.26-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Amo mango, abantu banene bachigusha bihumbi n'ebihumbi, oku bulyo baalema baalabarhana. Yeesu arhanga kubwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Muchilange n'echachu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Echachu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eba shaano baalagaliza oku shaano y'ogukwiza emigati, y'erhunda.</char></note> y'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char>, k'okuderha obulyaalya.<verse eid="LUK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />«Ntaacho gishukuliirwe girhagashukuulwa, na ntaacho chibishirwe girhakamenyekana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Cho girhumire ngasi byooshi mwaderhere omu mwizimya nji byayunviikana ezuuba lyakola. Echi mwabohereeze omu gurhwi ebusiika, nji chayaamagazizwa oku nju elugulu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Mwe beera baani, mbabwirire byo: murhayuubahaga abantu bayirha omubiri, na nta chindi bakanachigala kujira enyuma z'aho. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nkola nabayeereka nde mukwaneene kuyuubaha. Muyuubahe Nnamahanga, yegwerhe obuhashe b'okuyirha n'ogukabula omu hantu h'amalibuko manene. Neechi, mbabwirire byo, oyoola yi muhemerwe kuyuubaha. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ka barhaguza nyunyi erhaano z'ebishwa oku bicheri bibiri? Aliko, chiro nta nguma omu zo eyibiriirwe na Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />N'enviiri z'amarhwe menyu zooshi ziganjirwe. Leero, murhayuubahaga chiro; mugwerhe akamaro kanene kulusha ebishwa binene.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyemeera changwa okulahira Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Mbabwirire byo: ngasi yeeshi nji wanyemeera embere z'abantu, <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> naye nj'amuyemeera embere za <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char> ba Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Aliko, ola nji wandahira embere z'abantu, naye nj'alahirwa embere za bamalahika ba Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />«Na ngasi yeeshi nji waderhera kubi <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'ababalirwa, aliko ola nji wadukanga Muuka-Mutagatiifu arhakababalirwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Hano nji babakululira omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char>, abarhwali n'abarhegesi, murhayuubahiraga obulyo nji mwabuurana, changwa bichi nji mwaderha. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Bulaala Muuka-Mutagatiifu nj'abayigiriza ho n'aho bichi mukwaneene kuderha.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omuchire muhwinja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Muntu muguma mw'abo bantu banene abwira Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza, bwira mwene weerhu ampe echaani chigabi ch'omwandu gwerhu.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Muza wee, nde wanjiraga muzuuzi changwa muntu w'okubagabira omwandu gwenyu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ashuba kubabwira ntya: «Muchilange n'okugwarha amahugu ma ngasi buuko, kwenge akalamo k'omuntu garharhengeere omu kanji k'ebikulo byaage.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yeesu ababwira ogu mugani: «Eshwa ly'omugale muguma lyayeeza bweneene. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Alema akengeera n'oguchiibaza ntya: ‹Bichi njirage? Bulaala ntagwerhe hantu hanene h'ogushaluulira emyaaka yaani.› <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Aderha ntya: ‹Tala oku naajira: nashanda enguli zaani, nayumbaka ezigalihire; nji nalundira mo amahemba maani n'ebindi bikulo.› <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />N'enyuma z'aho, nji nachibwira ntya omu murhima: ‹Ngwerhe ebintu binene bweneene bibiikirwe, bya myaaka minene; nahumuuka, naalya, nanywa, naashagaluka.› <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Aliko Nnamahanga amubwira ntya: ‹Oli muhwinja! M'obu budufu waafa! Ka warheganyize nde nji waaba nyina ebi bintu byooshi wachibikiire?›» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Ntyo ku bibeera omuntu ochihakira ebikulo byaage yenyine, aliko eyi arhali mugale embere za Nnamahanga.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oguchilangalira Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6.25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yeesu ashubi bwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Mulolage egirhumire mbabwira oku murhachiganyaga elugulu w'akalamo kenyu, akaba bichi mwalya; changwa elugulu w'omubiri gwenyu, akaba bichi mwayambala. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Bulaala akalamo kali ka bulagiirire kulusha ebiryo, n'omubiri guli gwabulagiirire kulusha emyambalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mulole ebihungwe: birhahinga birhanashaluula, birhajira aha bibiikira changwa enguli. Aliko Nnamahanga yebiliisa! Mwabo muli b'akamaro kanene kulusha enyunyi! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nde omu mwabo omu guchiiganya, wakagala kuleehya chiro bugeeke akalamo kaage? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Akaba ntaacho mwagachigalira mw'ebi bintu bigeeke, gichi chagarhuma mwachilunza oku bisigeere? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mulole guurhe ebirhi biyaasa: birhakola, birhaluka fulema; aliko, mbabwire oku chiro mwami Solomoono omu bukuuze bwage arhayambalaga nka chiguma omu byo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Akaba Nnamahanga ayambisa ntya egirhi chiri omu shwa zeene n'omuseezi banagiheba omu chibeeye, bichi byaagarhuma arhabayambisa nenyu kulusha, mwe bantu b'obwemeezi bugeeke! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nenyu, murhagendaga mwashonda gichi mwalya changwa gichi mwanywa, murhanachibuliisaga omurhuula. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ebyo byooshi by'abapagaani ba lino gulu bashonda buzira kuluha. Yisho wenyu ayinji oku mubikeneere. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ahuubwe, murhange mushonde obwime bwa Nnamahanga, n'ebyoola bindi naye nj'abaheereza byo. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Murhayuubahaga, mwe buso bugeeke; kwenge byasimiisize Yisho okubaha oBwami bwage.»<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebikulo omu mpingu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Muguze ebintu byenyu, muhe abakene efuranga. Muchijirire orhushaho rhw'efuranga rhurhagashaaja, muchibiikire ebikulo birhaagahwa omu mpingu. Eyoola nta mwizi wakayegeera yo na nta mushwa gwakabibiihya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Bulaala emunda ebikulo byaawe biri, yi n'omurhima gwawe gwaba guli.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'okuneeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Muchirheganye, mube muyambeere emyambalo y'akaasi n'amatara machaanirwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Nenyu mube kuguma n'aba bantu bali balinga nnahamwabo agaluke gurhenga oku buhya, hano akongoorha oku lunvi bagale kumuchinguulira jubaajuba. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Bagishirwe aba bagaragu nnahamwabo ashimaana bataramire ey'agaluka! <char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">Okuli</char>, mbabwirire, naye nj'ayambala emyambalo y'akaasi, nj'abayikaza n'okuyinja kubaha ebiryo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Nk'ayinjire omu budufu ahagarhi changwa buyerekeera gucha, akanababugaana bagitaramire, bagishirwe!»<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:43-51">Matayo 24.43-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Mumenye bwinja: nyina enju nk'amenyaga aha saa zinga egishambo chigwasize kuyinja, arhakalekere enju yaage eshandwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nenyu leero muchirheganye, bulaala <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'ayinja omu saa murhaganiizize.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petero abaza Yeesu ntya: «Nnaweerhu, ka rhwewe rh'obwirire ogu mugani changwa abantu booshi?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Nnaweerhu ashubiza ntya: «Nde ye mukozi orhahemuka, na munya bwenge, eyi nnahamwabo akajira mwimangizi w'abandi bakozi baage, y'abaheereza ebiryo omu gashanji gahemerwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Agishirwe oyu muja, akaba nnahamwabo hano agaluka, amushimaana ali akola ntyo! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Okuli mbabwirire: nnahamwabo nj'amujira mwimangizi w'ebikulo byaage byooshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Aliko, nk'oyo muja achibwirire ntya omu murhima gwage: ‹Nnahamwerhu alegamire kuyinja›, agarhondera gukubirha abaabo baja b'abalume n'aba bakazi, agarhondera kulya, kunywa n'okulaluka, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />nnahamwabo nj'agaluka olusiku oyo muja arhalikengereere, n'esa arhamenyere. Nj'amuhana bweneene n'okumuyikaza haguma n'abahemusi.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«Omuja nji waaba amenyere ogushonda kwa nnahamwabo, aliko arharheganyaga n'okujira echintu chiyerekeere oko gushonda, nj'ashuurhwa enkoni zirhankaganjwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Sy'aliko, ola orhamenyaga ogushonda kwa nnahamwabo, n'okuba ajirire ebintu bikwaneene obuhane nj'ashuurhwa nkoni zigeeke. Eyi baheere bintu binene, nji baamubaza binene; eyi babikiisize binene, nji bamuhema binene kulusha.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu, empanvu y'entambala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Nayinjaga guhira omuliro oku gulu; nagashondere gube gwachaanirwe! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nkwaneene <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">kubatiizwa</char> omu malibuko; n'omurhima gwani gurhaviire gwarhuleera kugera birhaza kujirika.»<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />«Ka muganiizize oku nayinjaga kuleerha omurhuula oku gulu? Nangwa, mbabwire okuli, sy'aliko obuhaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Gurhenga bunoola, bantu barhaano balamire omu nju nguma barhakayunviikana, basharhu nji balwisa babiri, na babiri nji balwisa basharhu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Omwana n'eshe barhakayunviikana, omunyere na nyina barhakayunviikana, omwazaana na nazaala barhakayunviikana.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okumenya ebihe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yeesu ashuba kubwira olubaga lw'abantu ntya: «Eyi mwabona ebichu byahulukira ebuzikiro bw'ezuuba, ho n'aho mwanaderha: ‹Envula yayinjire›, ebyoola byanahika. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na nk'omuyaga gw'egarhongo guli kugera, mwanaderha: ‹Echuuka chaaba.› Ebyoola byanahika. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwe ndyaalya! Muyinji kumenya oboorhere bw'egulu n'echaalege. Gurhe mwagafundwa kumenya amango mali bunoola?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyunvikana n'mushombanyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5.25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Na girhuma mwenyine murhagala kumenya ebikwaneene? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nka waaja kubuurana n'ogusidaakire embere z'omurhegesi, ochihangaane oyunviikane naye omu njira; y'arhaguheeka embere z'omuzuuzi. Omuzuuzi naye akaguhaana omu maboko m'omupoolisi, n'oyo mupoolisi anaguhira omu munyororo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Okuli nkubwirire, orhagarhenga omu munyororo orhanahongere olufuranga lw'obuzinda omu zibaguchiire.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Okuleka ebyaaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Amo mango, abantu baguma bayinja kubalira Yeesu gurhe Pilaato ayirhaga aBagalilaaya baguma eyi bali gurhuula entuulo emwa Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Mwabo muganiizize kw'abo Bagalilaaya bayirhwaga ntyo, k'okuderha oku bo baligwerhe ebyaaha binene kulusha abandi Bagalilaaya booshi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Mbabwirire oku nangwa. Aliko nka murhalekere ebyaaha byenyu, mweshi nji mwafa kuguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Changwa, aboola bantu ekumi na munaane omunaara gw'eSilowaamu gwarhogeraga ko, gwanabayirha, muganiizize oku boowe bo baliiri babi bweneene kulusha abandi Banyayerusaleema booshi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Mbabwirire oku nanga. Nenyu nka murhalekere ebyaaha byenyu, mweshi nji mwafa kuguma nabo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omurhi gurhayaanaga malehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yeesu ashuba kubabwira guno mugani: «Haliiri muntu muguma waligwerhe omurhi guyirikwa tiini omu shwa lyaage ly'emizabiibu. Aja oku go gushonda amalehe, aliko ntaamo abwene. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ava abwira omuhinzi w'elyo shwa ntya: ‹Lola! Myaaka esharhu eyi ndi nayinja gushonda amalehe k'oguula murhi eyi ntanamabona. Oguche! Chagarhuma gwabeera bushaabusha omu budaka?› <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Aliko oyo muhinzi anamushubiza ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, oguleke kandi guno mwaka, mpingire go n'okuguhira kw'emyaavu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ntyo, nkabaga nji gwaleerha amalehe omu mwaka gwayinjire, akaba birhabeere ntyo, wanagucha!›»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omukazi olusiku lw'eSaabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lusiku luguma lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, Yeesu aliiri kuyigiriza omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ahoola haliiri omukazi olwere. Gurhengera myaaka ekumi na munaane, omuzimu alimuyinamize. Arhakagalire chiro kuyinamuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yeesu abeere amubona, amuhamagala n'okumubwira ntya: «Nyaama wee, endwala yaawe yafumire!» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Amuhira ko amaboko, ho n'aho ayinamuka n'okuva arhondera gukuuza Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Aliko omukulu w'esinagoogi agaya oku Yeesu afumyize omuntu olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>. Ava abwira echigusho ch'abantu ntya: «Hali siku ndarhu z'ogukola mo akaasi; mw'ezoola siku zimulemage mwayinja mo guchifumiisa, sy'aliko nangwa olusiku lw'eSaabato!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Nnaweerhu amushubiza ntya: «Mwe ndyaalya mwe! Nkaasi muguma wenyu ashwekuula enka yaage changwa epunda yaage n'okuyiheeka gushooka olusiku lw'eSaabato, k'arhali ntyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />N'oyuula mukazi w'obuuko bwa <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char> owalizirikirwe na Shetaani myaaka ekumi na munaane, ka birhahemere ashwekuulwe mw'ebyo biziriko byaage olusiku lw'eSaabato?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yeesu abeere ali kuderha ntyo, booshi baliiri kumulwisa bayunva eshonyi; aliko echigusho chooshi ch'abantu chamogera ebijiro binja byooshi aliiri kujira.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogushushanya oBwami bwa Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Matayo 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariko 4.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «oBwami bwa Nnamahanga bwagashusha na gichi? Nankabushushanya na gichi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bushusheene n'ehiburho hy'eharadaali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eharadaali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">guli murhi guyeera k'orhuburho rhugeekegeeke bweneene. </char></note> muntu muguma arhoolaga anahibyaala omu shwa lyaage. Hyaamera n'ogukula, hyaaba murhi, n'enyunyi z'omu chaalege zayumbaka ebyoogo byaazo omu marhabi maago.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Gichi nankalinganya n'oBwami bwa Nnamahanga? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Bulinganeene n'echachu omukazi arhoolaga n'okuyihira omu milengo esharhu y'eshaano y'ogukola emigati, kugera egihe yooshi yarhunda.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulyango gufundereere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yeesu aliiri omu njira ey'ali aja eYerusaleema, alenga omu bishagala bineneenene n'ebigeekegeeke ayigiriza. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Muntu muguma amubaza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, k'arhali bantu bageeke bonyine nji bachungulwa?» Yeesu ashubiza ntya: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Muchihangaane kuja omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga kugerera omu mulyango gufundereere. Bulaala, yi nababwira, bantu banene nji bashonda kuja mo aliko barhakagala. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Amango nyina enju nj'aba ayimangire ey'amanachinga omulyango, nji mwaba mwamasigala embuga. Nji mwarhondera gukongoorha oku mulyango n'okuderha ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, orhuchinguulire.› Nj'abashubiza ntya: ‹Mwabo, ntenji muli ba ngahe.› <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ho n'aho, nji mwamubwira ntya: ‹Rhwaliire rhwananywa haguma naawe, wanagendaga wayigiriza emwerhu!› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Naye nj'ababwira ntya: ‹Ntenji muli ba ngahe. Muje hale naani, mweshi mwe mukola amabi!› <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Eyoola nji yaaba amalira n'oguhekenya amenyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyi nderho ederhere okw'abantu nji baaba embuga nji baaluba n'okuyongwa omu kubona obushagaluke bw'abeera ba Nnamahanga.</char></note>, amo mango nji mwabona <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>, Isaka na Yakobo, n'abaleebi booshi omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga, aliko mwabo nji mwaba mwakabwirwe embuga! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Abantu nji barhengera ebuhulukiro bw'ezuuba n'ebuzikiro bwalyo, n'abandi gurhengera emalambo n'egarhongo n'okuyikala balye haguma omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Mumenye oku hali abazinda nji baaba barhanzi, hali n'abarhanzi nji baaba bazinda.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alakira Yerusaleema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mw'ebyoola bishanji, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> baguma bayegeera Yeesu n'okumubwira ntya: «Rhenga hano, ochigendere ahandi, bulaala <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> yashonda gukuyirha.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Mugende mujibwira ogoola mutereri ntya: ‹Yi nalibisya <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu:">abazimu</char> n'ogufumya abalwala zeene n'omuseezi. Na lishinjo naamala akaasi kaani.› <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Aliko bihemere ngendekere olugenzi lwani zeene, omuseezi na lishinjo, bulaala birhakwaneene kuyirhira omuleebi ahandi aharhali eYerusaleema.»<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Yerusaleema, Yerusaleema, wooyo weyirha abaleebi n'okubanda amabaale abantu Nnamahanga agurhumiraga! Kanga nashondaga guhira haguma abaana baawe nk'oku engoko ehira haguma ebyaanagoko byaayo omu byuubi byaayo! Aliko murhabilonzaga. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Mumenye okw'enju yenyu yaaba mushaka. Mbabwirire byo: murhagachimbona kugera amango hayinja egihe nji mwaderha ntya: ‹Nnamahanga agishe owayinja oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu!›»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya omulwala olusiku lw'eSaabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lusiku luguma lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, Yeesu aja kulya emwa muguma w'abakulu b'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char>. Abaliiri ho booshi baliiri bamuloleereza.<verse eid="LUK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Omuntu olwere endwala y'ogurhundiisa omubiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndwala y'amenji manene omu birumbu by'omubiri.</char></note> aliiri embere za Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeesu abaza <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> ntya: «K'amarhegeko meerhu mayemereere changwa nangwa omuntu ogufumya omulwala olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Aliko baasira. Yeesu ava arhoola oyo mulwala, amufumya n'okumuleka agende. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ashuba kubabaza ntya: «Nde omu mwabo nk'omugala changwa enka yaage egarhogera omu gishimu, ka ho n'aho arhakayikuula mo nachiro luli lusiku lw'eSaabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Baabula echi bamushubiza.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ochihirire elugulu nj'ayandagazwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yeesu abeere abona gurhe abalaalikirwe yi bachiishoga ebichumbi by'embere, abachiira ogu mugani: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Nk'omuntu aguhamageere kuja kulya amango m'obuhya, orhajaaga kuyikala oku gichumbi ch'embere. Bulaala hali amango omuntu okengerwe gukulusha alaalikirwe, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />owabalaalikaga wooyo n'owenyu akayinja gukubwira ntya: ‹Olekere oyuula muntu egichumbi.› Wanaja wagwarhwa n'eshoni z'okuja kuyikala oku gichumbi ch'enyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Aliko, amango olaalikirwe, wanaja kuyikala oku gichumbi ch'enyuma, y'amango hano owakulaalikaga ayinja, akubwire ntya: ‹Mwira waani, oje kuyikala oku gichumbi ch'embere!› Ntyo, nji bwakubeera bukenge embere z'abantu booshi nji baaba bayikeere haguma naawe oku meeza. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Bulaala ngasi yeeshi ochizamwire nj'ayandagazwa, n'ochiyandageeze nj'azamuulwa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okulaalika abakene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yeesu ashuba kubwira ola wamulaalikaga ntya: «Amango warheganyiza abantu ebiryo by'ezuuba changwa by'egolo, orhalaalikaga abeera baawe, changwa beene benyu, changwa abantu b'omulala gwawe, changwa abatuuranyi baawe b'abachire. Bulaala nabo nji bakayinja gukulaalika, na ntyo wanaba wamajuhwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Aliko amango wahamagala abantu kulya oku lusiku lukulu, olaalike abakeene, ebirema, abahunzize n'empumi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ntyo, nji waaba mugishwa, kwenge boowe barhagwerhe echi bagakujuha omu gukugalulira! Aliko, nji waajuhwa amango m'ogufuuka kw'abakwaneene.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani gw'abantu barhenguhaga omulaali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-14">Matayo 22.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Muntu muguma omu baliiri baalya haguma na Yeesu abeere ayunva ebyo binwa, aderha ntya: «Agishirwe ola nji waalya omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga!»<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Haliiri muntu muguma warheganyaga biryo binene, analaalika bantu banene. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Egihe ch'okulya chagerere ho, arhuma omuja waage kubwira abalaalikirwe: ‹Muyinje, byooshi byarheganyizwe.› <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Aliko booshi barhondera kuderha ngasi muguma echaarhuma arhabonekana. Omwambere amubwira ntya: ‹Nagulaga eshwa, bimpemere nje kulirhangula; nguhemere ombabalire.› <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Owindi aderha ntya: ‹Nagulaga enka ekumi z'oguhingiisa, nguhemere ombabalire, naaja kulola akaba zaakola.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Owindi aderha ntya: ‹Namayuusa gushaba, chocharhuma ntayinja!› <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Oyo muja agaluka emwa nnahamwabo, amubalira ebyo byooshi. Nnahamwabo akaliha, abwira oyo omuja waage ntya: ‹Genda juba omu njira zineneenene n'omu zigekegeeke z'egishagala, oleerhe hano abakene, ebirema, empumi n'abahunzize.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Omuja abeere amala kujira ntyo, aderha ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, ebi wahemaga byajirirwe, aliko hanachiri ahakayikalwa!› <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Nnahamwabo ava amubwira ntya: ‹Oje omu njira n'omu migenderano y'egishagala, oseeze abantu bayinje kuja omu nju, y'omu mwani muyunjula abantu. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kwenge, mbabwirire byo, ntaaye mw'aba bantu bali balaalikirwe nji waalya oku biryo byaani.›»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulyo bw'ogukulikira Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10.37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lusiku luguma abantu banene baliiri kulambagira haguma na Yeesu omu njira. Ahindamuka n'okubabwira ntya:<verse eid="LUK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Nk'omuntu ankulikiire arhanansiimire kulusha eshe, nyina, mukaage, abaana baage, beene baabo, bali baabo, chiro n'akalamo kaage, arhaakaba <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">mwigirizwa</char> waani. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />N'omuntu orhaheekere omusalaaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Oguheeka omusalaaba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuli kuyemeera kulibuka changwa ogufa elugulu wa Kirisitu.</char></note> gwage n'okunkulikira, arhaakaba mwigirizwa waani.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />«Nde omu mwabo, nk'ashondere kuyumbaka enju nene, arharhanga kuyikala aganje engulo y'ebyakoleesa n'okulola akaba agwerhe ebikulo by'okuyiyunjuza? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kwenge, nk'arhondeere kuyumbaka n'akaba arhagalire kumala, aba nji baabona ntyo, nji bamushekera. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Baderha ntya: ‹Oyu muntu arhondeere kuyumbaka, aliko agambirwe kuyunjuza.› <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Changwa mwami ohe, nk'ashondere kulwisa owindi mwami, orharhanga kuyikala n'oguchiibaza akaba oku misi y'abasoda baage bihumbi ekumi, akagala guhima oyo waabo oyinjire na basoda bihumbi makumyaabiri? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Akaba arhakagala, agarhumira oyo waabo abantu achiri hale b'okumubaza gurhe bakayunviikana n'omurhuula gube ho. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Nenyu ntyo kubinali! Ngasi yeeshi omu mwabo nk'arhalekere ebikulo byaage byooshi arhaakaba <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">mwigirizwa</char> waani.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omunyu gurhachiri mw'obununu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariko 9.50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Omunyu chiri chintu gikwiriire. Sy'aliko gugaheza obuloke, gurhe bakagugalulira bo? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Gurhachiri gwinja oku budaka changwa oku myaavu; banagukabula embuga. Ogwerhe amarhwi m'okuyunva, ayunve!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Entaama yaheraga yanaboneka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18.12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">Abafurhiisa b'amakooli</char> n'abanyabyaaha baliiri kuyegeera Yeesu yi bamuyunviriza. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> babeere baabona ntyo, bamuveeba ntya: «Oyu muntu y'ayankirira abanyabyaaha n'okulya nabo!»<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Aliko Yeesu abachiira ogu mugani: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Nde omu mwabo, nk'agwerhe ntaama egana, agaheza nguma omu zo, k'arhakaleka zila zindi makumi gali mwenda na mwenda omu mpinga y'aja gushonda ela eherere kugera amango ayibona? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />N'akayibona, anayihira oku birhugo byaage n'obushagaluke bunene, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />anagaluka emwage, anahamagala beera baage n'abatuuranyi baage n'okubabwira ntya: ‹Mushagaluke haguma naani, bulaala nabwene entaama yaani yali herere.› <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Na ntyo mbabwirire byo, nji haaba obushagaluke bunene omu mpingu oku munyabyaaha muguma olekere ebyaaha byaage, ahaali h'abantu makumi gali mwenda na mwenda bakwaneene barhakeneere okuleka ebyaaha byaabo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani gw'egicheri chaheraga chanabonekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Mukazi muchi, nk'agwerhe bicheri ekumi by'efuranga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amango ma Yeesu, egicheri ch'efuranga chaali chingana n'omukamarho g'omuzizi muguma g'omukozi.</char></note> n'agaheza gicheri kiguma, k'arhagachaana etara, agahyaagira enju n'agashonda bwinjabwinja kugera amango achibona? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na hano abona echo gicheri, anahamagala abeerakazi n'abatuuranyi baage n'okuderha ntya: ‹Mushagaluke haguma naani, bulaala nabwene egicheri chaani ch'efuranga nalihezeze!› <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mbabwirire byo oku ntyo ku <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char> ba Nnamahanga banashagaluka nk'omunyabyaaha muguma alekere ebyaaha byaage.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omusole w'aliherere anashuba kubonekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Haliiri muntu muguma waligwerhe bagala babiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Omudoorho abwira eshe ntya: ‹Daarha, ompe echaani chigabi ch'agashambala chikwaneene kuba chaani.› Eshe abagabira bombi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Enyuma wa siku zigeeke, omugala mudoorho aguza omwandu gwage n'okugenda omu gihugo cha hale. Mw'echo gihugo ashandaguza ebikulo byaage omu boorhere bubi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Amalire kubishandaguza byooshi, enzara nene yaba mw'echo gihugo, arhondera kubula ngasi chintu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Aja agenda gukolera omuntu muguma w'echo gihugo. Oyo muntu amurhuma omu mashwa maage kulagira engulube. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Oyo murhabana alema agifiija kulya oku biryo by'engulube sy'aliko ntaaye wamuheere byo. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Buzinda agishuba ko, aderha ntya: ‹Abakozi booshi ba daarha bali omu muhimbo, n'obo nyoono hano ndi naafa n'enzara! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nagaluka emwa daarha, nanamubwira ntya: “Daarha, najirire echaaha embere za Nnamahanga n'embere zaawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ntachikwaneene kuyirikwa mugala waawe. Oje wantoola nka muguma w'omu bakozi baawe.”› <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ava agaluka, aja emw'eshe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Abeere achiri hale n'aha mwabo, eshe amulangiira, amuyunvira obonjo bunene. Alibirha kumulinga, amuhoobera.<figure style="fig" alt="Le garçon perdu est accueilli par son père" file="WA03876b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.20">Omusole waheraga ayankiirirwa n'eshe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Omugala aj'amubwira ntya: ‹Daarha, najirire echaaha emwa Nnamahanga n'emwawe, ntachikwaneene guhamagalwa mugala waawe.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Aliko eshe abwira abaja baage ntya: ‹Muyanguhe, muleerhe omwambalo gukwiriire bweneene mumuyambise go, mumuyambise olupeta oku mudoke munamuyambise ebiraato. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Muleerhe enyana eshishire muyibaage; rhujire edinye rhunasiime, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />bulaala oyu mugala waani abaaga afiire leero afuukire, abaaga aherere leero abonekere.› Banarhondera edinye.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Mw'ako gashanji, omugala w'efula aliiri omu shwa. Abeere agaluka, n'okuyegeera aha mwabo, ayunva abantu bali kuyimpa n'okuzina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ahamagala muguma omu bakozi b'eshe, amubaza bichi byabeere. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Omukozi amubwira ntya: ‹Mudoorho waawe agalukire bobunoola yisho ayirhire enyana eshishire, bulaala amubwene mugumaguma.› <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Oyo mugala w'efula ayunva oburhe, alahira kuja omu nju. Eshe ahuluka kumurhebeereza aje mo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Aliko abwira eshe ntya: ‹Tala! Hamaagera myaaka minene bweneene eyi ndi nagukolera. Ntashubiraga kuvuna erhegeko lyaawe chiro n'eliguma. N'obo orhashubiraga kumpa chiro omwana gw'empene yi nshagaluka haguma na beera baani. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Aliko oyu mugala waawe wahezeze ebikulo byaawe omu bubaraga, abeere agaluka, wamubagiire enyana eshishire!› <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Eshe amubwira ntya: ‹Mwana waani, oli haguma naani esiku zooshi, na byooshi ngwerhe biri byaawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Sy'aliko byaalihemere rhujire edinye n'ogushagaluka, bulaala oyu mwene wenyu abaaga afiire, aliko afuukire; abaaga aherere, aliko abonekere!›»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omwimangizi muhemusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yeesu ashuba kubwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Haliiri omuchire muguma waligwerhe omwimangizi w'ebikulo byaage. Abantu bayinja gusidaaka oyo mwimangizi emwa nnahamwabo oku agwerhe ashandaguza ebikulo byaage. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Nnahamwabo amuhamagala n'okumubwira ntya: ‹Bichi ndi nayunva baderha elugulu waawe? Nyeerekaga oluganjo lw'ebikulo byaani, bulaala orhagachiba mwimangizi wabyo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Oyo mwimangizi aderha ntya omu murhima gwage: ‹Nnahamwerhu akola kunyaga akaasi kaani. Bichi njirage? Ntaviire nakoomera oguhinga amashwa na kandi nji nagwarha eshoni z'oguhemuuza. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ahaa! Namaamenya echi naajira, yi haboneka abanyankiirira emwa baabo hano nkuulwa oku kaasi kaani.› <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Aja ahamagala ngasi muguma waligwerhe omwinda gwa nnahamwabo. Abaza omwambere ntya: ‹Mwinda munganachi gwa nnahamwerhu ogwerhe?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Amushubiza ntya: ‹Nkunguru egana z'amavurha.› Oyo mwimangizi w'ebikulo amubwira ntya: ‹Rhoola aka karataasi kayandikirwe k'omwinda gwawe; yikala juba oyandike nkunguru makumi marhaano.› <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ashuba kubwira owindi ogwerhe omwinda: ‹Naawe mwinda munganachi gwa nnahamwerhu ogwerhe?› Amushubiza ntya: ‹Bigunira egana by'amahemba.› Omwimangizi w'ebikulo amubwira ntya: ‹Rhoola aka karataasi kayandikirwe k'omwinda gwawe; yikala juba onayandike makumi gali munaane.› <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Nyina ebikulo asiima omwimangizi muhemusi, bulaala akolere n'obwenge. Bulaala, abantu b'eri gulu bayanguha omu bijiro byaabo kulusha abantu b'obumoleke.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Nyoono mbabwirire ntya: Muchijirire abeera haguma n'obuchire bubi bw'eri gulu, yi hano muba murhachigwerhe obuchire, abantu babayankiirire omu biikalo by'esiku n'amango.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />«Omuntu orhali muhemusi omu bintu bigeeke eyi arhanali muhemusi omu bintu binene; n'omuntu muhemusi omu bintu bigeeke eyi anali muhemusi omu bintu binene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Akaba leero mwabeere bantu bahemusi omu buchire bw'eri gulu, nde nji wabajira bimangizi b'obuchire bw'okuli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />N'akaba mwabeere bantu bahemusi omu bintu byabeene, nde nji wabaheereza ebintu bababikiire?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Nta muja wakagala gukolera ba shoobuja babiri: changwa anagaya muguma n'ogusiima owindi, changwa anagishwekera oku muguma n'okuboneerera owindi. Murhakagala gukolera Nnamahanga, munakolere ebikulo.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> babeere bayunva ebi binwa byooshi, barhondera gushekera Yeesu, bulaala basiimaga efuranga. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Muli bantu bachiyeerekana nka ab'okuli embere z'abantu, aliko Nnamahanga ayinji emirhima yenyu. Bulaala, ech'abantu barhoolere nka gikwaneene, chiba chigayisize Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«Egihe ch'<char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">eRhegeko</char> lya Muusa n'ebitaabu by'abaleebi chagendekeere kugera amango ma Yohaana Mubatiiza. Gurhengera amo mango, oMwazi Mwinja g'oBwami bwa Nnamahanga gwayamageezwe na ngasi muntu y'alwisa kuja mo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Aliko byakayolohera empingu n'egulu guhirima, ahaali h'ehinwa hityuuli hy'eRhegeko lya Nnamahanga hirhenge.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Ngasi mulume wayegwire mukaage n'agashaba owindi, eyi ajirire obuhushi, n'oshabire omukazi bayegwire, eyi naye ajirire obuhushi.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omuchire na Lazaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Haliiri mulume muguma w'omugale wagendaga ayambala emyambalo edukwire y'engulo nene. Oyo mugale agendaga ajira edinye ngasi lusiku. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Haliiri n'omukene muguma oyirikwa Lazaaro wabaaga alyaama embere w'omulyango gw'enju yaage. Omubiri gwa Lazaaro gwali guyunjwire ebihulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lazaaro aliiri guchifiija kulya orhuboole rhw'ebiryo rhwagendaga rhwarhoga oku meeza m'oyo mugale. Na kandi embwa zagenda zayinja kumiima ebihulu byaage. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Hagera olusiku oyo mukene afa. <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">Bamalahika</char> bamuheeka aha burhambi bw'<char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>. Ola mugale naye afa, bamuhamba. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Agerere ekuzimu, alibuka bweneene. Ayinamula ameesho, alangiira Abrahaamu na Lazaaro ali eburhambi bwage. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ava ayaama ntya: ‹Daarha Abrahaamu, ombeere obonjo; obwire Lazaaro ahire esongi ly'omudoke gwage omu menji, ambobeeze olulimi, bulaala ndi nalibuka bweneene m'ogu muliro.› <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Aliko Abrahaamu amushubiza ntya: ‹Mwana waani, yibuka oku waliyankiriire bintu binja binene omu kalamo kaawe, aliko Lazaaro yeewe aligwerhe malibuko manene. Bunoola, yeewe y'arhuleerezwa, aliko wooyo yi walibuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Na kandi, hali omuhonga guleehere bweneene ahagarhi kenyu neerhu. Cho girhumire, abashondere gurhenga eno kuja emunda muli barhakabigala. Na kandi ntaaye wakagala kugera eno munda rhuli gurhengera eyo munda muli.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Omugale aderha ntya: ‹Daarha wee, nguhemere n'obonjo, orhume Lazaaro omu mwerhu; <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />bulaala ngwerhe beene beerhu barhaano, aje kubahanuula yi nji barhayinja nabo hano hantu h'amalibuko.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abrahaamu amushubiza ntya: ‹Beene benyu bagwerhe ebitaabu bya <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> na eby'abaleebi, babiyunve.› <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Omugale aderha ntya: ‹Nangwa, daarha Abrahaamu, aliko nk'omuntu muguma afuukire akaja emunda bali, bakaleka ebyaaha byaabo.› <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Aliko Abrahaamu abwira omugale ntya: ‹Akaba barhashondere kuyunva Muusa n'abaleebi, barhakayemeera chiro omuntu wafuukire gurhenga omu bafu.›»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Okujira echaaha n'okubabalirwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:15">15</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mariko 9.42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yeesu abwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Ntaako byankaba yi habula ebyaarhuma abantu baajira ebyaaha, aliko buhanya buchi oku omuntu nji waaba mpanvu y'okujira echaaha! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kwakabeere kwinja oku yeewe, ashwekerwe olushyo omu gosi, anakabulwe omu nyanja, ahaali h'ogurhuma muguma mw'aba badoorho ajira echaaha. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Muchilange bwinja mwenyine!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Akaba mwene wenyu akujiriire echaaha, omuhanuule. Akaleka ebyaaha byaage, omubabalire. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />N'akaba akujiriire echaaha kali mushanvu omu lusiku, n'akayinja emunda oli kali mushanvu gukubwira ntya: ‹Nalekere ebyaaha byaani›, omubabalire.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obwemeezi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:19-20">Matayo 17.19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Entumwa</char> zabwira Nnaweerhu ntya: «Orhuyushuulire obwemeezi.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Nnaweerhu ashubiza ntya: «Nka mwaligwerhe chiro obwemeezi bugeeke kuguma n'ehiburho hye haradaali, mwakabwirire ogu murhi gw'agafuleesi ntya: ‹Chikundula onaje guchibyaala omu nyanja›, gwakanabakengere.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaasi k'omuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Nka muntu muguma omu mwabo agwerhe omuja ohinga eshwa changwa olagira ebirhungano byaage, hano amubona agaluka gurhenga omu shwa, k'akamubwira ayinje juba alye? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Nangwa, ahuubwe akamubwira ntya: ‹Nvuyira ebyaani biryo, onayambale bwinja, ompe ndye nanywe; naawe handeke walya onanywe buzinda.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Arhagasiimiriza omuja waage okw'ajirire eby'alirhegekerwe kujira, k'arhali ntyo? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Nenyu ntyo kubinali: hano nji muba mwamakola byooshi bibarhegekerwe, muderhe ntya: ‹Rhuli baja barhagwerhe kamaro, hoshaaho rhwajirire ebi rhwalihemerwe kujira.›»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya babenzibenzi ekumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yeesu abeere ali omu njira aja eYerusaleema, agera eburhambirhambi b'olubibi lugabire eSamariya n'eGalilaaya.<verse eid="LUK 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Abeere aja omu gishagala chiguma, ababenzibenzi ekumi bayinja kumushimaana. Bayimanga hale naye. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Barhondera kuyaama ntya: «Yeesu, Mwigiriza, orhubeere obonjo!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yeesu abeere ababona, ababwira ntya: «Muje guchiyeerekana emw'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abadaahwa</char>.» Babeere bali baaja yo, baava baafuma.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Muguma omu bo, abeere abona afumire, agaluka akuuza Nnamahanga n'omulenge munene. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Achikabula embere z'amagulu ma Yeesu, amalanga oku budaka, amubwira kooko. Oyu muntu aliiri Musamariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yeesu ava aderha ntya: «K'arhali booshi ekumi baafumaga? Ngahe bandi mwenda bali? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ka ntaaye wakengereere kugaluka gukuuza Nnamahanga, kuleka oyu orhali Muyaahudi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yeesu aja amubwira ntya: «Yimanga ogende, obwemeezi bwawe bwaguchungwire.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyinja k'oBwami bwa Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> baabaza Yeesu ntya: «Mango machi oBwami bwa Nnamahanga nji bwayinja?» Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «oBwami bwa Nnamahanga burhayinja bwachitaragaza. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Abantu barhakaderha ntya: ‹Mulolage! oBwami bwa Nnamahanga buli hano!›, changwa: ‹Buli halira!› Bulaala, mumenyage bwinja, oBwami bwa Nnamahanga buli ahagarhi kenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esiku za Mwene oMuntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:26-27">Matayo 24.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:21-22">Mariko 13.21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yeesu ashuba kubwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: «Agashanji kayinja nji mwachifiija kubona <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> chiro lusiku luguma, aliko nji murhamubona.<verse eid="LUK 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />«Abantu nji bababwira ntya: ‹Ali haliira!›, changwa: ‹Ali hano!› Murhalibirhiraga yo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Nka kula omubaraganyo gubaraganya omu nkuba gurhengera omu luhande luguma guhika omu lwindi, ntyo ku <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'aba omu olusiku lwage. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Aliko embere Mwene oMuntu agaluke, bihemere alibuke bweneene analahirwe n'echi gisisi.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:37-39">Matayo 24.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />«Nk'oku byabaaga omu siku za Noowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 6:5-12">Murhondero 6.5-12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 7:6-23">7.6-23</ref>.</char></note>, ku nji byaaba amango <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'agaluka. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Abantu bagendaga baalya n'okunywa, bagendaga baashaba n'ogushabwa, kugera oku lusiku Noowa ajaaga omu nkuge. Leero emisuuka minene yahulula, yabazisya booshi.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />«Kandi nji byaaba kuguma n'esiku za Looti: abantu bagendaga baalya n'okunywa, bagendaga baagula n'okuguza, bagendaga bahinga n'okuyumbaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Sy'aliko olusiku Looti arhengaga eSodoomo, omuliro n'ebiseese byarhoga gurengera oku nkuba nka nvula, byayirha abantu booshi. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Kandi ntyo ku nji byaaba olusiku <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'agaluka.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Matayo 24.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mariko 13.15-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Olo lusiku, omuntu nji waaba ali oku nju elugulu, arhajaaga omu nju gurhoola ebintu byaage. N'ola muntu nji waaba ali omu shwa lyaage arhachigalukaga emwage. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Muyibuke ebyahikiraga muka Looti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 19:26">Murhondero 19.26</ref>.</char></note>! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Omuntu nji washonda kulanga akalamo kaage nj'agaheza; aliko omuntu nji washonda kugaheza nj'akalanga.<verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:40-41">Matayo 24.40-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />«Mbabwirire, m'obo budufu, bantu babiri nji baaba balyaamire oku buliri buguma: muguma nj'aheekwa, owindi nj'alekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bakazi babiri nji baaba bali basyera haguma: muguma nj'aheekwa, owindi nj'alekwa. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bantu babiri nji baaba bali omu shwa: muguma nj'aheekwa, owindi nj'alekwa.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira by'eBibuliya.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Abigirizwa baabaza Yeesu ntya: «Nnaweerhu, ngahe ebyo nji byabeera?» Naye abashubiza ntya: «Ahali omurhumba, ho hagwirira banyunda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogu mugani guderhe oku ntaaye nji waafuma obuhane bwa Nnamahanga.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Omugani g'omuzuuzi muhemusi n'omushumbakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yeesu ashuba guchiira abigirizwa baage ogu mugani y'abayeereka oku bakwaneene gusaliira buzira kuluha. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Aderha ntya: «Omu gishagala chiguma haliiri omuzuuzi muguma orhayuubahaga Nnamahanga na nta muntu akengaga. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kandi mw'echo gishagala haliiri omushumbakazi muguma wagendaga aja kubwira oyo muzuuzi ntya: ‹Onchiire bwinja olushinja n'omushombanyi waani!› <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Halenga siku zinene alahiire kumuchiira lo. Aliko buzinda achibwira ntya: ‹Nachiro mpu ntayuubaha Nnamahanga na nta muntu nkenga, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />aliko bunoola oyu mushumbakazi ali andunza, namuchiira bwinja olushinja lwage, arhayinja kumbera erhwe.›» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Nnaweerhu aja aderha ntya: «Muyunve bwinja eby'oyu muzuuzi muhemusi aderhere! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ka Nnamahanga yeewe arhagachiira bwinja olushinja abantu baage achishogere, n'obo bali bamulilira ezuuba n'obudufu? Ka nj'alegama kubarhabaala? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mbabwirire oku Nnamahanga nj'abachiira bwinja olushinja jubaajuba. Sy'aliko amango <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> nj'agaluka, ka nj'abugaana obwemeezi omu gulu?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani g'oMufarisaayo n'omufurhiisa w'amakooli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yeesu ashuba gucha ogu mugani oku bantu baliiri guchiibona oku bakwaneene n'ogukena abandi bantu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Lusiku luguma, bantu babiri baja gusaliira omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>. Muguma aliiri <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">Mufarisaayo</char> n'owindi aliiri <char style="w" lemma="Bafurhiisa b'amakooli:">mufurhiisa w'amakooli</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />oMufarisaayo ayimanga, asaliira ntya omu murhima gwage: ‹Nnamahanga wee, nguheere obukuuze bulaala ntali kuguma n'abandi bantu. Boowe bali bishumuusi, barhakwaneene, bali bahushi. Kandi ntali kuguma n'oyu mufurhiisa w'amakooli. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nanchiibuza kulya kabiri omu boso, nampaana chigabi chiguma ch'ekumi ch'ebintu mbona.› <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Aliko omufurhiisa w'amakooli yeewe, aliyimangire hale. Chiro arhanagalaga kuyinamula ameesho elugulu, sy'aliko achishuurha egifuba omu kuyeerekana oku arhakwaneene. Aderha ntya: ‹Yoo! Nnamahanga, ombeere obonjo, nye munyabyaaha!› <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yeesu aja aderha ntya: ‹Mbabwirire, oyu mufurhiisa w'amakooli yi wagalukire emwage ey'akwaneene, si arhali ola Mufarisaayo. Kwenge ngasi muntu yeeshi wachizamuula nj'ayandagazwa, aliko ola wachiyandagaza nj'azamuulwa.›»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu agisha abaana badoorho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariko 10.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bantu baguma baleerhera Yeesu enjolyaana nazo mpu azigishe omu kuzihira kw'amaboko. <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> baage babeere baabona ntyo, bakalihira abo bantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Aliko Yeesu arhegeka oku bamuleerhere abo baana n'okuderha ntya: «Muleke abaana bayinje emunda ndi! Murhababuzaga, bulaala oBwami bwa Nnamahanga buli bw'abantu bali kuguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mbabwirire <char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">okuli</char>: omuntu orhayankiriire oBwami bwa Nnamahanga nka mwana mudoorho arhakabuja mo chiro n'ehityu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu aganiira n'omugale muguma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariko 10.17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Omukulu muguma w'aBayaahudi abaza Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza mwinja, bichi ngwasize kujira yi mbona akalamo k'esiku n'amango?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Gurhe wankanyirika mwinja? Nta muntu mwinja, arhali Nnamahanga yenyine. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Sy'omenyere amarhegeko: ‹Orhahushaga, orhayirhaga, orhazimbaga, orhahamiirizaga obubeeshi, okenge yisho na nyoko.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Lubunguluko 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Rhegeko 5.16-20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Oyo mukulu ashubiza ntya: «Ama marhegeko mooshi namakengere gurhenga ndi musole.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yeesu abeere ayunva ntyo, amubwira ntya: «Hachikubuliire kandi chintu chiguma: oguze ebintu byooshi ogwerhe, efuranga zarhenga mo ozigabire abakene, nji wanaja wagwarha obuchire omu mpingu. Wanaja wayinja n'okunkulikira.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Aliko oyo muntu abeere ayunva ntyo, agaya bweneene, bulaala aliiri muchire bweneene.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yeesu abwene oku agayire, aderha ntya: «Okuli, bikomereere abachire kuja omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Bulaala kuyoloheere bweneene engamiya kugera omu hirhule hy'esindani ahaali h'omugale kuja omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Abantu baliiri bamuyunviriza baderha ntya: «Nde leero wagachungulwa?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yeesu ashubiza ntya: «Ebirhakagalika oku bantu byakagalika emwa Nnamahanga.»<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petero aja aderha ntya: «Tala oku rhwewe rhwalekere ebintu rhwali rhugwerhe yi rhugukulikira.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Mbabwire <char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">okuli</char>, nta muntu walekere enju, mukaage, beene baabo, abazeere baage changwa abaana baage elugulu w'obwime bwa Nnamahanga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />orhakayankirira ebintu binene mu mano mango, n'omu siku zayinja nj'abona akalamo k'esiku n'amango.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abala kandi ogufa n'ogufuuka kwage</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariko 10.32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Buzinda bw'aho, Yeesu arhoola zila ntumwa zaage ekumi n'ebiri n'okuzibwira ntya: «Tala oku rhwazamuukira eYerusaleema; byooshi byayandikwaga n'abaleebi bilolere <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> byajirika. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bulaala nj'ahaanwa oku barhali Bayaahudi. Nji bamushinyagulira, nji bamulibuza, nji bamuchiira ko, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />nji bamushuurha, nji banamuyirha. N'olusiku lwa gasharhu nj'afuuka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Aliko barhayunvaga eby'echi chinwa chiderhere, bulaala byaali bishirwe. Barhaalimenyere bichi Yeesu ashondaga kuderha.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu afumya empumi eYeeriko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mariko 10.46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Amango Yeesu ayegeeraga egishagala ch'eYeeriko, haliiri empumi nguma yali yikeere eburhambi bw'enjira ey'eri yahemuuza. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Eyo mpumi yayunva abantu banene yi baagera, yanabaza bichi byabeere. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bayishubiza ntya: «Yeesu w'eNazareeti yeeri kulenga.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Empumi yaliika omulenge: «Yeesu, Mwene <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>, ombeere obonjo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abaliiri balambagira embere bayikalihira yi bayisizya, aliko yayaama bweneene: «Mwene Daawudi, ombeere obonjo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yeesu ayimanga n'ogurhegeka oku bayileerhere ye. Empumi yabeere yaagera hoofu naye, Yeesu ayibaza ntya: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Gichi oshondere nkujirirage?» Yashubiza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, nshube mbone.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yeesu ayishubiza ntya: «Shuba kubona; obwemeezi bwawe bwagufumize.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ho n'aho yabona n'okumukulikira ey'eri yakuuza Nnamahanga. Olubaga looshi lwabeere lwabona ebyoola, lwarhondera gukuuza Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Zaakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yeesu aliiri abalama kugerera omu gishagala ch'eYeeriko. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mw'echo gishagala mwaliiri omuntu muguma oyirikwa Zaakayo. Oyo Zaakayo aliiri mukulu w'abafurhiisa b'amakooli. Aliiri muchire. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Agendaga ashonda kubona Yeesu ali nde. Aliko, elugulu w'abantu banene arhakamubwene bulaala aliiri muufu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Alibirhira embere, anashona oku murhi g'omukuyu y'abona Yeesu, kwenge alikwaneene kulenga ahoola. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yeesu abeere agera ahoola, ayinamula ameesho anamubwira ntya: «Zaakayo, shonooka juba; bulaala bimpemere ndyaame emwawe zeene.» <figure style="fig" alt="Zachée montant sur le sycomore pour voir Jésus" file="WA03891b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="19.5">Zaakayo ashona oku murhi g'omukuyu y'alola ku Yeesu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zaakayo ashonooka juba, ayankirira Yeesu n'obushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Abantu booshi baabonaga ebyoola, balunduma n'okuderha ntya: «Mulolage! Oyu muntu ajiire kulyaama emw'omunyabyaaha!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Aliko Zaakayo ayimanga, abwira Nnaweerhu ntya: «Nnaweerhu! Naaha abakene oluhande lw'ebintu byaani, n'akaba hali eyi nalengenye echintu chaage, namugalulira cho eyi nkubire cho kane.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yeesu amubwira ntya: «Zeene obuchunguke bwahikire mw'eyila nju, bulaala oyu naye ali mugala w'<char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwenge <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ayinjire gushonda n'oguchungula abaherere.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani gwa baja ekumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25.14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Abantu babeere bayunva ebyoola, bakengeera okw'obwime bwa Nnamahanga bukola kubonekana ho n'aho, bulaala Yeesu aliiri hoofu n'eYerusaleema. Aja ashuba kubachiira ogu mugani. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Aderha ntya: «Haliiri murhwali muguma wajaaga omu gihugo cha hale mpu aje kuyimikirwa yo, buzinda agaluke kuyima omu gihugo chaage. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ahamagala bantu ekumi omu baja baage, abaha bicheri ekumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Egicheri kiguma chaali chingana omukamarho omukozi muguma agakolera siku egana.</char></note> n'okubabwira ntya: ‹Murhimbuule n'ezi furanga kugera amango nagaluka.› <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Aliko abantu b'egihugo chaage babaaga bamugayire. Baarhuma abantu enyuma zaage kuderha ntya: ‹Rhurhashonda oyu muntu abe mwami weerhu.›<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />«Abeere ayimikirwe, agaluka, ahamagaza bala baja ahaaga efuranga, mpu amenye enyungu nchi babwene omu burhimbuuzi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Omuja mwambere achimoleka n'okuderha ntya: ‹Waliha, egicheri chaawe chayungukire bindi ekumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mwami amubwira ntya: ‹Kooko, oli muja mwinja; bulaala orhabeere muhemusi omu bintu bigeeke, wagwarha oburhegesi oku bishagala ekumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Omuja wakabiri ayinja n'okuderha ntya: ‹Waliha, egicheri chaawe chayungukire bindi birhaano.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Mwami amubwira ntya: ‹Naawe waaba murhegesi wa bishagala birhaano.› <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Owindi muja ayinja n'okuderha ntya: ‹Waliha, tala egicheri chaawe, nalichibiikire omu gitambara, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />kwenge nali nkuyuubahire, bulaala oba muntu mudaarhi bweneene. Wooyo onarhoola eby'orhabiikaga, n'ogushaluula eby'orhahingaga.› <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mwami amubwira ntya: ‹Wooyo oli muja mubi, naguchiira olushinja gukulikirana n'ebinwa byaawe. Akaba waliyinji oku mba mudaarhi, oku ntoola ebi ntabiikaga n'oku nshaluula ebi ntahingaga, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />bichi byarhumaga orhahira efuranga zaani omu banke? Omu kugaluka kwani, nakazirhoolere n'enyungu!› <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Mwami aja abwira abantu baliiri ho ntya: ‹Mumunyage echo gicheri mugihe olaala ogwerhe bicheri ekumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Babwira mwami ntya: ‹Waliha, oyoola akola agwerhe bicheri ekumi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Abashubiza ntya: ‹Mbabwirire oku ogwerhe akantu yi nji baheereza akandi, aliko orhagwerhe kantu nji bamunyaga n'ehintu hityuuli agwerhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />N'bashombanyi baani boowe, barhalishondere oku mbe mwami waabo, mubaleerhe hano munabayirhire embere zaani.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu aja eYerusaleema</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Matayo 21.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mariko 11.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yohaana 12.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yeesu abeere amala kuderha ntyo, aja embere z'abantu eyi bali bayeerekera eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Abeere agera hoofu n'egishagala ch'eBetefaage n'eche Betaniiya, hoofu n'omusozi gw'<char style="w" lemma="Muzeituuni">eMizeyituuni</char>, arhuma <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">bigirizwa</char> baage babiri, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ababwira ntya: «Muje omu gishagala chiri embere zenyu. Hano muchigera mo, mwashimaana omwana gw'epunda gushwekerwe, nta muntu oshubiraga yikala oku go. Mugishwekuule munachileerhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nka hali omuntu obabazize ntya: ‹Gichi girhumire muli mwagishwekuula?› Mumushubize oku Nnaweerhu achilagire ko.»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Abo bigirizwa barhumwaga bagenda, banabugaana byooshi nk'oku Yeesu ababwiraga. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Babeere bali bashwekuula omwana gw'epunda, banyina go bababaza ntya: «Gichi girhumire muli mwashwekuula ogu mwana gw'epunda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Baashubiza ntya: «Nnaweerhu agulagire ko.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Baja baguleerhera Yeesu. Baava baasasa ko emyambalo n'okumuyikaza ko. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Okw'ali agenda, abantu baalema baasasa emyambalo yaabo omu njira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yeesu abeere ali ayegeera hoofu n'omwandagalo gw'omusozi gw'<char style="w" lemma="Muzeituuni">eMizeyituuni</char>, echigusho chooshi ch'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage, babaaga bali kugenda baamoga. Babaaga bali bakuuza Nnamahanga n'omulenge munene, elugulu w'ebisomereene byooshi bali babwene ko. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Baliiri kuderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Agishwe, oMwami wayinjire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Omurhuula gube omu mpingu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">n'obulangashane emwa Nnamahanga!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> baguma, baliiri omu lubaga lw'abantu, babwira Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza, okalihire <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baawe basire.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Mbabwirire byo, bagasira, amabaale mo mayaama!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alakira egishagala ch'eYerusaleema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Amango Yeesu ageraga hoofu n'egishagala ch'eYerusaleema, abeere abona cho, alakira cho. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Aderha ntya: «Nka naawe wamenyaga zeene ebyagakuleerhera omurhuula! Aliko bunoola bibishirwe, orhakabibona. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwenge esiku zakuyinjira amango bashombanyi baawe bakuzirhira ko olugurhu, bakugorha n'okugufundeeza enyunda zooshi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baguhomboola looshi, wooyo n'abantu baawe. Barhagakulekera baale oku lindi, bulaala orhamenyaga egihe Nnamahanga ayinjaga gukulwira ko!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alibisya abarhimbuuzi omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mariko 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-17">Yohaana 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yeesu abeere aja omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>, arhondera kulibisya abarhimbuuzi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Ava ababwira ntya: «Biyandikirwe: ‹Enju yaani nji yaaba nju y'amasaala.› Aliko mwabo mwayijirire lukunda lw'abeezi!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isaya 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremiya 7.11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yeesu agendaga ayigiriza esiku zooshi omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Abakulu b'abadaahwa</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'abashamuka b'aBayaahudi balemaga bashonda kumuyirha. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Aliko bafundwa, bulaala abantu booshi baliiri bamuyunviriza bwinja buzira kuluha.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Oburhegesi bwa Yeesu ngahe burhengeere?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariko 11.27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lusiku luguma, oku Yeesu ali ayigiriza abantu omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> n'okubala oMwanzi Mwinja, ho n'aho <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char>, haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi baahulukira. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Baava baamubaza ntya: «Orhubwire oku burhegesi bwa nde oli waajira ebi bintu. Nde ye waguhaaga obu burhegesi?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Naani, nababaza echibazo chiguma, munshubize: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />‹<char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">Obubatiizo</char> bwa Yohaana ka bwarhengeraga empingu changwa emw'abantu?›» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Babwirana ntya bonyine oku bonyine: «Rhukaderha okw'empingu, arhubaza gichi charhumaga rhurhamuyemeera. <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kandi rhugashubiza oku emw'abantu, olubaga looshi lwarhuyirhiisa amabaale, kwenge lwali luyemereere oku Yohaana aliiri muleebi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ntyo ku bamushubiize oku barhenji ngahe bwarhengeraga. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yeesu aja ababwira ntya: «Ko n'oko naani, ntababwira oku burhegesi bwa nde njira ebi bintu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omugani gw'abahinzi babi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariko 12.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Kandi Yeesu ashuba kubachiira guno mugani: «Haliiri muntu muguma wahingaga eshwa ly'emizabiibu, aliyadiisa abahinzi n'okubalama siku zinene. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Egihe ch'ogushaluula chabeere chagera ho, arhuma omuja waage emwa bala bahinzi mpu bamuheerezage amaage malehe m'eshwa. Aliko abo bahinzi bashuurha oyo muja n'okumugalula maboko moomu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nyina eshwa ashuba gurhuma owindi muja. Naye bamushuurha, bamudukanga, banamugalula maboko moomu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ashuba gurhuma omuja wa gasharhu. Bamukoromesa, banamukabula embuga. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Nyina eshwa aderha ntya: ‹Gurhe naaja naajira? Naaja narhuma mugala waani muzigirwa, nkabaga yeewe bamukenga.› <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Aliko balaala bahinzi babeere bamulangiira, babwirana ntya: ‹Tala, oyuula yi waaba nyina agashambala! Rhumuyirhe, y'agashambala kaba keerhu.› <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bamukuula omu shwa, banamuyirha.» Yeesu aja abaza abantu ntya: «Nyina eshwa gurhe nj'ajira aboola bahinzi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Nj'agaluka, nj'anayirha aboola bahinzi, nj'anaheereza abandi eshwa.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Abantu babeere bayunva ntyo, baaderha ntya: «Ebiri ntya birhahira bikaba!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Aliko Yeesu abaloleereza, aderha ntya: «Echi chinwa chiyandikirwe gurhe chiderhere?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Ebaale ab'okuyumbaka balahiraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">lyo lyahindukire ly'engenzi, ly'okuyumbakira ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nanga 118.22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ngasi muntu nji wakumbagala kw'eryo baale nj'avunagulika; n'eyi nji lyarhogera ko nji lyamuhomboola.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ho n'aho, <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> bashonda ogushweka Yeesu, bulaala bali bayinji oku bo baderherwe mw'ogu mugani. Aliko bayuubaha abantu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echibazo ch'ogufurha ekooli lya Kayizaari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariko 12.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Abo bakulu b'aBayaahudi barhondera guhenguuza Yeesu. Baamurhumira abantu b'okumuneeka, baliiri kubonekana nka bali b'okuli yi bamufarhira omu nderho, n'okulengera eyo njira bagale kumuhaana omu maboko m'omurhegesi w'egihugo. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aba bantu baabaza Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza, rhuyinji oku oderha n'okuyigiriza bwinja; orhajira kaboolo, aliko oyigiriza enjira ya Nnamahanga gukulikirana n'okuli. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Orhubwirage leero, k'amarhegeko meerhu mayemereere changwa malahiire gufurha ekooli emwa <char style="w" lemma="Kayizaari:">Kayizaari</char>?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Aliko Yeesu amenya obulyaalya bwabo, ababaza ntya: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Munyereke egicheri chiguma ch'<char style="w" lemma="Dinaari:">edinaari</char>. Giheekere eshusho n'eziino lya nde?» Baashubiza ntya: «Biri bya Kayizaari.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yeesu aja ababwira ntya: «Mugende mwaheereza Kayizaari ebiri byaage, na Nnamahanga naye ebiri byaage.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bafundwa kumufarhira oku chiguma omu binwa byaage embere z'olubaga. Basoomererwa egishubizo chaage, baava baasira.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echibazo ch'ogufuuka kw'abafu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariko 12.18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Buzinda bw'aho, <char style="w" lemma="Basadukaayo:">aBasadukaayo</char> baguma baaja emwa Yeesu. aBasadukaayo bo barhayemeeraga obufuuke bw'abafu. Bayinja kubaza Yeesu ntya: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Mwigiriza, tala oku <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> arhuyandikiire ntya: ‹Nk'omulume aligwerhe omukazi, aliko agafa buzira mwana, mwene waabo anarhoola oyo mukazi n'okuburhira nyagufa abaana.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 38:8">Murhondero 38.8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Rhegeko 25.5-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Leero haliiri bazaana mushanvu ba nda nguma. Omwambere ashaba n'ogufa buzira mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Owakabiri naye ayingira ola mukazi, naye afa buzira mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />N'owagasharhu naye ko n'oko. Byaaba ntyo oku booshi mushanvu, baafa buzira kuleka abaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Aha buzinda, ola mukazi naye afa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Leero amango m'ogufuuka, oyo mukazi nj'aba wa nde? Bulaala aliiri mukaabo booshi oku bali mushanvu!»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeesu abashubiza ntya: «Mu lino gulu, abalume n'abakazi yi bashabana. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Aliko abaganjirwe kulama mw'elyo gulu lyayinja n'ogufuuka gurhenga omu bafu nji barhaashaba changwa gushabwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Barhaakanafa, bulaala bali kuguma na bamalahika, bali bagala ba Nnamahanga kwenge bafuukire. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> ayerekeene bwinjabwinja oku abafu nji bafuuka. Omu mandiko maage aderhere elugulu w'egishaka chagulumiraga. Yeewe aderhere oku Nnaweerhu ali ‹Nnamahanga wa <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>, Nnamahanga wa Isaka na Nnamahanga wa Yakobo.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 3:2-6">Lubunguluko 3.2-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Nnamahanga arhali w'abafu, aliko w'abalamire; kwenge oku yeewe booshi balamire.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko: ">Abigiriza baguma b'amarhegeko</char> bashubiza ntya: «Mwigiriza, waderhere bwinja.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Barhagishubiraga chiro kubaza liguma.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisitu na Daawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariko 12.35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yeesu abaza abantu baliiri ahoola ntya: «Gurhe abantu bakaderha mpu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> ali mugala wa <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Daawudi yenyine aderhere ntya omu gitaabu ch'eNanga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga abwirire Nnaweerhu ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Yikale ekulyo kwani,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />guhika amango nji naajira bashombanyi baawe ndabarhiro yaawe.”›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nanga 110.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Leero akonva <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> amuyirikire Nnaweerhu, gurhe akaja aba mugala waage?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abwira abigirizwa baage bachilange n'abigiriza b'amarhegeko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1">Matayo 23.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:5-7">5-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:37-40">Mariko 12.37-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Abantu booshi babeere bali bayunviriza Yeesu, abwira <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage ntya: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Muchilange oku <char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko: ">bigiriza b'amarhegeko</char>. Basiima guchilambagiza n'efulema zileehere, n'okulamuswa n'obukenge ah'abantu banene bali, okuyikala oku ntebe z'embere omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char> n'omu madinye. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bananyaga abashumbakazi ebintu byaabo byooshi. N'omu guchisiisa, banajira amasaala maleehere. Abo bantu, nji baahanwa bweneene.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Entuulo y'omushumbakazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mariko 12.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yeesu ayinamula ameesho, abona abagale bali bahira entuulo zaabo omu gasanduku k'entuulo k'omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Abona omushumbakazi muguma w'omukene naye ahira mo rhucheri rhubiri rhw'efuranga. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yeesu ava aderha ntya: «Okuli mbabwirire, oyu mushumbakazi w'omukene arhuulire kulusha abandi booshi; <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />kwenge abandi bantu booshi barhuulire nka ntuulo efuranga barhaalichilagire ko. Aliko yeewe, omu bukene bwage, arhuulire byooshi aligwerhe by'okulama nabyo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abala ogushandwa kw'eNju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mariko 13.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bantu baguma babeere bali baderha okw'<char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">eNju ya Nnamahanga</char> eyumbakirwe n'amabaale menja, na kandi epambirwe n'ebintu abantu barhuuliraga Nnamahanga, Yeesu aderha ntya:<figure style="fig" alt="Temple de Jérusalem" file="LB00250B.TIF" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="21.5">eNju ya Nnamahanga y'eYerusaleema</figure> <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Hayinja esiku, ebiila muli kubona ko, harhagasigala baale oku lindi lirhagahiningulwa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebimenyeeso by'amalibuko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-8">Matayo 24.3-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-8">Mariko 13.3-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Abo bantu baabaza Yeesu ntya: «Mwigiriza, lyaali ebyoola nji byaahika? Chimenyeeso gichi nji chayeerekana oku byashonda kujirika?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yeesu ashubiza ntya: «Muchilange, mumenye mwagahera. Bantu banene nji bayinja omu gukoleesa eziino lyaani n'okuderha ntya: ‹Nye Masiiya!›, na kandi: ‹Egihe chayeneere!› Aliko murhabakulikiraga. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Amango nji mwayunva badeerha emyaazi y'ebiirha na ey'okulwisa abarhegesi, murhayuubahaga. Kwenge ebyoola bikwaneene gurhanga kujirika. Aliko eyi burhaza kuba b'obuzinda bwa lino gulu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yeesu aja alema ababwira ntya: «Egihugo nji chalwisa echindi gihugo, n'obwami nji bwalwisa obwindi bwami. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nji haaba emisisi mineneenene, n'omu hantu hanene, nji haaba enzara n'endwala zinene z'okuyaahukira. Nji haaba kandi ebigiriginjo biyuubahize n'ebimenyeeso by'arhengera omu nkuba.»<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amalibuko nji maaba embere w'egihe ch'obuzinda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Matayo 10.17-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:9-12">Mariko 13.9-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Aliko, embere z'ebi byooshi, abantu nji babagwarha n'okubalibuza. Nji babahaana omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char>, nji banabahira omu munyororo. Ko n'oko, nji babasidaakira embere z'abaami n'abakulu b'egihugo elugulu w'eziino lyaani. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ebyoola nji byaarhuma mwahamiiriza ebi munyinji ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mumenye bwinja omu mirhima yenyu oku murhakwaneene gurheganya gurhe mwabuurana. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Bulaala nyoono, nji naabaha nyenyine echinwa n'obwenge bunene, oku bulyo bashombanyi benyu barhakagala kubahima changwa kulahira ebi mwaderhere. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nji mwalenganywa n'abazeere benyu, na beene benyu, na ab'omulala gwenyu, na beera benyu. Na baguma omu mwabo nji bayirhwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:9-13">Matayo 24.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mariko 13.13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />«Abantu booshi nji babashomba elugulu w'eziino lyaani. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Aliko nta luviiri luguma l'oku rhwe lyenyu nji lwahera. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Omu guchihangaana kwenyu, mwachungula akalamo kenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogushandwa kw'egishagala ch'eYerusaleema</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-22">Matayo 24.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-20">Mariko 13.14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Hano nji mubona egishagala ch'eYerusaleema chagorherwe n'ebigusho by'abasoda, mwanaja mwamenya oku ogushandaazwa kwacho kwagerere hoofu. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Leero, abantu nji baaba bali <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> balibirhire omu misozi. N'aba nji baaba bali omu gishagala ch'eYerusaleema barhenge mo, n'aba nji baaba bali omu rhwango barhajaaga eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwenge nji zaaba siku z'oguhanwa kw'abantu, yi byooshi biyandikirwe bijirika. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Buhanya buchi oku bakazi nji baaba bali bukule n'oku balaala nji baaba bali kuyonsa mw'ezoola siku! Nji haaba amalibuko manene omu gihugo, n'oburhe bwa Nnamahanga nji bwaba kw'olu lubaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baguma nji bayirhwa n'engoorho, abandi nji baheekwa buja omu bihugo byooshi, na Yerusaleema nj'alabarhwa n'abapagaani, kugera amango egihe chaabo nji chayeenera.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyinja kwa Mwene oMuntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariko 13.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Nji haaba ebimenyeeso omu zuuba, omu gahembi n'omu nyenyeezi. Na hano oku gulu nako, embaga nji zaaba omu malibuko n'ogufarhwa n'obuuba elugulu w'olwamo n'emilaba y'enyanja. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Abantu nji baalaba n'obuuba bunene omu kulinga ebi nji byayinjira egulu, kwenge byooshi bigwerhe obuhashe omu chaalege nji byashaganywa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Nji baaja baabona <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ayinjire omu bichu haguma n'obuhashe n'obukuuze bunene. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Hano ebyoola nji birhondera kuyinja, muyimange bwinjabwinja murhanayuubahaga, bulaala obuchunguke bwenyu bwayegereere.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obwime bwa Nnamahanga buli hoofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariko 13.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Buzinda bw'aho, Yeesu abachiira guno mugani: «Mulole omurhi gw'omutiini n'eyindi mirhi yooshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Eyi mubona yaashoga, munamenya mwenyine okw'echanda chiri hoofu. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ko n'oko kandi, amango nji mwabona ebyoola byayinja, mumenye okw'obwime bwa Nnamahanga buli hoofu. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" /><char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">Okuli</char>, mbabwirire, echi gisisi girhakagera ebyoola byooshi birhanaza kuyinja. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Empingu n'egulu nji byaahirima, aliko ebinwa byaani birhagahirima.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okulingiriza oguhika kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Muchilange, emirhima yenyu yakayinja zikira omu budambi, omu bulalu, n'enyifinjo z'akalamo, y'olusiku luzinda lwakayinja kubagera ko buzira kumenya, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kula omurhego gushuuduka. Kwenge nji lwayinjira abantu booshi balamire oku gulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mutarame, munasaliire ngasi gashanji, yi mugwarha emisi y'ogufuma byooshi byayinja, n'okugala kuyimanga embere za <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu agendeerera kuyigiriza omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mw'ezoola siku, Yeesu agendaga ayigiriza omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> ezuuba. N'obudufu, agendaga aja kulyaama oku musozi gw'<char style="w" lemma="Muzeituuni">eMizeyituuni</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Olubaga looshi lwagendaga lwaja emunda ali omu Nju ya Nnamahanga eseeziseezi kumuyunviriza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Omuhigo g'okulenganya Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26.1-5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariko 14.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Olusiku lukulu lw'emigati nzira chachu, luyirikwa <char style="w">Paasaka</char>, lwabaaga luli hoofu. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> baliiri bashonda gurhe bakayirhiisa Yeesu. Aliko baliiri bayuubaha olubaga.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Shetaani aja aja mu <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya:">Yuuda</char>, ola bayirikaga Isikariyooti, waliiri muguma w'omu zila ntumwa ekumi n'ebiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuuda aja kuganiira haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'abakulu b'abalanzi b'eNju ya Nnamahanga gurhe akalenganya Yeesu emunda bali. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Basiima n'okulagaanana okumuha efuranga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuuda ayemeera n'ogurhondera kulonza agashanji gakwiriire k'okumuha bo buzira abantu kumenya.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu arheganyisa ebiryo by'ePaasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Matayo 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mariko 14.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Olusiku lukulu lw'emigati nzira chachu lwahika. Olo lusiku, y'aBayaahudi balikwaneene kubaaga omwanabuzi gw'<char style="w" lemma="Paasaka">ePaasaka</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yeesu arhuma Petero na Yohaana ntya: «Muje gurhurheganyiza ebiryo by'<char style="w" lemma="Paasaka">ePaasaka</char>, rhuyinje kubisangira.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Baamubaza ntya: «Ngahe osiimire rhubirheganyizage?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Abashubiza ntya: «Muyunvirize, hanoola muhika omu gishagala, mwashimaana omulume oheekere endaha y'amenji. Mumukulikire omu nju ayinja kuja mo. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mwakabwira nyina enju ntya: ‹Mwigiriza abazize mpu ngahe echumbi liri aliira mw'ebiryo by'ePaasaka haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> baage.› <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Abayeereka echumbi linene lirheganyizwe omu gorofa, omoola mu mwarheganyiza ebiryo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bagenda, bashimaana ebintu byooshi kulaala Yeesu ababwiraga. Baaja barheganya ebiryo by'ePaasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebiryo by'okuyibuka Nnaweerhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20">Matayo 26.20</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17">Mariko 14.17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">22-25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Bakorinto 11.23-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ebishanji by'okulya byabeere byaahika, Yeesu ayikala kulya haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">entumwa</char> zaage.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus mange la nourriture de Paque avec ses disciples" file="WA03910b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.14">Yeesu alya ebiryo by'ePaasaka haguma n'entumwa zaage</figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Azibwira ntya: «Nachifiijaga bweneene kulya haguma nenyu eyi <char style="w">Paasaka</char> embere ndibuke. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kwenge, mbabwirire okuli, ntagachiyirya kugera amango nji yayeenera omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Arhoola engumbu y'edivaayi, akuuza Nnamahanga n'okuderha ntya: «Murhoole eyi ngumbu, ngasi muguma anywe ko. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kwenge mbabwirire okuli, ntagachinywa chiro oku divaayi y'omuzabiibu kugera amango Nnamahanga nji ayimanza obwime bwage.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ashuba gurhoola omugati. Abeere amala gukuuza Nnamahanga, agucha mo, abaheereza go n'okuderha ntya: «Oguula guli mubiri gwani, guhaanirwe elugulu wenyu. Mugende mwajira ntya omu kunyibuka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ko n'oko enyuma z'okulya, arhoola engumbu, aderha ntya: «Eyi ngumbu eri <char style="w" lemma="Gihango:">gihango</char> gihyaahya cha Nnamahanga haguma n'abantu baage kulengera eshagama yaani yasheeshekala elugulu wenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abala oku bamulenganya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:21-25">Matayo 26.21-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:18-21">Mariko 14.18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Aliko tala k'owampaana ali kulya haguma naani. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> aja gufa nk'oku Nnamahanga arheganyaga. Aliko, buhanya buchi oku muntu wamuhaana!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Abigirizwa baava barhondera kubazana nde omu boowe waajira echi chintu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nde ye mukulu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:24-28">Matayo 20.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19.28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:41-45">Mariko 10.41-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Buzinda, haahulukira entonganyi ahagarhi k'abigirizwa ba Yeesu, mpu nde wakaba mukulu ahagarhi kaabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeesu abwira bo ntya: «Abaami b'abapagaani banabarhegeka nka baja, n'abagwerhe obuhashe oku bantu bachiyirika ‹banyamenja.› <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Aliko mwabo, birhabaaga ntyo. Ahuubwe, oli mukulu omu mwabo ahinduke nka ye mudoorho, n'orhambwire, abe nka ye mukozi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Leero, nde y'eri mukulu oku windi: oyikeere n'okulya changwa oli kumuyuuhulira? K'arhali olaala oyikeere n'okulya? Ahuubwe, nyoono ndi ahagarhi kenyu nka mukozi.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />«Mwewe mwachihangaanire kubeera haguma naani omu bigeregezo byaani. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Cho girhumire mbarheganyiize obwami nk'oku naani Daarha abunrheganyizaga, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />yi mulya n'okunywa oku meeza maani, omu Bwami bwani. Kandi muyikale oku ntebe z'obwami yi muchiira olushinja emilala ekumi n'ebiri y'eIsraheeli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ashambaala oku Simooni Petero amuhakana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:37-38">Yohaana 13.37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yeesu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Simooni, Simooni, Shetaani abahemere oku mugere omu bigeregezo kuguma n'oku bayeera amahemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Aliko nagusaliriire wooyo Simooni, y'obwemeezi bwawe burhaheraga looshi. Na hanoola ongalukira, okomeze beene benyu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petero amubwira ntya: «Nnaweerhu, nayemereere kugenda naawe nachiro akaba omu munyororo changwa omu lufu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Petero, nkubwirire okuli, embere oluhazi lubike zeene, waaba eyi wamampakana gasharhu oku orhanyinji.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abwira abigirizwa bachirheganye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yeesu ashuba kubabaza ntya: «Amango nabarhumaga buzira shaho, buzira chigunira n'ebiraato, ka mwalibulire chintu?» Bamushubiza ntya: «Ntaacho.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Ahuubwe leero, ogwerhe eshaho n'echigunira abirhoole. N'orhagwerhe engoorho aguze efulema yaage y'agula nguma. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwenge mbabwirire okuli, bihemere ebiyandikirwe binjirike ko: ‹Bamuganjire omu bajira amabi.› Leero, ebiyandikirwe elugulu waani bikola kujirika.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Abigirizwa bamubwira ntya: «Nnaweerhu, tala ngoorho ebiri.» Naye ababwira ntya: «Mulekere ahoola!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Byakayunviikana oku baguma okw'engoorho ebiri zirhageehere; oku bandi, obo entumwa zirhayunvaga ebi Yeesu ashondaga kubabwira, Yeesu alahira oku bagendekere n'eyo nganiiro; osome </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:26">Rhegeko 3.26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu asaliira oku musozi gw'eMizeyituuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariko 14.32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yeesu arhenga mw'echo gishagala, aja oku musozi gw'<char style="w" lemma="Muzeituuni">eMizeyituuni</char> nka okw'azigaanaga. <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">Abigirizwa</char> baage bamukulikira. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Agerere ahoola, ababwira ntya: «Musaliire, yi murhaja omu bigeregezo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ava achikuula haguma nabo, aja oku bule nka ah'omuntu akagala kulekera ebaale, afukama, asaliira Nnamahanga ntya: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Daarha, akaba ntya b'obulonza bwawe, ohire hale naani eyi ngumbu y'amalibuko. Aliko, burhabaaga bulonza bwani bo bujirikage, sy'obulonza bwawe.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ho n'aho, malahika amubonekera gurhenga empingu gushuba kumuheereza emisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yeesu abeere ababeere bweneene, ashuba gusaliira n'obushiru kulusha. Entuubano yaage yaba nka mirhonyi y'eshagama eri gurhoga oku budaka.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.43-44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezi nkere zirhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira by'eBibuliya.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Amalire gusaliira, ayimanga n'okuja emunda abigirizwa bali. Ashimaana balyaamire elugulu w'amaganya manene. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Abaza bo ntya: «Charhumire mwalyaama? Muzuuke munasaliire, yi murhaja omu bigeregezo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufarhwa kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-49">Mariko 14.43-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohaana 18.3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yeesu abeere achiri aderha, ho n'aho abantu banene baahika. <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya:">Yuuda</char>, ola muguma w'omu zila ntumwa ekumi n'ebiri, aliiri kulambagira embere zaabo. Ashegera hoofu na Yeesu y'amuhoobera. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yeesu amubaza ntya: «Yuuda, omu kumuhoobera mu wamalenganya <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char>?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Abigirizwa baliiri haguma na Yeesu babeere baabona ebyaja kuba, baamubaza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, ka rhubashogoorhe n'engoorho?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ho n'aho, mwigirizwa muguma ashinjibula ogurhwi kw'emalyo k'omuja w'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa mukulu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Aliko Yeesu aderha ntya: «Lekera aho!» Ava ahuma oku gurhwi k'oyo mulume n'okugufumya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Omu bayinjaga gufarha Yeesu mwaliiri <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char>, abimangizi b'abalanzi b'<char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">eNju ya Nnamahanga</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi. Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Mwayinjire n'engoorho n'enkoni, owamenya mpu ndi gishumuusi! <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Esiku zooshi, naliiri haguma nenyu omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, murhayinjaga kunfarha. Aliko chinoola gihe gikola chenyu na ech'obuhashe b'omwizimya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero ahakana Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-27:1">Matayo 26.57–27.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-15:1">Mariko 14.53–15.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-27">Yohaana 18.13-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Abo bantu baafarha Yeesu, bamuheeka omu nju y'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa mukulu</char>. Petero abakulikira buzira kubayegeera. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bachaana omuliro ahagarhi k'embuga, bayikala. Petero naye ayikala ahagarhi kaabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Elugulu w'obumoleke b'omuliro, omuja muguma w'omukazi abona Petero ayikeere. Amuloleereza n'okuderha ntya: «Oyuula naye aliiri haguma n'ola muntu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Aliko Petero ahakana, aderha ntya: «Ego mukazi, nyoono ntamuyinji!» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Hagerere hishanji higeeke, owindi muntu amubona n'okuderha ntya: «Naawe, oli muguma wabo.» Petero naye aderha ntya: «Nangwa maani, ntali muguma wabo!» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Hagerere nka saa nguma, kandi owindi muntu ayemeereza ntya: «Okuli, oyu mulume aliiri haguma na Yeesu, kwenge naye ali Mugalilaaya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petero ashubiza ntya: «Muza wee, ntamenyere ebi washonda kuderha!» Ho n'aho, oku achiri aderha, oluhazi lwabika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Nnaweerhu ava ahindamuka n'okulola Petero. Petero ayibuka echinwa Nnaweerhu amubwiraga oku: «Embere oluhazi lubike zeene, waaba eyi wamampakana gasharhu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petero ahuluka, alira bweneene.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Abantu bali bafarhire Yeesu, baalema bamushuuka n'okumushuurha. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Baamuhubya ameesho n'okulema bamubwira ntya: «Leeba! Orhubwire nde wamagushuurha!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Baashuba kulema bamudukanga ebindi bidusi binene.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu asidaakwa omu kabuga k'aBayaahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariko 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohaana 18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bwabeere bwacha, abashamuka b'aBayaahudi, <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> bachiigusha haguma. Baheeka Yeesu omu <char style="w" lemma="Kabuga k'aBayaahudi:">kabuga</char> kaabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bamubwira ntya: «Akaba wooyo we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, orhubwirage.» Naye abashubiza ntya: «Nkababwira ko murhakayemeera! <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Naani nkola nababaza, murhanshubiza. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Aliko gurhengera buno, <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> aba ayikeere emalyo ma Nnamahanga w'obuhashe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Booshi baabaza ntya: «Ka gasi wooyo we Mwene Nnamahanga?» Abashubiza ntya: «Mwewe mwe muderhere oku ndi ye.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Baava baaderha ntya: «Bwindi buhamiiriza buchi rhulagire ko? Rhwayunviirhe rhwenyine eby'aderhere!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu asidaakwa embere za Pilaato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:2">Matayo 27.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariko 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Yohaana 18.28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Bala bantu booshi babaaga bali omu kabuga k'aBayaahudi bayimanga, baheeka Yeesu embere z'omwimangizi Pilaato.<verse eid="LUK 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Barhondera kumusidaaka, baderha ntya: «Rhwabugaanire oyu muntu ali ararusa olubaga lwerhu; ali abuza guhaana ekooli emwa mwami mukulu <char style="w" lemma="Kayizaari:">Kayizaari</char>, anali achiiderha yenyine oku ali <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, k'okuderha mwami.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilaato amubaza ntya: «Ka wooyo oli mwami w'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char>?» Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «Wooyo, we waderhere ntyo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilaato abwira <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'olubaga lw'abantu ntya: «Ntaacho nabwene emw'oyu muntu chagarhuma ahanwa.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Aliko, baharhiiriza n'okuderha ntya: «Enyigirizo zaage yi zaarhuma abantu balwisa abakulu omu <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">Yudeeya</char> yooshi. Arhangiriraga eGalilaaya, leero ali kuno.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu embere za mwami Heroode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilaato abeere ayunva ebyoola, abaza akaba oyu muntu aliiri Mugalilaaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Abeere amenya oku Yeesu arhengera omu gihugo girhegekerwe na <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char>, amurhuma emwa Heroode, kwenge naye aliiri eYerusaleema mw'ezoola siku.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> abeere abona Yeesu, ashagaluka bweneene. Gurhengera miira, aliiri ashonda kumubona kwenge abaaga ayunviirhe emyaazi yaage. Na kandi, aliiri alangaalira okubona Yeesu ajira egisomereene. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Heroode amubaziiriza, aliko Yeesu ntaacho amushubize. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" /><char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> baliiri ahoola, bamusidaaka n'obukali bunene. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Heroode naye, haguma n'abasoda baage, bashekera Yeesu n'okumukena. Bamalire kumushekera n'okumuyambisa omwambalo gukwiriire bweneene, ashuba kugalula Yeesu emwa Pilaato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Olo lusiku, Heroode na Pilaato baaba beera, n'obo embere baliiri banzi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu achiirwa olushinja mpw'afe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">Matayo 27.11-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Mariko 15.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohaana 18.39–19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilaato ahamagaza <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char>, abimangizi b'aBayaahudi n'abandi bantu. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Ababwira ntya: «Mwandeerheraga oyu muntu bulaala mwaderhaga oku aliiri gurarusa olubaga. Namubazize embere zenyu aliko nyoono ntaacho namubwene ko chagarhuma ahanwa omu byooshi mwamusidakiire. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" /><char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> naye ntaacho amubwene ko, kwenge arhugaluliire ye. Ntaacho omu by'ajirire chagarhuma ayirhwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Boboola enyuma z'okumushuurha, namulikuula.» [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Ngasi lusiku lukulu lw'ePaasaka, Pilaato alikwaneene kubalikuulira omuntu muguma oli omu munyororo.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira by'eBibuliya.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Abantu booshi bayaamira chaligumira ntya: «Oyirhe oyu muntu! Orhulikuulire Baraaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraaba abaaga ashwekerwe elugulu w'entambala yabaaga omu gishagala n'okuyirha omuntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilaato ashuba kuderha nabo, kwenge alishondere alikuule Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Aliko boowe baalema bayaama ntya: «Omubambe oku musalaaba! Omubambe oku musalaaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilaato ababwira ntya obwa gasharhu: «Bubi buchi ajirire? Ntaacho namubwene ko chagarhuma ayirhwa. Enyuma z'okumushuurha, namulikuula.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Aliko bachihanda n'olwamo lunene, omu guhema abambwe oku musalaaba. Olwamo lwabo lunene lwahimana.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Buzinda, Pilaato arhegeka oku bibe nk'oku abantu baahemaga. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Alikuula ola bashondaga, wali wahirirwe omu munyororo elugulu w'obugome n'okuyirha omuntu; abaheereza Yeesu, bamujire nk'oku balonzaga.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abambwa oku musalaaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Matayo 27.31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:20-32">Mariko 15.20-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-24">Yohaana 19.17-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Abasoda b'aBarooma babeere bali baheeka Yeesu emunda bamuyirhira, bashimaanana n'omuntu muguma oyirikwa Simooni, w'egishagala ch'eKureene, waliiri gurhenga omu shwa. Baava bamurhoola n'okumuheesa omusalaaba mpu aguheeke enyuma za Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Olubaga lunene lw'abantu lwali kulikiire Yeesu. Ahagarhi kaabo haliiri abakazi baliiri balira n'oguchiniguula elugulu waage. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yeesu abahindamukira n'okubabwira ntya: «Mwe bakazi b'eYerusaleema, murhandiriraga. Aliko muchiilirire n'abaana benyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwenge esiku zayinjire abantu nji baderha ntya: ‹Bagishirwe abakazi b'engumba, zigishirwe enda zirhashubiraga kuburha n'amabeere marhashubiraga kuyonsa!› <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Amo mango, abantu nji barhondera okubwira emisozi ntya: ‹Murhurhogere ko!›, n'okubwira orhusozi ntya: ‹Murhuhambe!› <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Bulaala eyi bankajira ebyoola oku murhi mubishi, bichi nji byajirirwa omurhi guyuumire?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kandi, abasoda bali baheekere ebishumuusi bibiri, byaali byaaja kuyirhwa haguma na Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Babeere baagera ahantu hayirikwa Mpanga, bamubambira ahoola oku musalaaba, na bila bishumuusi bibiri, chiguma ekulyo n'echindi ekulembe.<figure style="fig" alt="Cruxifiction de Jésus sur la croix" file="WA03926b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.33">Kubambwa kwa Yeesu oku musalaaba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Yeesu aderha ntya: «Daarha, obababalire, kwenge barhamenyere echi bali baajira.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bindi bitaabu biguma bya miira by'eBibuliya.</char></note> Abasoda bagabaana emyambalo yaage omu kuyeesha esimbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Abantu baliyimangire ahoola, baanali baalola. Abarhegesi b'aBayaahudi boowe, bashinyagulira Yeesu, baderha ntya: «Achungwire abandi; agichungule yenyine, akaba ali <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, ola Nnamahanga agishogere!»<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Abasoda nabo baliiri bamushekera. Bayinja kumuha edivaayi y'enkala, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />n'okumubwira ntya: «Akaba oli mwami w'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char>, ogifumye wenyine!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Haliiri kandi elugulu waage ogu mwandiko: «Oyu ye Mwami w'aBayaahudi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Muguma omu bishumuusi bibambirwe oku musalaaba amudukanga ntya: «K'orhali we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>? Ochifumye wenyine onarhufumye!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Aliko echindi gishumuusi chakalihira echaabo ntya: «K'orhagwerhe chiro obuuba bwa Nnamahanga, wooyo weeri waahanwa kuguma naye? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Oku rhwewe, obuhane burhukwaneene, kwenge rhuli rhwayankirira egikwaneene ebijiro byeerhu. Aliko oyuula nta chibi n'echiguma ajirire.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ashuba kuderha ntya: «Yeesu, onyibuke hano nj'oja omu Bwami bwawe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yeesu amushubiza ntya: «<char style="w" lemma="Bibe ntyo:">Okuli</char>, nkubwirire, zeene waaba haguma naani omu Paradizo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paradizo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hali hantu abeera ba Nnamahanga balama embere zaage enyuma z'ogufa kwabo.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olufu lwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohaana 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Zaali zikola zashonda kuba saa ndarhu; haaba omwizimya oku gihugo chooshi kugera aha saa mwenda, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />kwenge ezuuba lyalihirimire. N'omwenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogo mwenda gwali gabire ahatagatiifu n'ahatagatiifu bweneene omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. Osome </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Lubunguluko 26.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:19-22">Baheburaniya 10.19-22</ref>.</char></note> gw'omu Nju ya Nnamahanga gwachisharhula ahagarhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeesu ayaama ntya: «Daarha, mpirire omurhima gwani omu fune zaawe.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 31:5-6">Nanga 31.5-6</ref>.</char></note> Amalire kuderha ebyoola, asimuuka.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Omukulu w'abasoda abeere abona ebyabeere, akuuza Nnamahanga n'okuderha ntya: «Okuli, oyu muntu aliiri okwaneene!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Abantu booshi balichigushire ahoola kulola kw'eyo myaazi, babwene ebyabeere, bagaluka emwabo n'amaganya manene.<verse eid="LUK 23:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Booshi baliyinji Yeesu, n'abakazi baliiri bamuherekeeze gurhengera eGalilaaya, bayimanga hale, baalola ebiri byaaba.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ahambwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohaana 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Haliiri mulume muguma oyirikwa Yozefu wahulukiraga eHarimateya, gishagala chiguma ch'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char>. Aliiri muntu mwinja onakwaneene, anagendaga alinga obwime bwa Nnamahanga. Aliiri muguma w'akabuga k'aBayaahudi, aliko arhaali yemereere omuhigo n'ebijiro byaabo by'okuyirha Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Aja emwa Pilaato, ahema omubiri gwa Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Aguyandagaza oku musalaaba, aguzingira kw'edaraape, aguhira omu shinda yajokolwaga omu baale. Mweyo shinda, mwabaaga murhashubiraga guhaabwa muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Olo lusiku, lwaliiri lwagarhaano, lo lwanaliiri lusiku l'ogurheganya <char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, n'eSaabato yali kola gurhondera.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Balaala bakazi baliiri barhengeere eGalilaaya haguma na Yeesu, bakulikira Yozefu. Baabona eshinda n'obulyo bahiraga mo omubiri gwa Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Bagaluka gurheganya amavurha n'amarashi. Olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Saabato:">eSaabato</char>, bahumuuka, gukulikirana n'eRhegeko lya Nnamahanga.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ogufuuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariko 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-13">Yohaana 20.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga eSaabato, bala bakazi baja ebwa shinda eseeziseezi, eyi baheekere amavurha m'amarashi bali barheganyize. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bashimaana ebaale lyalichingire eshinda lyahirikirwe eburhambi. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Baja mo, aliko barhabonaga omubiri gwa Nnaweerhu Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Babeere bali basoomerwa elugulu w'ebyabeere, ho n'aho balume babiri bayambeere emyambalo ebaraganyize babonekana embere zaabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Aboola bakazi bayuubaha bweneene, bayeerekeza amalanga maabo oku daho. Aliko aboola balume bababwira ntya: «Girhumire mwashondera ozeene omu bafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Arhali hano, afuukire! Muyibuke ebi ababwiraga amango alichiri eGalilaaya oku: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‹Bihemere <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ahaanwe oku banyabyaaha, abambwe oku musalaaba, anafuuke olusiku lwa gasharhu.›» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Abo bakazi baava bayibuka ebinwa byaage.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bagaluka gurhenga ebwa shinda, n'ebyoola byooshi babibalira entumwa ekumi na nguma n'abandi bigirizwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Aboola bakazi babibaliraga <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">entumwa</char> baliiri: Mariya w'eMagadala, Jaani, Mariya nyina wa Yakobo n'abandi baliiri haguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Aliko ebi binwa byabonekana oku meesho m'entumwa nka ntaacho bimalire, barhanabiyemeeraga. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Aliko Petero yeewe ayimanga, alibirhira ebwa shinda. Ayunamire, abona emyenda alizingirwe mo yonyine. Ava achigalukira emwage, eyi asomereerwe ebyabeere.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abonekera abigirizwa babiri omu njira ye Emawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mariko 16.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Olo lusiku lo n'olo, babiri omu bigirizwa ba Yeesu baliiri baaja omu gishagala chiyirikwa Emawu. Chaliiri oku bilomeetere byakagera kw'ekumi na chiguma n'eYerusaleema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Baliiri baganiira oku byooshi byazindaga kugera. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Babeere bali baganiira n'okubazana, Yeesu yenyine abayegeera n'okugenda haguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Aliko ameesho maabo maalihubizwe yi barhamumenya.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yeesu ababaza ntya: «Binwa bichi muli mwaganiira muli kulambagira?» Bayimanga eyi bagwerhe amaganya manene. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Muguma omu bo, oyirikwa Keleopaasi, amubaza ntya: «Ka wooyo wenyine omu balama eYerusaleema werhamenyere ebyabeere mw'ezi siku?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yeesu naye abaza bo ntya: «Bichi ebyo?» Bamushubiza ntya: «Ebiyerekeere Yeesu w'eNazareeti, ola waliiri muleebi w'obuhashe omu bijiro n'enderho embere za Nnamahanga n'embere z'olubaga looshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Leero, <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'abarhegesi beerhu nji bamuhaanire mpu ahanirwe olufu anabambwe oku musalaaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Rhwalinihiire oku yeewe ye wali wachungula Israheeli. Aliko leero haguma n'ebyo byooshi, zeene l'olusiku lwa gasharhu gurhenga ebyo bibeere. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Aliko kandi, abakazi baguma nabo b'echigusho cheerhu bali barhushalamize. Bali balamukiire zeene eseeziseezi oku shinda, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />aliko barhaali babwene omubiri gwage. Bamaava bayinja kuderha oku babonekeerwe na <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char>. Abo bamalahika bababwirire oku Yeesu ali mugumaguma. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Beerhu baguma balijiire oku shinda, banabugaanire ebintu nka okw'abakazi babiderhaga. Aliko yeewe, barhamubwene.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yeesu aja ababwira ntya: «Mwe bihwinja mwe! N'emirhima yenyu erhayemeerera ho byooshi abaleebi baderhaga! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ka <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> arhaalikwaneene alibuke ntyo y'aja omu bukuuze bwage?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yeesu ava abahuguula oku biri omu Mandiko Matagatiifu mooshi elugulu waage, gurhonderera oku bitaabu bya <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> n'ebyabaleebi booshi.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Babeere bayegeera egishagala baliiri baaja mo, Yeesu abonekana nk'owagendeerera n'olugenzi. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Aliko bamurhebeereza omu kuderha ntya: «Obeere haguma neerhu, kwenge bwayirire.» Ntyo ku Yeesu ajiire omu nju kubeera haguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Abeere ayikala kulya haguma nabo, arhoola omugati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="LUK 22:19">Luuka 22.19</ref>.</char></note> n'okugugisha, aguchagulanga n'okuguheereza bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ameesho maabo maaja mahumuulwa bwinja, baanaja bamumenya. Aliko ahirima embere zaabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Baabazana ntya: «K'emirhima yeerhu erhaliyunviirhe obushagaluke bunene amango aliiri aganiira neerhu omu njira n'ogurhuhuguulira eby'aMandiko Matagatiifu maderhere?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ho n'aho bayuumuka, bagaluka eYerusaleema. Babugaana zilaala ntumwa ekumi na nguma zichigushire haguma n'abandi bigirizwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Abo booshi, babwira bala bigirizwa babiri ntya: «Okuli Nnaweerhu afuukire, anabonekeere Simooni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Bala bigirizwa babiri baabala ebyaali bibahikiire omu njira, na gurhe barhegeeraga Yeesu amango achagulangaga omugati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu abonekera abigirizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohaana 20.19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Bala bigirizwa babiri babeere bali baderha ebyoola, Yeesu yenyine achiyeerekana ahagarhi kaabo n'okubabwira ntya: «Omurhuula gube haguma nenyu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Abigirizwa baashalama n'okuyuubaha bweneene, eyi bakengereere mpu babwene omuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Aliko Yeesu ababwira ntya: «Bichi birhumire mwayuubaha? Bichi birhumire mwaganganwa omu mirhima yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulole amaboko maani n'amagulu maani, okuli nyoono! Munmamaarhe munaloleereze. Omuzimu arhajira munyofu changwa egufa, nka kunoola mubwene mbigwerhe.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Omu kuderha ebyoola, abayeereka amaboko maage n'amagulu maage. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Abigirizwa basoomerwa n'ogushagaluka bweneene, n'obo babaaga barhaza kuyemeera echi babwene. Yeesu aja ababaza ntya: «Ka mugwerhe hano echintu ch'okulya?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Baamuha egichiira ch'efi eyoosezwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Agirhoola n'oguchilya embere zaabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Aja ababwira ntya: «Ebiila binababwiraga amango nali nchiri haguma nenyu. Byaalihemere bijirike byooshi byaali biyandikirwe elugulu waani omu <char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">Rhegeko</char> lya <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char>, omu bitaabu abaleebi bayandikaga n'omu gitaabu ch'eNanga.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ho n'aho, Yeesu abahunuula obwenge b'okuyunva aMandiko Matagatiifu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ava ababwira ntya: «Biyandikirwe oku <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> alibuka, n'oku afuuka omu bafu olusiku lwa gasharhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Kandi, omu ziino lyaage, abantu b'ebihugo byooshi gurhangirira eYerusaleema nji baabalirwa oku baleke ebyaaha byaabo yi bababalirwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Muli bahamiiriza b'ebyoola byooshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nyoono, nabarhumira echi Daarha alaganyaga. Mwabo, mubeere hanoola Yerusaleema kugera amango mwayankirira obuhashe b'ogurhengera empingu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu aheekwa empingu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mariko 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:4-14">Bijiro 1.4-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yeesu aheeka abigirizwa baage kugera hoofu n'egishagala ch'eBetaniiya. Ayinamula amaboko elugulu, abagisha. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Abeere ali abagisha, achikuula haguma nabo, aheekwa empingu.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus enlevé ciel" file="WA03935b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yeesu aheekwa empingu</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Abigirizwa boowe, bamalire kumuharamya, bagaluka eYerusaleema n'obushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Ngasi mango, baliiri omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> eyi banali bamukuuza.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>